<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">– KRX</book>
  <para style="h">LUK</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyya Luk naakiice ya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyya Luk naakiice ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luk</para>
  <para style="imt">Waah wa weeyem wa ti púkoo eyye</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyya Luk naakiice ya éyisanaayisan nii Yéesu ayem <char style="w">Afakana</char> ya éeyinananee ya ati <char style="w">Israyel</char> niŋ lompo Afakana ya ati pakan paka púlooŋ. Luk asok akalaŋaakalaŋ meemak ápimeyi pánipani ya ti Yéesu. Ekina nuutaakaa fiye ti pakiical. Pakiical empe Luk náayaañe akiic Teyofil, ásupiyenu ya eyem “Páhin pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa”.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyye eluwut eekiice yo ya, pale pasincanal pa píyisanaayisan nii Luk ákuuñana ya akiice yo. Luk aloomaaloom páhin niŋ apoñapoñ a Pool. Luk <char style="w">Asuwif</char> tom, naakiic yo lompo <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>.</para>
  <para style="is">Kikee kilim keetaake nafaa</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Ateeteyo</char> - Akina ayem Yéesu niŋ ekina tom Pútuun pa. Akina ayem ati waah wa púlooŋ uti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> - Lan óo lan la pakan paka nkacoone Pútuun pa pipiyeno amansa ya ateyii, cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa unca toko.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Eenucee ya</char> - Ekina eyem caacaw ca citi <char style="w">Afakana</char> ya niŋ Amansa ya aŋa <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkayeniye ya hítuulu ékey ya eteyoo. Nasokee lompo “Krista”.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fa púkoo ya neekiicee fa:</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref>
    </char> Heewune ha Luk naakiic.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5–2:52</ref>
    </char> Hipukuyee ha niŋ hiñiiyate ha hiti Saŋ-Patis niŋ Yéesu.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref>
    </char> Páhin pa piti Saŋ-Patis.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21–4:13</ref>
    </char> Pátise ya niŋ híluuŋuyee ha hiti Yéesu.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14–9:50</ref>
    </char> Páhin pa piti Yéesu ti mah ma miti Kalilee.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51–19:27</ref>
    </char> Pítin pa piti Yéesu púful Kalilee puwant Jerusalem.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28–23:56</ref>
    </char> Kunoom ka kikelan ka kiti Yéesu niŋ eket ya eteyoo Jerusalem.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref>
    </char> Pilito pa, éfulii ya niŋ pisilo pa piti Yéesu.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Heewune ha Luk naakiic</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1-2" />Awe Teyofil eñaap ya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1-2">keemeeŋe kacukaacuk niŋ ñíkinii eeha Pútuun pa mpíhine ha púlooŋ ti píyaañ eteeho toonii. Nkáyenoonii pikamana <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>. Keemeeŋe toonii nkayeno ho hikiicu samat nii fa nkakamane ho fa unii. <verse eid="LUK 1:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Kápiliŋ ti píyaañ waah ewwe fo ti pikelan, inci úwwincinoole heetaakiye púlooŋ. Ekina ewune, insok nii napaanap pikiici, awe Teyofil, pakiical peetempiye mpucoonool <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />aakati méyi nii eeha nkakalaŋanuu ha, hilim hiti pánipani.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ñáapukuma Saŋ-Patis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Ti caanak ca citi amansa ya aŋa nkasok a <char style="w">Helot</char> ati mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char>, intaako <char style="w">awaaseena ati Pútuun pa</char> aŋa nkasok Sakaliya ati kayoŋ ka kiti puwaaseena pa enka nkasok ka Apiya. Aaloo caacawoo Elisabet, náafulii ti miin ma miti <char style="w">Aaron</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Poko t’ésupakii <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> hátikin Pútuun pa, nkanapan pítin etempo, nkacok púlooŋ <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> fo muus. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Pale kataakut añii kamma Elisabet naayem caakonta, apan poko púlooŋ pamaamanal.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Hikee hinoom Sakaliya naayeno kaawaaseen la ti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> loho hinoom ha hiti kayoŋ ka kiteyii hícoliyoo. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Ti cosaan ya eti puwaaseena pa nkañako kaakaaw ti kamamal apiyeno aŋa afaanako ya ti <char style="w" lemma="Ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa">ekumpaan</char> ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa, la sampanee la, kati áluntan caminkoloŋ ya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Káaluntan ka kiñaŋaa íhinu hinoom óo hinoom ñésupak ti puwaaseena pa. Káaluntan ka nkíhineehin ti pututa kaaciin ka la sampanee la ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa. Ekina eyem píyisan pa piti kaluum ka kiti pakan etempo. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Waati ya eti káaluntan ka néetuuno, pakan paka púlooŋ nkayeno kaluum tíkitaaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />
    <char style="w">Maleekoo</char> ya eti Ateeteyo néefulii teyoo, episiiŋiyoo t’epees yáali eti <char style="w">kaaciin</char> ka la nkáluntan la. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Sakaliya naacuk yo naasuco naafe. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Maleekoo ya neesokoo: “Timpi fe Sakaliya, kaluum ka kitii kisayaneesayan, aali Elisabet afaataak añii aafaluwoo caacaw ence: <char style="w">Saŋ</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Afaayeno ti awe pásuuma penfakat, hícump pakan lompo efikataak pásuuma ti hipuku ha hiteyoo. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Afáayenoonii an eemaka ti Ateeteyo, añaŋut pálaani elaan niŋ pikee palaanal empa mpúkuman. Le niŋ afaapukee, afaameeŋ niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Afáañahanii pakan keemeeŋe pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> ti Ateeteyo Pútuun pa piteyii. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Afáanowii hátikin Ateeteyo ti kunuu niŋ ti sempe samat nii <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w" lemma="Elí ayaamakoola ya">Elí</char>, áfaañahanii ñífaaf ña kápisiyool niŋ epuukii, náañahanii kéeciita ka káakup ti pámiiloolal peenape, kati amemanool pakan paka ti Ateeteyo.” <verse eid="LUK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Sakaliya naacakan maleekoo ya: “Puume inci fáyini kameye eehuu? Inci oopa maamane aalam lompo sitiiloo séelaaŋane.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Maleekoo ya neesokoo: “Inci yem Gabriyel. Inci ninsiiŋo hátikin Pútuun pa, inci mpúpoñii píkey soki ekooŋan ya éesuume eyye. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Síitan, ti káyinanaati kilimam, putumi efipucok, áatiyini káakup fo ta eehe efihitaako. Pánipani kilim ka kutoom efikitaako incolaa toko.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Pakan paka nkayeno hítuulu ínnimii heewune Sakaliya náafiyoonii páhantuwa ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Emma náafulii ma ayinaat káakup neyii nkámeyi nii aŋe ácukiyoocuk waah páhantuwa ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa. Naayeno ínkaakupaati fo káakup niŋ sipees. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Lóokuŋ ya eti kaawaaseen ka kiteyoo ta nkipaye ta, naañoho t’enuuf.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Fiyiit aaloo Elisabet naasa munow naayolo nemmo páhantuwa fo kiim isak. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Naasok: “Fiye Ateeteyo náahinaam eehe, áfulanaam ti ñusuu ti pakan paka.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ñáapukuma Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Elisabet ti hiimoo hísakiyenu niŋ hoonool hiti munow, Pútuun pa mpúpoñii <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eyya nkasok ya Gabriyel ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char> ti saatee ya eti Naasalet. <figure style="fig" alt="Nazareth" file="HK00366B.TIF" size="col" loc="1:26-28" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="1:26">Saatee ya eti Naasalet</figure> <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Mpupoñ yo ti ámaacul a aŋa nkasok a <char style="w">Mari</char>, aŋa <char style="w">Josef</char> ati miin ma miti cáwii ca citi <char style="w">Dawid</char> naaŋaame ya ekop. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Maleekoo ya neenako la teyoo neesokoo: “Kásuumaay kiyeno niŋ awe, awe aŋa ataake ya pálafi pa piti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>. Ateeteyo oopa niŋ awe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mpásiyaloo kilim enkuu Mari naaliim naayeno ecakanoolo pakicanal puume mpaaw. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Maleekoo ya neesokoo: “Timpi fe Mari, áasuumaasuum Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Síitan inci pusoki, aafasa munow ímpukii ciñii cikampaani aakati luwoo caacaw ca Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Afaayeno an eemaka, afaayonkalee Añii ya ati Pútuun pa piti patiila. Ateeteyo Pútuun pa efipuwufanoo <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya eti amansa ya eti maamayoo Dawid, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />afaapampaŋan ti miin ma miti <char style="w">Jakob</char>, cáwii ca citeyoo eticipa.” <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mari naañahan yo: “Eehe puume nihiyina pitaako inci péemiit áyiin?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Maleekoo ya neesokoo: “<char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> éfikuwanoonii ti awe, sempe sa siti Pútuun pa piti patiila ínsikimpitooli, ekina ewune añii ya aŋa ankaakaay ya hipuku afaayeno eesampanee, naasokee Añii ya ati Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Sincan Elisabet atii ya aŋa nkasoke ya caakonta, ti himaamanoo oopa niŋ munow miti kiim isak niŋ hoonool miti cikampaani. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Méyi nii waah uheekut Pútuun pa.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mari naañahan yo: “Iyyoo, inci yem amiikan a ati Ateeteyo, hitaako ti inci samat nii fa ansoke fa.” Maleekoo ya neekaay.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hiyoop ha hiti Mari pati Elisabet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Ti kunoom enkuu <char style="w">Mari</char> naakaay mpacas ti saatee ya eti pítintiŋ pa ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char>, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />apinako la ti ekumpaan ya eti Sakaliya, naakican Elisabet. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Ta Elisabet náasiye ta Mari pakicanaloo añii ya naawen ti munowoo, Elisabet naameeŋ niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Naaceek apusok: “Awe Pútuun pa mpíhine heehaŋe ha panap ti pakaal paka púlooŋ, efi lompo píhin heehaŋe ha panap ti añii ya aŋa ankaakaay ya hipuku! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Puume inci ínnapiyenee fiye, íññaa ya ati <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> atoom kati mpáakeyyam hiyoop? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Sincan, emma inci ínsiye ma pakicanali añii aŋe ti munowam naawen ti pásuuma. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Aánapiyanee awe aŋa yínane ya ti eeha Ateeteyo mpusoke ha nii efihitaako.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hímulu Pútuun pa hiti Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />
    <char style="w">Mari</char> naaceek apusok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Yaanam émulaa <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>!<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47-49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47-49" />Kamma Pútuun pa mpítahii kunuu etempo ti inci amiikan a atempo ásikateen a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47-49">ekina ewune kunuuwam kimeeŋaa niŋ pásuuma ti Pútuun pa <char style="w">Afakana</char> ya atoom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:47-49">Kamma Pútuun pa piti sempe mpíhinaam waah wenfakat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47-49">ekina ewune, písik fíyooy pikaay pa púlooŋ efimpiyonkalam ati pásuuma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47-49">Caacaw etempo ceesampanee.<verse eid="LUK 1:47-49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Pitaakaataak paket hikaw ti keefeye po ka fo ti <char style="w">ekaay</char> óo ekaay.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Mpíyisan hamake ha niŋ epees etempo; mpihancalool kéemakiyanooliye ka ti pakan paka.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Mpúwananii pumansa pa ti pilemeyu pa piteyii, pale, mpíseepin písikateen pa.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Mpisiitan keeyeniye ka ti peep pa niŋ waah weenape, pale, mpiyaan keetaake ka kapuñoho sipeesii ñaanii.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Mpiyankanan amiikan etempo <char style="w">Israyel</char>, ti énawuno paket hikaw etempo.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Eehuu mpíyinanane símaama unaa <char style="w">Abraham</char> niŋ miin ma miteyoo fo caanak óo caanak.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mari naayeno pati Elisabet fo kiim káhaaciil apite añoho pateyoo.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ñáapukuma ña ñiti Saŋ-Patis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Púful toko, Elisabet íyyiŋooliyoo, náapukii cikampaani. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Pikinooloo niŋ miin ma miteyoo nkási nii <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> áhinoohin henfakat niŋ paket hikaw, nkananfool ti pásuuma pa piteyoo. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Añii ya ta naataake ta kunoom isak niŋ kíhaaciil nkákey <char style="w" lemma="Kanakan">kapinakanoo</char> ti písiyool empa Pútuun pa mpiliile pa niŋ maamaa ateyii <char style="w">Abraham</char>, nkálafiyoo kawufan caacaw ca citi faafoo Sakaliya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Elisabet naacoop hilim ha naasokii: “Haani! Caacawoo ciñaŋaa piyeno <char style="w">Saŋ</char>.” <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Nkasokoo: “Pale an aneetaat ti miin ma miti aluu aŋa ataake caacaw encuu.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Nkákup niŋ sipees, kapicakan faafoo enceyme caacaw náalafiye kawufan añiinoo. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Naasokii kawufanoo káakiicuma, naakiic: “Caacawoo Saŋ.” Pakan paka púlooŋ ínnimii. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Tokotoko putumoo mpípankino, híleeluufuyoo nihikatan, náayini káakup, náayaañ kaanimpan Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Ewatate enfakat neeyeno ti pikinoolii púlooŋ niŋ keekine ka ti pisaatee pa piti pítintiŋ pa ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char>, nkayeno káakup heetaakiye ha. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />An óo an éesiye ho naayeno káamiilool, naasok: “Añii aŋe, an puume naakaakaay piyeno?” Kaatuko sempe sa siti Ateeteyo siyenaayeno teyoo.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hímulu Pútuun pa hiti Sakaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Añii ya, faafoo Sakaliya naameeŋ niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> naayaamakool hiti Pútuun pa, apusok:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Unimpanaa <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa piti <char style="w">Israyel</char> kamma mpitahe kunuu ti pakan etempo mpifakanii.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Mpúpoñii unaa <char style="w">Afakana</char> eemaka ati miin ma miti amansa ya <char style="w">Dawid</char> amiikan etempo,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />eehuu <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa keesampanee ka nkátuunane unaa ti caacaw Pútuun pa ta infiyye<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />nii efipifakan unaa ti pikamool unaa niŋ ti sipees keenate ka unaa púlooŋ.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Mpíyisan símaama unaa paket hikaw, mpínawuno <char style="w">písiyool</char> etempo peesampanee pa,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />esintoolo eyya mpisintooliye ya ti maamaa unaa <char style="w">Abraham</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:73 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-3">Púcook 12:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:15-18">22:15-18</ref></char></note>:<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />nii, ta mpifakane ta unaa ti sipees pikamool unaa, éfuuyiniyaa po himiikanate peefeyut<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />nuuyeniyaa pimiikan keesampanee niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> hátikin etempo fo eket maama.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Awe añiinam lompo aafayonkalee ayaamakoola ya ati Pútuun pa piti patiila, kamma ankaakaay énowii hátikin Ateeteyo aapuwañaloo pítin pa,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />ti káyisanool pakan etempo kafakan ka ti kaaponket ka kiti umuuyen wa uteyii,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />kamma Pútuun pa putuunaa mpimeeŋe paket hikaw, ekina ewune aŋa eecaaŋe ya nii caanak céefulii áfaawanoonii ápikey unaa hiyoop,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />kati acaaŋan keeyem ka ti eloŋ ya eti ñáanim ña niŋ ti hísaalumant ha hiti eket ya, ápitintiŋan unaa ti pítin pa piti kásuumaay ka.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Añii ya <char style="w">Saŋ</char> náayankii, kunuuwoo nkítaakii sempe. Naayeno ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char> fo ta náafulii ta ti pakati Israyel.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Ñáapukuma ña ñiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ta <char style="w">Saŋ</char>-Patis naapukee ta, amansa ya enfakat a aŋa nkasok a Ookust náafulanii hilim nii an óo an ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Room</char> púlooŋ añaŋee hikiicu caacawoo. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Oom hikiicu hiyeniye híyaañ ta Kileños naayeniye ta ati hikaw ha ati <char style="w">Siriya</char>. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />An óo an naañoho ti saatee ya eti cosaan ya eteyoo apikaakiicee po.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />
    <char style="w">Josef</char> lompo náafulii ti saatee ya eti Naasalet ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char> apuwant mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> ti saatee ya eti amansa ya <char style="w">Dawid</char> eyya nkasok ya Betelehem, kamma akina lompo naayem ati miin ma miti maamaa ateyoo Dawid. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Apikaay hikiicu ha naacoopool <char style="w">Mari</char> aŋa naaŋaame ya ekop, aŋa eeyeniye ya immunow.<verse eid="LUK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ta nkayeniye ta po, íyyiŋooliyoo, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />náapukii ciñiinoo cíyaañ, cikampaani. Naakuupatanool co niŋ ñiseehu naahintanoo ti púus kamma nkataakut ékaap la efikawanan. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus in the manger" file="CNT5133a.png" size="col" loc="2:7" copy="Cook" ref="2:7">Yéesu ti púus pa</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaman ñáapukuma ña ñiti Afakana ya pufaasa pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Ti oom mah intaako ti ukit wa pufaasa keeyeniye efaas niŋ hánant písaacii pa piteyii. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" /><char style="w">Maleekoo</char> ya eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> néefulii teyii, ecaaŋ ya enfakat ya eti Ateeteyo néekinkoolii, ewatate enfakat neeyeno neyii. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Maleekoo ya neesokii: “Timpi nife, cóopiyoocoop aluu ekooŋan éesuume eti pásuuma penfakat piti pakan paka púlooŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Fíyooy pati saatee ya eti <char style="w">Dawid</char> ciñii cipukee po <char style="w">Afakana</char> ya, akina ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char>, akina lompo ayem Ateeteyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ehe píyisan empa efinikiiwoo pa tempo, eficanitook nkakuupatanoole ciñii niŋ ñiseehu nkahintan co ti púus.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Tokotoko kayoŋ kenfakat kiti pumaleekoo nkúfulii alacana nkinanf maleekoo ya nkiyeno kaanimpan Pútuun pa, nkiyeno hisoku: <verse eid="LUK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Umúlaa Pútuun pa piti patiila, kásuumaay nkiyeno t’etaam ti payenka mpitaake ka pásuuma etempo.” <verse eid="LUK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ta pumaleekoo pa mpuñohiye ta patiila pufaasa pa nkasokool: “Ukaayaa Betelehem hicuku heetaakiye ha, eeha Ateeteyo naasoke ha unaa.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Nkahiliikan, kapucol nkatook <char style="w">Mari</char>, <char style="w">Josef</char> niŋ ciñii ca ceehintanee ca ti púus pa. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ta nkacukoo ta nkayeno kakaman eeha maleekoo ya neesokii ha kiti añii ya. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Kéesiye ho ka púlooŋ ínnimii ti eeha pufaasa pa nkasokii ha. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Pale Mari naamank eehe púlooŋ ti kunuuwoo náamiilool ho meemak. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Pufaasa pa ta nkayeniye ta puñoho, nkayeno hímulu niŋ kaanimpan Pútuun pa kamma eeha nkásiye ha nkacuk samat nii fa maleekoo ya neesokii fa.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hiwasuyee ha hiti Yéesu caacaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ta naataake ta kunoom isak niŋ kíhaaciil, <char style="w" lemma="Kanakan">nkanakanoo</char> ti písiyool empa Pútuun pa mpiliile pa niŋ maamaa ateyii <char style="w">Abraham</char>, nkaluwoo caacaw ca Yéesu, samat nii fa <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya neesoke fa íññaa ateyoo peelokot asa munow.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kañoman ka kiti Yéesu ti Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Hinoom ha hiti kaakuulan ka kiti hipuku ha níhicolii, kaakuulan ka keekiice ka ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>. <char style="w">Josef</char> niŋ <char style="w">Mari</char> nkacoop ciñii ca <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> kápiyisanoo <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Inhínee nii heekiicee ha ti hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti Ateeteyo: “Niŋ añii áyiin ácook apukee añaŋee kañoman Ateeteyo.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Efúlii 13:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Kañaŋaa lompo kaawaaseen toko sílunt súsupak niŋ fotom múcuucuuku músupak samat nii fa insokee fa ti hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti Ateeteyo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Lewitik 12:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaayaamakool ka kiti Simeyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Intaako <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> akee áyiin caacawoo Simeyon. Ayíin <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">eecoonoole</char> naafe Pútuun pa, naayeno hítuulu aŋa akaakaay ékey kaapuuñanool <char style="w">Israyel</char>. <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkiyeno teyoo, <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />nkíyisanoo nii ataket akina peecukut <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Kunuu ka keenape ka nkítintiŋanoo apikaay pati hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>. Ta Yéesu pupukayoo nkácoopiyoo ta kati káhinoo eeha <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis fa nihisoke fa, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeyon naafenfo ciñii ca ti sipeesoo naanimpan Pútuun pa apusok:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29-30" />“Kamma inci incuke niŋ ñíkinam kafakan ka kitii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29-30">ekina ewune Ateeteyo, fiye aayina hikatu amiikan a atii apiket ti kásuumaay samat nii fa áyyinananaam fa;<verse eid="LUK 2:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />kafakan ka enka ammemanoole ka hátikin písii pa púlooŋ,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />ecaaŋ ya eyya éfeeyisan <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> Pútuun pa, néecoopii pakani Israyel hamake ha.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Ciñii ca faafoo niŋ íññaa ateyoo ínnimii ti keesokee ka kiti ciñii ca. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeyon naasampanii, naasok íññaa ateyoo <char style="w">Mari</char>: “Síitan, añii ya aŋe Pútuun pa pimamaloomamal kati ácoopii enow ya eti pakan keemeeŋe pakati Israyel niŋ piyito pa piti pakakee pakan keemeeŋe. Afaayeno píyisan pa piti Pútuun pa empa pakan paka nkakaakaay pa hipooku, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />kati áfulanii tíkitaaŋ pámiiloolal pa peeyoliye pa ti kunuu hícump pakan. Awe íññaa ateyoo lompo kúnuul efikiyeno ti yaani samat nii aŋa epaay neeyaye.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaayaamakool ka kiti Hanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Intaako akee aal <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> eemaamane caacawoo Hanna, faafoo Fanuwel, ati miin ma miti Asel. Apinimo ti áyiinoo fo sitiil isak niŋ súsupak, áyiinoo naaket. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Nene animiit, sitiiloo áwii epaakiil niŋ sipaakiil (84). Afúlantoo pati hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, náatuul po ti suŋ niŋ ti kaluum hánant niŋ hanakan. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Ti oom caanak, ápucolii teyii, naanimpan Pútuun pa, naayeno hisoku kiti ciñii ca hátikin keeyeniye ka púlooŋ hítuulu kafakan ka kiti <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyetu pa piteyii Naasalet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Ta <char style="w">Josef</char> niŋ <char style="w">Mari</char> nkapayoole ta fa ínhinee fa samat nii fa insokee fa ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>, nkayet <char style="w">Galilee</char> pati saatee ya eteyii Naasalet. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Añii ya náayankii niŋ sempe; naameeŋ ecohato, pálafi pa piti Pútuun pa mpiyeno teyoo.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akampaani ya Yéesu pati Ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Esúk óo ésuk Yéesu pupukayoo nkakaakaay <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char>. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ta naataake ta sitiil ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak, nkasilo Jerusalem pahaaño pa, samat nii fa cosaan ya eteyii neesoke fa. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Pahaaño pa pipipa nkayeno puñoho, akampaani ya Yéesu náatowoonii puson Jerusalem, pale pupukayoo kápannumut. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Incukii nii oopa ti pinamii, kapisapal fo hinoom púmpuluŋ, nkáyaañoo hiŋes ti pakanii niŋ ti pinapoolii.<verse eid="LUK 2:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Ta nkacukutoo ta nkañoho Jerusalem hiŋesoo. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ti hinoom ha híhaaciyenu ha nkalaŋanoo la ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> naayeniye niŋ pikalaŋana pa, apiyeno káasiitan teyii niŋ kaacakanoolii. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />An óo an éesiyoo ínnimoo ti kameye ka kiteyoo niŋ ti pañahanaloo. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Pupukayoo kapucukoo, nkaŋaŋo. Iññáa ateyoo naasokoo: “Añiinam, weyme ánhine unii fiye? Paapaa atii niŋ inci uliimaaliim meemak ti hiŋesi.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Weyme inniŋesam? Fo nímiit nii inci ñaŋaa piyeno ti ekumpaan ya eti Paapaa atoom?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Pale kásiit eeha náalafiyii ha hisoku.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Náawanoonii niŋ pupukayoo Naasalet, náatuulii. Iññáa ateyoo naamank enke púlooŋ cew ti kunuuwoo.<verse eid="LUK 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yéesu náayankii niŋ ecohatoyoo niŋ kaacecoo, Pútuun pa niŋ pakan paka nkálafiyoo pihaŋhaŋ toko.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Káatuunan ka kiti Saŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Ti sitiil kaat ya siti Tipel, amansa ya enfakat a ati mah ma miti <char style="w">Room</char>,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amansa ya enfakat a nasokee <char style="w">Sesaal</char>. Ti oom caanak, amansa óo amansa enfakat ati Room nasokee Sesaal.</char></note> Pons <char style="w">Pilaat</char> naayeno ati hikaw ha ati <char style="w">Judaay</char>, <char style="w">Helot</char> naayeno ati hikaw ha ati <char style="w">Galilee</char>, atuwoo Filip naayeno ati hikaw ha ati mah ma miti Itulaay niŋ Tilakonit, niŋ Lisañas ati hikaw ha ati Apilen. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Annas niŋ Kayif nkayeno <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pa kenfakat ka pakati Pútuun pa</char>. Ti oom caanak <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> níhicolii ti <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, Sakaliya añiinoo, pati <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Saŋ naayeno kaafiitanool mah ma púlooŋ meekole ma musuu ma miti Jordan, apiyeniyii káatuunan: “Níhin <char style="w">pátise</char> nípiyisan nii níwunkaawunko umuuyen wa utaaluu, Pútuun pa kati puponket wo aluu.” <figure style="fig" alt="John the Baptist in the desert" file="LB00296B.TIF" size="col" loc="3:3" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="3:3">Saŋ-Patis ti káahaaŋ ka tes</figure><verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Samat nii hilim ha heekiice ha ti púkoo ya eti <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w">Esayi</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">“An oopa ti hiceeku ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes,</char> </char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">'niwañal pítin pa piti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char></char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">nicoonanool ñítin ña ñiteyoo.</char>
    <verse eid="LUK 3:4" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />
    <char style="qt">Eliiŋoon óo eliiŋoon efeehokanee,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">tíntiŋ óo tíntiŋ niŋ cítintiŋ óo cítintiŋ éfipitamiyanee.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">Ñítin ña ñeeŋoncalooliye ña efiñicoonanoolee, </char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">ñítin ña ñiti pínankiin pa efiñiteecanoolee.</char>
    <verse eid="LUK 3:5" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />
    <char style="qt">Pakan paka púlooŋ efikacuk kafakan ka kiti Pútuun pa.'”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Esayi 40:3-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="LUK 3:6" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Saŋ naasok kayoŋ ka kéekeyii ka kati áhinii <char style="w">pátise</char>: “Aluu mifepa emmuu! Ayme ákupanane aluu kati nitey paseeña pa piti Pútuun pa peeyem pa ti ékey? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Níhin waah weenape samat nii enuun eyya nepuk papukal peenape. Fiyuu éfiyisan nii níwunkaawunko umuuyen wa utaaluu. Timpi níyaañ esokoolo nii: 'Unaa ufakaafak kamma <char style="w">Abraham</char> naayem maamaa ati unaa.' Kaatuko inci pusok aluu háati ti pínankiin empe Pútuun pa píyiniyini éfulanii epuuk pakati Abraham. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ehe hinahaane ha nihihintanee ti ñínkonk punuun pa. Enuun óo enuun eepukut papukal peenape efeefiitee neewantee ti seemak.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Kayoŋ ka nkicakanoo: “Puume unii éfuuhin?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Saŋ naañahanii: “Niŋ an ataakaa kúsool kúsupak añaŋaa káapaacinool niŋ aŋa ataakut ya, aŋa ataake paliyal añaŋaa lompo íhinu fo.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" /><char style="w" lemma="Asayoola kúncoo">Pisayoola kúncoo</char> ya lompo nkákey kati káhinee pátise nkacakanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, puume nuuñaŋe íhinu?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Naasokii: “Timpi nisa pihaŋ la pakati Room nkasoke la aluu.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Pusoocaali lompo nkacakanoo: “Unii puume nuuñaŋe íhinu?” Naañahanii: “Timpi nicoop mañ miti an ti sempe aluu, timpi ninook an kamma mañ, nileh ti cooy ya eti aluu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Pakan paka púlooŋ nkayeno hítuulu man hikee efihitaako, nkayeno ecakanoolo ti kunuuwii man Saŋ ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Saŋ naañahanii poko púlooŋ: “Inci niŋ man inci ínhin aluu pátise. Pale, aŋa eeyem ya ti ékey ahaŋaam sempe, túuniit fala kákopin ñikopu ña ñiti pisamata pa piteyoo. Akina áfaahin aluu pátise niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> niŋ seemak. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Kaahelu ka kiteyoo unka ti epeesoo kati ákatinool pakak pa niŋ éheeni ya. Naamank pakak pa la ti pileefaan pa piteyoo, pale afaasowan éheeni ya ti seemak seehokiyantoo.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Niŋ kikee kilim keemeeŋe Saŋ naaluum pakan paka kápuwunko umuuyen wa uteyii náatuunanii ekooŋan ya éesuume ya.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Pale, Saŋ nawatanwatan Helot Antipas, ati hikaw ha ati Galilee, kamma naalame Helotiya atuwoo aaloo, niŋ waah wa púlooŋ ewwa náahine wa weekance wa. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Tempo Helot naapenane eehe: naakul Saŋ ti ékuluma.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pátise ya eti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ta hícump pakan nkáhinee ta <char style="w">pátise</char>, Yéesu lompo náahinee pátise, naaluum. Ta naayeniye ta kaluum, patiila ímpankino, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" /><char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkúwanoonii teyoo, niŋ enii samat nii hícuucuuku. Hilim níhifulii alacana: “Awe yem añiinam, aŋa inci íllafiye ya; ti awe inci intaake pásuumayam.” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus' Baptism" file="CNT5171a.png" size="col" loc="3:21-22" copy="Cook" ref="3:22">Pátise ya eti Yéesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu símaamayoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yéesu ti máamun sitiiloo áwii niŋ ŋaasuwan náayaañe páhin pa piteyoo. Incukii nii akina ayem <char style="w">Josef</char> añiinoo, Josef ati Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli ati Matat, Matat ati Lewi, Lewi ati Meleki, Meleki ati Yannay, Yannay ati Josef, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Josef ati Matacas, Matacas ati Amos, Amos ati Nahum, Nahum ati Esili, Esili ati Nakay, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nakay ati Maat, Maat ati Matacas, Matacas ati Semeyin, Semeyin ati Yosek, Yosek ati Yota, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yota ati Yowanan, Yowanan ati Lesa, Lesa ati Solopapel, Solopapel ati Salatiyel, Salatiyel ati Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neli ati Meleki, Meleki ati Adi, Adi ati Kosam, Kosam ati Elematam, Elematam ati Eel, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eel ati Yesus, Yesus ati Eliyesel, Eliyesel ati Yolim, Yolim ati Matat, Matat ati Lewi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lewi ati Simeyon, Simeyon ati Juda, Juda ati Josef, Josef ati Yonam, Yonam ati Eliyakim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakim ati Meleya, Meleya ati Menna, Menna ati Matata, Matata ati Natan, Natan ati <char style="w">Dawid</char>, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dawid ati Yesaay, Yesaay ati Yopet, Yopet ati Powas, Powas ati Sala, Sala ati Naason, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Naason ati Aminatap, Aminatap ati Atimin, Atimin ati Alini, Alini ati Hesilon, Hesilon ati Fales, Fales ati <char style="w">Juda</char>, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Juda ati <char style="w">Jakob</char>, Jakob ati <char style="w">Isaak</char>, Isaak ati <char style="w">Abraham</char>, Abraham ati Telah, Telah ati Nahol, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahol ati Seluk, Seluk ati Leyu, Leyu ati Pelek, Pelek ati Epel, Epel ati Selah, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Selah ati Kayinam, Kayinam ati Aapakusat, Aapakusat ati Sem, Sem ati Nowe, Nowe ati Lemek, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lemek ati Metuselah, Metuselah ati Enok, Enok ati Yelet, Yelet ati Mahalaleel, Mahalaleel ati Kenan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenan ati Enos, Enos ati Set, Set ati <char style="w">Ataam</char>, Ataam ati Pútuun pa.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Híluuŋuyee ha hiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yéesu naameeŋ niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>, náafulii ti musuu ma miti Jordan. Kunuu ka keenape ka nkiyeniyoo kátintiŋan pati <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Naayeno po fo kunoom áwii ésupak, <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya ti hiŋes híluuŋuyoo. Aliit waah ti oom kunoom púlooŋ, ti pikelan, peep mpucokoo.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Seetaani ya neesokoo: “Páawoo awe yem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa, sok énankiin eyye eyeso hímpuul.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yéesu naañahan yo: “Kiiceekiic ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nii: <char style="qt">'An ataloŋ niŋ hímpuul lamma.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Kakaman 8:3</ref> </char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Seetaani ya neecoopoo patiila la haane, néeyisanoo mpacas cáwii ca citi púlunta pa púlooŋ. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Neesokoo: “Inci fawufani kayine enke púlooŋ niŋ hamake ha hiti cáwii ca, kaatuko inci nkuwufanee, yíniyini kawufan etenko an óo an aŋa ínsuumaam. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Fiye, náakilipiyaa hátikinam ti hímulu, efikiyeno púlooŋ kitii.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yéesu naañahan yo: “Kiiceekiic nii: <char style="qt">'<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa pitii aññaŋe ékilipo hátikin etempo, apan pikina lamma aññaŋe kaawaaseen.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Kakaman 6:13</ref></char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Seetaani ya néetintiŋanoo <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. Neesiiŋanoo la haŋe la pahaan ti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>. Nene esokoo: “Páawoo awe yem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa, fúl le cípo t’etaam. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Kamma inkiicee nii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">
    <char style="qt">'Efipusok <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> etempo pimankooli;</char>
    <verse eid="LUK 4:10" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />
    <char style="qt">pumaleekoo pa éfipiseepini niŋ sipees etempo,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">
    <char style="qt">eeha efihiwun ha kooti etikulooŋoolo ti énankiin.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Kícimu 91:11-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yéesu naañahan yo: “Kiiceekiic nii: <char style="qt">'Aañaŋut puwinko Ateeteyo Pútuun pa pitii.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Kakaman 6:16</ref></char></note>” <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Ta Seetaani ya neepaye ta hiŋes híluuŋuyoo ha púlooŋ, neekatanoo fo ti cikee caanak.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Píyaañ páhin pa piti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Toko fúle, Yéesu naañoho ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char>, niŋ pameeŋ sempe sa siti Pútuun pa séefulii sa ti <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>. Pakan paka nkáyaañ káakup kiteyoo ti pisaatee pa púlooŋ péekinkoolii pa. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Naayeno kakalaŋan ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa piteyii, pakan paka púlooŋ nkayeniyoo hímulu.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus teaching at the synagogue in Capernaum" file="LB00244B.TIF" size="col" loc="4:15-16" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="4:15">Ta Yéesu naayeniye ta kakalaŋ hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa ti éluumuma eti Pusuwif</figure><verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hipookuyee ha hiti Yéesu Naasalet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Púful toko, Yéesu naakaay Naasalet pa náakulee pa. Ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> kiti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa naanako ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya eteyii samat nii fa naasale fa íhinu. Naalito apisiiŋo kati akalaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Nkañaakanoo kaahit ka kiti <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w">Esayi</char>. Apúpoonin ko, naacuk la inkiicee la:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />
    <char style="qt">“Kunuu ka kiti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> unka ti inci</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">kamma nkimamalaam</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">kati túunan ekooŋan éesuume ti keeleke ka.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">Kúpoñiyaampoñ kati kaman keekulee ka nii éfikafulii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">niŋ kéefuume ka nii éfikañohoonii ti hicuku,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">kati fúlan keekallanee ka ti kúnuul, </char>
    <verse eid="LUK 4:18" />
  </para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />
    <char style="qt">inkaman etiil eyya Ateeteyo áfaayisan pásuum pa piteyoo.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Esayi 61:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="LUK 4:19" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Naapoon kaahit ka naañaakan ko áhina ya naacaayeno. Keeyeniye ka ti éluumuma ya púlooŋ cew ñíkinii iññiya teyoo. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Náayaañ hisokuyii: “Fíyooy, <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa">heekiicee</char> eehe hitaakiyaa ti pásiyal aluu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Pakan paka púlooŋ nkákup héesuume teyoo, ínnimii ti kilim ka kéesuume ka kéefulii ka ti putumoo. Nkacakan: “Fo aŋe tom ayem <char style="w">Josef</char> añiinoo?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yéesu naasokii: “Híiniyaamhiini nii efinifinam ti kusoku enke: 'Akúuñana kúuñanoolo! Hín le ti saatee ya etii, samat nii eeha núusiye ha ánhine <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char>.'”<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Naapenan hisokuyii: “Pánipani, ayaamakoola asayanantee ti saatee ya eteyoo. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Píhiiniyan aluu nii ti caanak ca citi ayaamakoola ya <char style="w" lemma="Elí ayaamakoola ya">Elí</char>, etiil ya enuput fo sitiil síhaaciil niŋ kiim isak niŋ hoonool, épankul neeyeno ti mah ma púlooŋ. Tempo, intaako piyaaŋat peemeeŋe <char style="w">Israyel</char> payenka pákayiinii keekete. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Pútuun pa pupoñut Elí ti akee ti payenkuu, pale ti ekee eyaaŋat aŋa áyiinoo eekete ati saatee ya eti Salepat pukol saatee ya eti Siton.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:7-24">1 Pumansa 17:7-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Ti caanak ca citi ayaamakoola ya Elise, intaako lompo kayoŋ púkuuña pakati <char style="w">kanuk</char> ti mah ma miti Israyel, pale háati oonool teyii akuulanutee fo Neeman lamma ati <char style="w">Siriya</char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Pumansa 5:1-14</ref></char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Pakan paka púlooŋ keeyeniye ka ti éluumuma ya, kiiñii nkili ta nkásiye ta enke fiye. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Nkayito, nkáfulanoo ti saatee ya. Nkacoopoo patiila kanaac cítintiŋ ca la saatee ya neelutee la, kati káhalapiyoo t’etaam. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Pale Yéesu náanapii ti pututa kayoŋ ka naakaay pítinoo.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hiyaanu hísaalumant seetaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Capernaum" file="HK00368B.TIF" size="col" loc="4:30-31" copy="Knowles" ref="4:31">Saatee ya eti Kafaanawum</figure> Yéesu náawanoonii <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char>, saatee eti <char style="w">Galilee</char>, naayeno kakalaŋan pakan paka ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> kiti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Innímii ti pakalaŋanaloo, kamma hilim ha hiteyoo nihitaake sempe.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Intaako la ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya áyiin aŋa <char style="w">hísaalumant</char> <char style="w">seetaani</char> nihinakiye. Náaceekii niŋ kaawiiluyoo: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Katan unii! Weyme uyem ti pututa unaa, Yéesu ati Naasalet? Fo áakeyyookey aakati púcalool unii? Inci méyimeyi awe yem ayme: Eesampanee ya ati Pútuun pa!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yéesu naafet teyyo: “Fatan! Fúlii teyoo!” Hísaalumant ha nihitah áyiin a t’etaam hátikin pakan paka púlooŋ, níhiful teyoo peekuumutoo.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Pakan paka púlooŋ nkaŋaŋo nkayeno picakanool: “Hilim eehe, hilim puume? Ti kayine niŋ sempe nasok kísaalumant ka kúfulii, nkúful!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Kiti Yéesu nkísiyo ti pisaatee pa péekinkoolii pa púlooŋ.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan ka kiti keemeeŋe ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yéesu ápufulii la ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya naanako la ti ekumpaan ya eti Simon. Simon aasonoo aal naayeno niŋ káakuuñu kiti pasowe-enii kenfakat. Nkaluum Yéesu apiyankananoo. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Naañeeho toko teyoo naafet ti pasowe-enii ya mpúful. Tokotoko náalitoonii, naawasii kapili.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ti panowal caanak ca, pakati káakuuñu óo káakuuñu nkácoopiyee ti Yéesu, naalemp sipeesoo ti an óo an teyii, náakuuñanii. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" /><char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">Kísaalumant</char> lompo nkúfulii ti pakan keemeeŋe, nkiyeno hiceeku: “Awe yem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa!” Pale naafet tenko naakit ko káakup kamma nkimeya nii akina ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Cipilap, Yéesu naañako apiyeno lamayoo. Kayoŋ ka nkiyeniyoo hiŋes, ta nkútookiyoo ta la naayeniye la, nkílafiyoo hicoku timpi akatanii. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Pale naasokii: “Inci ñaŋaa káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> ti pikee pisaatee pa lompo, heewune ha inci ímpoñiyee.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Naayeno káatuunan eteeho ti púluumuma pa piti <char style="w">Judaay</char>.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Kamamal ka kiti Yéesu pinapanayoo pákayaañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Hikee hinoom Yéesu naasiiŋo la ti kantant ka kiti han ha hiti Kennesalet<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hikina lompo nihisokee han ha hiti Kalilee.</char></note>, kayoŋ ka nkikincooloo kipiyeno káasiitan <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Akee acalafayya, caacawoo Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char>, naayeno pukol han ha. Pákawiyoo picalafayya <char style="w">Saak</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, Sepete epuukoo, nkayeno lompo toko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk akiicaakiic kikee kilim enke ti 5:10.</char></note>. Picalafayya pa payenkuu, ñiteen ña ñiteyii ñúsupak ña iññisiiŋo ti kantant ka, kápuwanoonii teñño nkayeno puñowu picala pa piteyii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:2">Ti káasiiŋuma enkuu, Yéesu naacuk ñiteen ña, <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />náayuuko ti piteen pa piti Simon, naasokoo: “Fúlan po le ti kantant ke, teeŋan po caahinkiŋ,” naayeno tempo apiyeno kakalaŋan kayoŋ ka.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ta naapaye ta káakup, naasok Simon: “Wanan piteen pa pati kásul ka innitah picala pa piti aluu nípicokii soon.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simon naañahanoo: “Aápunu, unii uyokaa hánant ha púlooŋ ti calafayi ucokut waah. Pale niŋ aasokaa fo, inci fatah picala pa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Nkatah po nkácokii hícump soon fo picala pa piteyii mpíyaañe pihaaco. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Nkakaaween pákawiyii keeyeniye ka ti pikee piteen kápikey kapiyankananii, nkákey nkameeŋan ñiteen ña ñúsupak ña púlooŋ fo íññilafiye híseemu.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simon Piyeer, ta naacuke ta eehuu, náakilipo ti Yéesu wootoo naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, láaŋam, inci áyiin amuuyena!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Kaatuko Simon niŋ pákawiyoo kaŋaŋaaŋaŋo ti hícump soon ensa nkacoke sa. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Saak niŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char> lompo nkaŋaŋo. Yéesu naasok Simon: “Timpi fe, písik fíyooy pakan ankaakaay hicoku.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Nkáciŋii, nkafaakal ñiteen ña ñiteyii, nkatah toko waah óo waah, nkanapan Yéesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan áyiin ati kanuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Hikee hinoom Yéesu naayeno ti ekee saatee, intaak áyiin ati <char style="w">kanuk</char>. Niŋ pacukaloo Yéesu, naanow hátikinoo, puhooŋuyoo t’etaam naaluumoo: “Ahámpaatiin, áayiniyaamyini kaakuulan, niŋ áalafiyaa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yéesu náañaakanii epeesoo náalikoo, naasokoo: “Inci láfilafi. Kuul!” Tokotoko kanuk ka nkikatanoo. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yéesu naakitoo hisoku eteeho an: “Kaay cáayisanoolo <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya ati Pútuun pa</char>, niŋ fúlaa toko uwwaaseen kaawaaseen ka kiti kaakuulan ka enka <char style="w">Móyiis</char> naasoke ka,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lewitik 14:1-32</ref></char></note> áapiyisan pakan paka nii aakuulanee-kuulan.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Háati fo, kiti Yéesu nkihaŋ toko nkísiye, uyoŋ pakan núuconcoolii ti káasiitanoo niŋ ékuuñano úkuuñu wa uteyii. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Pale Yéesu nañakoñako ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>, naayeno po kaluum.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan áyiin éehute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Hikee hinoom Yéesu ti kakalaŋan, <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> nkáfulii pan óo pan ti misaatee ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char>, miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> niŋ <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, nkayeno toko. Sempe sa siti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> insiyeno ti Yéesu kati ákuuñan kéekuuñe ka.<verse eid="LUK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Tempo, pakakee pákayiin kéekantoonii áyiin éehute ti kahun nkácolii. Nkayoopoo kanakan ti ekumpaan ya kati kahintanoo hátikin Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Pale kataakut pítin piti kanakanoo kamma kayoŋ ka. Nkasilo neyoo ti kankalaŋ ka nkátiŋin káatiŋu nkáyuuŋaniyoo toko niŋ kahun ka kiteyoo ti pututa pakan paka hátikin Yéesu. <figure style="fig" alt="Paralytic lowered through roof" file="LB00305B.TIF" size="col" loc="5:18-19" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="5:19">Káayuuŋanee ka kiti páhut pa</figure><verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Ta Yéesu naacuke ta káyinan ka kiteyii, naasok éehute ya: “Awí, umuuyen wa utii uponketee.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha niŋ Pufalisaay pa nkáyaañ káamiilool ti faŋii: “Aŋe an puume naacokooliye fo kati ateñal Pútuun pa? Ayme ayina kaaponket umuuyen wa fo niŋ neetaat Pútuun pa lamma?” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yéesu náameyi eeha nkayeniye ha káamiilool naacakanii: “Weyme uwune innitaak pámiiloolal empuu ti saan aluu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Weyme uhaŋe pásuum hisoku: 'Umuuyen wa utii uponketee', niŋ ekina tom hisoku: 'Lito inkaay'? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Fiye fáyisan aluu nii inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, taakaataak kayine t’etaam kiti kaaponket umuuyen wa.” Fiye naasok éehute ya: “Inci pusoki, lito! Coop kahun ka kitii, iyyet t’enuuf.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Tokotoko naasiiŋo hátikinii, náaseepin kahun enka nahinto ka tenko, naayet t’enuuf ti hímulu Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Pakan paka púlooŋ ínnimii nkámul Pútuun pa. Ewatate neemeeŋii nkayeno hisoku: “Ucukaacuk fíyooy heetaapala hicukee.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaayonkal ka kiti Lewi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Púful toko, Yéesu naakaay naacuk <char style="w">asayoola kúncoo</char> ya aŋa nkasok a Lewi, naayeniye ti ésayuma kúncoo ya. Yéesu naasokoo: “Nápaniyam.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lewi naalito, naakatan waah óo waah, naanapanoo.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Lewi, ti kánapiyan Yéesu, naayonkaloo hili káciim kenfakat ti ekumpaan ya eteyoo, intaako toko kayoŋ kenfakat kiti pisayoola kúncoo ya niŋ pakakee pakan keeyeniye hili neyii. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Pale <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> nkayeno káakumutool ti pinapana pa pakati Yéesu, nkasokii: “Weyme innili, innilaan nantoonool niŋ pisayoola kúncoo ya niŋ pumuuyena pa?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Pakan paka tom keeyem ka kásuumaayii kasoolahe ákuuñana, pale kéekuuñe ka. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Inci kéyyoot kaayonkal <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> ka, pale pumuuyena pa kati káwunko umuuyen wa uteyii.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kacakan ka kiti suŋ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Pakakee pakan nkasok Yéesu: “<char style="w">Saŋ</char>-Patis pinapana pa pakateyoo nkaloomloom suŋ niŋ kaluum, fo lompo incuke ti pinapana pa pakati <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa, pale pakatii paka nkatowo ti hili niŋ pálaani.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Fo éfiniyini hiwasu pakan suŋ kéeyonkaliyee pahaaño piti esa, loho asaya ya oopa neyii? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Pale caanak unca ti ékey, asaya ya áfaafulanee teyii, ti oom kunoom efikasuŋ.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Naasokii lompo hícantiitu eehe: “An ahaacantoo cifaal ti hísool héeyeeni kati apap co ti hísool heemaamane. Niŋ áhinaa fo, afaahaac hísool ha héeyeeni ha, niŋ fúlaa toko cifaal ca céefulii ca ti hísool ha héeyeeni ha eticinapool niŋ hísool ha heemaamane ha. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />An ánuŋantoo pucoma wiiñ ti upaŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kapaŋ keecifee keeyina hiwasuyee tenko wiiñ niŋ fotom man niŋ ekina tom miin.</char></note> weemaamane. Niŋ áhinaa fo, pucoma wiiñ ya éfipifapan upaŋ wa, wiiñ ya neeniiso, upaŋ wa núupucaloolo. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Pale pucoma wiiñ ti upaŋ wéeyeeni nénuŋee. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />An atasiikan wiiñ eeyanke náalafi pucoma, kamma wiiñ eeyanke neehaŋoo pásuum.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yéesu Ateeteyo ati hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Hikee <char style="w" lemma="Hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka">hinoom hiti kayeno</char> kiti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, Yéesu naayeno kaafiitanool ukit weesukee tewwo waah weenakoole nii uli, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkayeno kaasuutal ulat nkahenkecal wo niŋ sipeesii nkayeno wo hili. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Pakakee ti <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkasokii: “Weyme inniyem ti íhinu héehinantee ha ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Fo nikalaŋut eeha <char style="w">Dawid</char>, amansa ya, náahine ha akina niŋ pákawiyoo ta peep pa mpucokii ta?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Samiyel 21:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Anakaanako ti ékuut ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa, náacoopii kúmpuul ka keesampanee ka. Apili ho, naawun pákawiyoo, ántuŋ kúmpuul enkuu <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> lamayii kóŋ nkañaŋe ko hili.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yéesu nene asokii: “Inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, yem <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ati hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Hikee <char style="w" lemma="Hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka">hinoom nene hiti kayeno</char>, Yéesu naanako ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya eti Pusuwif pa apiyeno kakalaŋan. Intaako toko áyiin aŋa epeesoo yáali éehute. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Páawoo <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> kayenaayeno hiŋes waah ewwa efikanook newwo Yéesu, nkayeno kaasincan teyoo man áfaakuuñan ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Pale Yéesu náameyi pámiiloolalii naasok áyiin a ati epees ya éehute ya: “Lito insiiŋo hátikin pakan paka.” Ayíin a naalito naasiiŋo. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yéesu naasokii: “Inci picakan aluu, eeheyme hicoonee ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka: íhinu heenape fo íhinu heenaput, kafakan eloŋ fo káapucalool eteyyo?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Naasincanii púlooŋ cew, nene asok áyiin a: “Pántin epeesi.” Ayíin a náahin fo, epeesoo neeñoho toko pitempo tak.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Pale Pufalisaay pa niŋ pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha, kiiñii nkili meemak, nkáyaañ piteŋenool puume éfikahin Yéesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kamamal ka kiti pupoñapoñ pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ti oom kunoom Yéesu naakaay pati tíntiŋ ya kaluum, naapa hánant ha púlooŋ ti kaluum Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Ta incilape ta, naayonkal pinapana pa pakateyoo naamamal teyii ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak, payenka efikayeno <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa pakateyoo. Poko kayem: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simon aŋa naawufane ya caacaw ca <char style="w">Piyeer</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ti kaŋ ya eti Kilek, Piyeer, ekina eyem “énankiin”.</char></note> niŋ atuwoo Andre, <char style="w">Saak</char>, <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, <char style="w">Filip</char>, Paatolomaay, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Máciya, Tomas, Saak ati Alifaay, Simon aŋa nkasok a Selot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Selot, ti caanak ca citi Yéesu, yenaayeno kayoŋ keeyeniye esuum kiti mah ma miteyii.</char></note>, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yutas ati Saak, niŋ Judas Iskaliyot, aŋa akaakaay ya hífulu ti Yéesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan niŋ káakuuñan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Púful toko, Yéesu náawanoonii ti tíntiŋ ya niŋ keeyeniye ka neyoo, naasiiŋo la etaam ya neetempanooliye la. Kayoŋ keemeeŋe kiti pinapana pa pakateyoo nkiyeno toko niŋ hícump pakan kéefulii <char style="w">Judaay</char>, <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> niŋ kéefulii ti pisaatee pa piti kantant ka peeyem pa Til niŋ Siton. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Kákeyyookey káasiitanoo niŋ kati kákuuñanee úkuuñu wa uteyii. Payenka <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> nkiyokane nkákuuñanee. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />An óo an ti kayoŋ ka naaŋes hílikuyoo kamma sempe ínsifulii teyoo ínsikuuñanii púlooŋ.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hiyihu niŋ hitahu kunuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yéesu naasincan pinapana pa pakateyoo naasok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Niyihaayih, aluu keeleke ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">kaatuko <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> citaaluu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Niyihaayih, aluu keeyem ka fiye ti peep pa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">kaatuko efinisiitanee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Niyihaayih, aluu keeyem ka fiye ti pukooŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">kaatuko efinilenken.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Niyihaayih, niŋ pakan kanataa aluu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">nkaŋay aluu, nkateñal aluu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">nkákup ti aluu heenaput kamma inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />“Niŋaañaa ti oom hinoom, ninuunuutool ti pásuuma, kamma kawun kenfakat nkiyem ti hítuulu aluu alacana. Kaatuko fiyuu símaamayii nkáhine <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Pale kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu! - aluu keetaake ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">kaatuko nisayaasa kaapuuñanool ka kiti aluu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu! - aluu keesiite ka fiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">kaatuko efiniyeno ti peep.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu! - aluu keeyem ka ti caalenken fiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">kaatuko efiniyeno ti weeŋoot innikooŋ.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu! - niŋ pakan paka púlooŋ kákupaa ti aluu heenape.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">Kaatuko fiyuu símaamayii nkáhine keeneetaat ka piyaamakoola pánipani.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pálafi pikamooli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Yéesu nene asok: “Pale inci pusok aluu, aluu keeyemam ka ti káasiitan: Nílafi pikamool aluu, níhin heenape ti payenka keenate ka aluu. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Nisap lúwa payenka nkañan ka aluu, niluum Pútuun pa heenape payenka nkakancool ka niŋ aluu. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Niŋ an ahankuu kapal ti kaawiilu, ufanoo kikee ka lompo apinene ahanki tenko kapal. Niŋ an alamaa hísool ha hitii henfakat ha, timpi kitoo hicoopu eeha lupo páhantuwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />An óo an eeluumuu, uwwunoo, niŋ an acoopaa waahi timpi cakanoo wo. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Níhin pakan paka samat nii fa ínnilafiye fa kati nkáhin aluu.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Niŋ nílafiyaa kéelafiye ka aluu, enkeyme kaapuuñanool innikaakaay hitaaku? Háati pumuuyena pa nkálafilafi kéelafiyii ka. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Niŋ níhinaa heenape ti payenka nkáhin ka aluu heenape, enkeyme kaapuuñanool innikaakaay hitaaku? Háati pumuuyena pa nkáhinhin fo. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Innimaakaa payenka incuke ka aluu nii efikañahan aluu, eyyeyme cooy innikaakaay hitaaku? Háati pumuuyena pa nkamaakmaak pumuuyena pa kati kañahanii memma nkamaakii ma. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Pale nílafi pikamool aluu, níhin heenape teyii, innimaakii, timpi nímiilool hitaaku kañahan teyii. Inníhinaa fiyuu, Pútuun pa efipuwun aluu kawun kenfakat niŋ fúlaa toko efiniyeno epuuk Pútuun pa piti patiila, kamma mpinape ti keesokantoo ka apalaka niŋ ti keenaput ka. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Nitaak paket hikaw samat nii fa Paapaa ati aluu eeyem ya alacana naataake fa paket hikaw.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káahinaati kíiti an</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Yéesu nene asok: “Timpi níhin kíiti pakan, Pútuun pa lompo étipihin aluu kíiti. Timpi niwufan pakan umuuyen, Pútuun pa lompo etipuwufan aluu umuuyen. Niponketii, Pútuun pa lompo efipuponket aluu. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Niwun, Pútuun pa lompo efipuwun aluu, mpúnuŋ ti uhuuy wa uti aluu eniiku eemeeŋanee looc, neepimpee, neewenee, neemeeŋanee fo eniisaloolo. Kaatuko efipiniik aluu niŋ eniiku eyya inniniike ya pakan paka.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yéesu naasokii lompo hícantiitu eehe: “Fo káafuumiin náyiniyini kátintiŋan áwiyoo káafuumiin? Fo etikanow poko t’ésupakii ti kaayeen? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Akalaŋa ahaŋut akalaŋana ya ateyoo, pale an óo an eekalaŋe meemak afaacuk nii akalaŋana ya ateyoo.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Weyme uwune annincuk cíheeni ca ceeyem ca ti níkin atii ya, awe péepannumut hifiin ha heeyem ha ti níkini? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Puume ayyina hisoku atii ya: 'Atoomuu, túulam inci púfulani cíheeni ca ceeyem ca ti níkini,' awe aŋa eeyinaat ya hicuku hifiin ha heeyem ha ti níkini? Awe nícuf, yáañ fúlan hifiin ha ti níkini, tempo áafayini hicuku picaaŋ cataŋ aakati yíni káfulan cíheeni ca ceeyem ca ti níkin atii ya.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enuun niŋ papukal eteyyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Yéesu nene asok: “Enuun eenape epukantoo papukal peenaput, fo lompo incuke enuun eenaput epukantoo papukal peenape. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Enuun óo enuun ti papukal eteyyo nekiiwee. An átayini hicutu sootoo ti usooy uti pícankun, papukal wiiñ lompo pucutantee ti nikota. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />An eenape, náfulaniifulan ti yaanoo waah weenape. Pale an eenaput, náfulaniifulan ti yaanoo waah weenaput. Kaatuko heemeeŋ ha ti yaan an, hikina nákup.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti sikumpaan súsupak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Yéesu nene asok: “Weyme uwune inniyonkalam '<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>, Ateeteyo,' apan níhinantoo eeha inci insok ha? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />An óo an éekeyii ti inci náasi pakalaŋanalam apan náahin po, inci fáyisan aluu niŋ weyme naanakoole. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Anakoolaa-nakool nii an aŋa eeyem ti kulut ekumpaan: awakaawak fo súni naasiiŋan ekumpaan ya eteyoo ti énankiin. Esáacin néefulii niŋ sempe, man ma immisap teyyo pale miyinaat yo káyiyiŋan kamma neelutee pinap. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Pale an a aŋa ásiye ya pakalaŋanalam apan áhinut po, anakoolaa-nakool nii an aŋa eeyem ti kulut ekumpaan ti esiya peewakut t’etaam. Man ma immisap teyyo, neehaaŋ ti enow neehancaloolo púlooŋ cew.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Káyinan kiti áhampaatiin asoocaali ati Room</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Ta Yéesu naapaye ta káakup púlooŋ hátikin pakan paka, naanako saatee ya eti <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char>. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Intaako toko akee ti ñíhampaatiin pusoocaali ati <char style="w">Room</char>, eetaake amiikan ati hikawoo éekuuñe meemak fo alohan putum eket. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Náasi kiti Yéesu, naapoñ pakakee ñíhampaatiin <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> kapica kaluumoo ápikey ákuuñan amiikan a ateyoo. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ta nkacole ta ti Yéesu nkaŋiiniyoo meemak: “Asoocaali ya aŋe añaŋee kayankanan meemak, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />kaatuko álafilafi pakan unaa niŋ fúlaa toko akina alute <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya eti le.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Fiye, Yéesu naanapool neyii. Ta naalohane ta ekumpaan ya, áhampaatiin a asoocaali ya ati Room náapoñii pákawiyoo kapusok Yéesu: “Ahámpaatiin, timpi yokanoolo écolii pe t’inci kamma inci íntuuniit aapinako ti ekumpaan ya etoom. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ekina lompo ewune inci míiloolut nii ñaŋaa ékey puu ti awe, pale sok hilim hoonool lamma, amiikan a atoom áfaakuuñanee. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kaatuko inci himuumam ti sipees áhampaatiin iyyem, pusoocaali lompo nkáyemi ti sipeesam. Niŋ inci sokaa aŋe 'kaay', naakaay; insok aŋe 'kéy', náakey. Insok amiikan a atoom 'hín fiye', náahin fo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Ta Yéesu náasiye ta eehe ínnimoo, teyoo náayesoonii ti kayoŋ ka keeyeniyoo ka kanapan, naasokii: “Inci pusok aluu, inci taapala cuk káyinan ka kenfakat enke, háati ti pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Ta Yéesu naapaye ta hisoku eehe, payenka áhampaatiin a asoocaali ya naapoñe ka nkañoho. Kapucol nkatook amiikan a kásuumaayoo.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kayitan akampaani ati eyaaŋat aŋa áyiinoo eekete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Púful toko Yéesu naakaay ti saatee ya eyya nkasok ya Nayin, pinapana pa pakateyoo niŋ kayoŋ kenfakat nkanapool neyoo. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Fiye, ta naalohane ta putum pa piti saatee ya, nkayeno hicoopu ehunuŋ ti íhokuma. Eekete ya, akampaani, akina lamayoo íññaa ateyoo naataake, áyiinoo eekete. Kayoŋ kenfakat kiti saatee ya nkiyeno neyoo. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Iññáa ateyoo naayeno pukooŋ. <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> apucukoo, inketoo teyoo ti hikaw, naasokoo: “Timpi kooŋ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Naaloh pisaapu pa, náalik po, keetiyye po ka nkasiiŋo. Yéesu naasokoo: “Akampaani, inci soki: 'Lito!'” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Aŋa eekete ya náalitoonii, naayeno, náayaañ káakup, Yéesu naacoopoo naañahanoo íññaa ateyoo.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Kayoŋ ka púlooŋ nkimeeŋ niŋ ewatate nkúmul Pútuun pa nkusok: “<char style="w">Ayaamakoola</char> enfakat áfuliyoo ti unaa. Pútuun pa pítahiyoo kunuu ti pakan etempo.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Hiti Yéesu eehe, níhisiyo ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> púlooŋ niŋ ti pisaatee pa púlooŋ péekinkoole yo pa.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pinapana pakati Saŋ-Patis pati Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Ti písiyo pa piti Yéesu empuu, <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkakamanoo eehe púlooŋ. Naayonkal teyii pákasupak, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />naapoñii ti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> kapica kacakanoo: “Fo awe yem Aŋa eeyem ya ti ékey? Niŋ ekina tom, fo uñaŋaa hítuulu akee?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Kapucol ti Yéesu nkasokoo: “Saŋ-Patis ápoñii unii ti awe upucakani: 'Fo awe yem aŋa eeyem ya ti ékey? Niŋ ekina tom, fo uñaŋaa hítuulu akee?'”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Ti oom caanak, Yéesu náakuuñan hícump pakan keeyoke niŋ úkuuñu weemeeŋe, niŋ payenka <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> nkúwuuliye, náahin úfuumiin weemeeŋe upucuk. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Fiye, Yéesu naañahan payenka Saŋ náapoñii ka, naasokii: “Niñoho nica nikaman Saŋ eeha innicuke ha niŋ eeha ínnisiye ha: kéefuume ka unka ti hicuku, payenka nkanow ka niŋ efank unka ti pikaayu, pakati <char style="w">kanuk</char> ka nkakuulanee, keecotiye ka unka ti hísiyu, keekete ka nkálitaniyee, ekooŋan ya éesuume ya néetuunanee keeleke ka. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Ayihaayih, aŋa eepookut a hitaaku káyinan kamma inci.” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus talking to the crowed about John the Baptist" file="CNT5291a.png" size="col" loc="7:23-24" copy="Cook" ref="7:23">Ta Yéesu naayeniye ta káakup niŋ kayoŋ</figure><verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Payenka Saŋ náapoñii ka, ta nkakaaye ta, Yéesu náayaañ káakup ti kayoŋ ka kiti Saŋ, naasokii: “Weyme innikaaye pati <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char> kaasincan? Fo haasuwa eeha eyam ya nesapalool? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Niŋ fotom, weyme innikaaye po hicuku? Ayíin eewasiye wañ weewalla? Haani! Payenka nkawaso ka wañ wa wéeciita wa hinoom, nkayeno ti eloŋ enfakat, unka ti pukumpaan pa piti pumansa pa. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ooto weyme innikaaye po hicuku? <char style="w">Ayaamakoola</char>? Ee ayaamakoola! Inci pusok aluu nii ahaŋaahaŋ ayaamakoola. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Saŋ akina ayem aŋa <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nihikiice ya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="qt">'Inci fápoñii ati ekooŋan ya atoom apunowi hátikin </char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="qt">kati awañali pítin pa.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malaki 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="LUK 7:27" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />“Inci pusok aluu, taakut an aŋa aal naapuke eehaŋe Saŋ; pale aŋa éetinee ya ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>, ahaŋoohaŋ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Pakan paka púlooŋ kéesiye ka enkuu, háati <char style="w" lemma="Asayoola kúncoo">pisayoola kúncoo</char> ya, kacoonaacoon nii Pútuun pa <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">peecoonoole</char>. Ta Saŋ naayeniye ta káatuunan ekooŋan ya eti Pútuun pa, nkacoon ápihinii <char style="w">pátise</char>. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Pale <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis nkapook eeha Pútuun pa mpílafiye ha teyii; kacoonut Saŋ ápihinii pátise.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yéesu naasokii: “Niŋ weyme inci iyyina kaakufumool <char style="w">ekaay</char> ya eti fíyooy? Niŋ weyme neenakoole? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Enakoolaa-nakool nii epuuk keeyeniye ti híliŋ nkayeno kaaceeceekool:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">'Uhapaahap aluu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">nikiiyut,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">nuucook aluu kícimu kiti keeŋoot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">nikooŋut.'<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />“Kaatuko, Saŋ-Patis ákeyyookey, aliyantoo hímpuul, alaanantoo elaan innisok: '<char style="w">Hísaalumant</char> hiyem neyoo.' <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, ínkey pilli illaan innisok: 'Nisincan! Aŋuu an eekase, núkumana, áwii ati pisayoola kúncoo niŋ pumuuyena.' <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Pale ecohato ya eti Pútuun pa, keecoone yo ka púlooŋ káyisanaayisan nii tooñaa.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaaponket kiti aal amuuyena la ti ekumpaan ya eti Afalisaay a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />
    <char style="w">Afalisaay</char> akee, aŋa nkasok Simon, naayonkal Yéesu hili káciim pateyoo. Yéesu naakaay, naanako la ti ekumpaan ya eti Afalisaay a naayeno hili. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Intaako toko ti saatee ya aal amuuyena. Náasi nii Yéesu oopa ti hili pati ekumpaan ya eti Afalisaay a. Ta náasiye ta eehuu, naacoopool cílumpa ceewalla kaameeŋ munucu méesuume haaw. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Naasiiŋo puson woot Yéesu, naayeno pukooŋ, náayaañ káamaañiyan wootoo niŋ mukunoo, naatoot wo niŋ wanoo, naasump wootoo, naanuc wo niŋ munucu méesuume haaw. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Afalisaay a aŋa ayonkale ya Yéesu hili káciim, apucuk eehuu, naasokoolo: “Niŋ pánipani áyiin aŋe <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char>, añaŋaa kameye aal puume ayemoo ti híliku, aal amuuyena!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yéesu naacoop hilim ha naasokoo: “Simon, taakaataak eeha inci iññaŋuu hisoku.” Simon naañahanoo: “Sokam, Ahámpaatiin.” <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Taakaataak pákayiin pákasupak keetaake ñikopu ti akee áyiin eelontiyii mañ. Akee ya naataakoo nikopu sikoofali sikeme isak (500), akee ya lompo nikopu sikoofali áwii ésupak niŋ ŋaasuwan (50).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: <char style="w" lemma="tenali">sitenali</char> sikeme isak (500) niŋ sitenali áwii ésupak niŋ ŋaasuwan (50).</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Pale háati oonool teyii ayinaatoo mo kañahan. Fiye, naaponket poko t’ésupakii ñikopu ña ñiteyii. Ti awe, ayme ti payenke t’ésupakii afaahaŋ pálafi aŋa eelontiyii ya mañ ma?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simon naañahanoo: “Ti pacukalam, akina ayem aŋa nkaponkete ya nikopu na nenfakat na.” Yéesu naasokoo: “Aasokaa páni.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Apipa, náayesoonii pati aal a, naasok Simon: “Aacukaacuk aal a aŋe, emma inci ínnakoonii ma le ti awe, aawunutam man puñow wootam, pale akina náamaañiyan wootam niŋ mukunoo, naatoot wo niŋ wanoo. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ta inci ínnakoonii ta le ti awe, aawananutam niŋ hisumpu, pale akina áyekuniit hisumpu wootam. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Aanucut hikawam niŋ munucu, pale akina, naanuc wootam niŋ munucu méesuume haaw. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Síitanam inci pusoki, pálafi pa piteyoo penfakat pa píyisanaayisan nii umuuyen wa uteyoo weemeeŋe wa upayeepa kaaponket. Pale an óo an aŋa nkaponkete caahinkiŋ, caahinkilis lompo nálafi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Fiye, Yéesu naasok aal a aŋuu: “Umuuyen wa utii uponketee-ponket.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Keeyeniye ka toko hili neyoo nkáyaañ pusokool: “Aŋe ayem ayme, fo kati aponket umuuyen?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Pale Yéesu naasok aal a: “Káyinan ka kitii kifakanuu, kaay niŋ kásuumaay.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Pakaal paka, kanapan ka kiteyii Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Púful toko Yéesu naayeno kaamuusool ti pisaatee niŋ misaatee, káatuunan niŋ kakaman ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>. <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">Pupoñapoñ</char> pa pakateyoo ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka nkayeno neyoo, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />niŋ lompo pakakee pakaal payenka náakuuñane niŋ payenka naayaane teyii <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char>: <char style="w">Mari</char> aŋa nkasok a Mari ati Makatala aŋa náafulanii ya teyoo kísaalumant isak niŋ kúsupak; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yowanna, áyiinoo aŋa nkasok a Husa, eeyeniye ya ati hikaw ha ti éhinuma ya eti <char style="w">Helot</char>; Suusaana niŋ hícump pakakee pakaal, niŋ mañ ma miteyii nkayeno kayankanan Yéesu niŋ pupoñapoñ pa pakateyoo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti ataha piyooseen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Hikee hinoom, kayoŋ kenfakat nkuconcool niŋ pakan kéefulii ti pisaatee peemeeŋe nkíkey ti Yéesu. Ti káasiiŋuma enkuu, Yéesu naasokii hícantiitu eehe: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Taakaataak akee áyiin aŋa eekaaye etah piyooseen. Akina ti kaawiisan etukal ya, ekee etukal ya neenowal ti pítin pa; neekakalee, pusuwa pa mpili yo. <figure style="fig" alt="Farmer sowing seed" file="LB00094B.TIF" size="col" loc="8:4-8" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="8:5">Ayíin eeyem ti etah piyooseen</figure> <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ekee ya neenowal ti etaam eti pínankiin; niŋ páŋantalii eteyyo neesuucan, kamma etaam ya néecihut. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Ekee etukal ya neenowal ti pícankun, épiŋantoolii ti coonool niŋ pícankun pa, pícankun pa mpikincool yo. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Fiye, ekee etukal ya neenowal ti etaam eenape, eyyuu néeŋantii neepuk ulant, kaalant óo kaalant nkupuk papukal keme.” Yéesu naasokii niŋ hiceeku: “An óo an eetaake kaanuu kiti káasiitan, ásiitan.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Heewune ha Yéesu nákup niŋ hícantiitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Ta Yéesu naapaye ta káakup, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkacakanoo weyme hícantiitu eehuu nihisoke. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Naañahanii: “Aluu niwufaneewufan kameye ka kiti heeyolee ha ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>, pale ti pakakee paka niŋ kícantiitu inci ínkup, samat nii <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w">Esayi</char> fa naasoke fa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="qt">'Nkasincan-sincan pale kacukantoo; </char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="qt">Nkásiitan pale kámeyiyantoo.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Esayi 6:9</ref> </char>
    </note>”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káacenkin ka kiti hícantiitu ha hiti ataha piyooseen pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Yéesu nene asok: “Ehe, eeha hícantiitu ha nihisoke ha: Etukal ya eyem <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Etukal ya eenowale ya ti pítin pa ecukaacuk nii payenka nkási ka hilim ha, <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya néekey néefulan ho ti saanii, ancuk timpi káyinan nkafakanee. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Etukal ya eenowale ya ti etaam ya eti pínankiin pa ecukaacuk nii payenka nkasayan ka hilim ha niŋ pásuuma niŋ kásiyaa ho, pale hilim ha hitaakut ñínkonk teyii. Káyinanii kifiyyantoo, ti caanak citi páciite nkañoho puson. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Etukal ya eenowale ya ti pícankun pa ecukaacuk nii payenka nkási ka hilim ha, pale ti eloŋ ya eteyii káamiilool ka niŋ hisaanumate ha niŋ pásuuma pa piti eloŋ ya mpikincoolii mpikitii hitaaku papukal peeyane. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Pale etukal ya eenowale ya ti etaam ya eenape ya ecukaacuk nii payenka nkási ka hilim ha nkayenan ho pinap ti saanii seekuule sa, nkamukut fo cákapukii samat nii fa kaalant nataak fa hícump ulat.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti lampi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Yéesu nene asok: “An acaaŋanantoo lampi náawuf teyyo epool niŋ fotom naanakan yo t’etaam ecunkun, pale nawaŋwaŋ yo ti esafu, ancuk an óo an éenakoonii naacuk ecaaŋ ya.<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />“Fo lompo incuke, waah óo waah weeyolee éfuufulaniyee tíkitaaŋ, waah óo waah wéewufaloolee éfuuwufinee, núufulaniyee tíkitaaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />“Ooto, nitah kunuu ti pásiitanal aluu. Kaatuko an óo an eetaake afaapenanee meemak; an óo an eetaakut, háati aŋa incukoo ya nii naataake efeesayee teyoo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ miin ma miteyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Púful toko, Yéesu íññaa ateyoo niŋ pakatuwoo nkákeyyoo hicuku, pale kayinaatoo hicuku kamma kayoŋ ka.<verse eid="LUK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Nkasok Yéesu nii: “Iññáa atii niŋ pakatuwi unka kasiiŋiye tíkitaaŋ, kápilafiyi hicuku.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Naañahanii: “Iññáa atoom niŋ pakatuwam poko kayem payenka nkásiitan ka <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nkáhin ho fa nihiñaŋee fa íhinu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaasiiŋan ka kiti Yéesu hítaapanu eyam ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Hikee hinoom Yéesu náayuuko ti piteen niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo, naasokii: “Ufiitanaa ti kikee kaapii ka kiti han ha.” Nkañak. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Ta nkayeniye ta kaafiitan, Yéesu naalam hiŋotu. Hítaapanu eyam néesapii ti han ha, piteen pa mpiyeno émeeŋanii man, nkayeno ti páciite penfakat. <figure style="fig" alt="Boat in storm" file="LB00213B.TIF" size="col" loc="8:22-25" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="8:23">Piteen ti hiyam</figure><verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Ti oom páciite, pinapana pa nkaloh Yéesu nkáyiyaloo, nkasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin! Ahámpaatiin! Efuuketaa!” Yéesu náayiyoonii naafet ti hiyam ha niŋ kúsuh ka kenfakat ka nkapilan niit. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Púful toko naacakanii: “Káyinan ka kiti aluu unkey?” Ewatate neemeeŋii, ínnimii, nkayeno picakanool: “Ayme ayem áyiin aŋe? Kati nasok hiyam ha niŋ kúsuh ka kapilan, nkásiyoo?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan áyiin ati kísaalumant</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Púful toko, Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo nkaciŋ ti mah ma miti Kelasen,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Náasiyaa Kelasen, ekina eyem pakan paka pakati saatee ya eti Kelasa. Pikee pakiical pa piti Kilek mpusok Kelasa, pale pikee pa lompo mpusok Katala. Katala niŋ Kelasa pisaatee peekufut ti mah emmuu.</char></note> meeyem ma ti púcoonool mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char>. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ta Yéesu naayeniye ta éyuukinoyii ti piteen pa, áyiin ati saatee ya náakey kapaakoolanoo. Ayíin a aŋuu <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> kúwuuliyoo, afiyaafiyo awasiyantoo wañ, akinut ti ekumpaan fo ti kúhokuma ka. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28-29" />Nkuloomooloom íhinu apihiñ, háati nkacenk sipeesoo niŋ wootoo niŋ ñiseel kati kafaasoo, naacutal ño, kísaalumant ka nkítintiŋanoo ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>. Ayíin a ta naacuke ta Yéesu naaceek, naanow ti wootoo, náaceekii ti kaawiiluyoo: “Weyme állafiye ti inci, Yéesu, Añii ya ati Pútuun pa piti patiila? Inci luumuu timpi kallanam!” Asokaasok eehe, kamma Yéesu naafete ti kísaalumant ka, apusok ko kúfulii teyoo.<verse eid="LUK 8:28-29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yéesu naacakanoo: “Caacawi puume?” Naañahanoo: “Caacawam 'Kayoŋ',<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Caacaw ence ti kaŋ ya eti Kilek Lesiyon cikina ciyem kayoŋ kiti pusoocaali síwuli isak niŋ yoonool (6,000).</char></note>” kamma kísaalumant keemeeŋe nkinakiyoo. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Nkiŋiino Yéesu timpi awant ko ti seemak. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Inhemool koolee enfakat eti pícalukun neeyeno kaahoon ti kanaac cítintiŋ. Kísaalumant ka nkiŋiino Yéesu apikatan ko kipinako ti pícalukun pa, naakatan ko. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Nkúfulalii ti áyiin a, nkinakalo ti pícalukun pa, koolee ya néeliiŋoonii mpacas patiila cítintiŋ ca, neenow ti han ha néeseem.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Ta keeyeniye ka efaas ya nkacuke ta heetaakiye ha nkatey ti saatee ya niŋ ti misaatee ma méekinkoolii ma kakaman pakan paka heetaakiye ha. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Fiye, pakan paka nkákey kaasincan heetaakiye ha. Nkácolii ti Yéesu nkatook áyiin a aŋa kísaalumant ka nkúfulii ya teyoo náasooliye niŋ kunuuwoo cononon naayeno ti woot Yéesu. Ta nkacuke ta eehuu nkameeŋ niŋ ewatate. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Keecuke ka heetaakiye ha nkayeno kakaman pakan paka puume áyiin a aŋa kísaalumant ka nkúfulii ya teyoo fa náakuuñanee fa. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Púful toko, pakan paka púlooŋ pakati mah ma miti Kelasen nkaluum Yéesu akatanii apikaay, kamma ewatate enfakat neeyeniye neyii. Yéesu náayuuko ti piteen pa, áñakum <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />áyiin a aŋa kísaalumant ka nkúfulii ya teyoo naaluum kanapanoo, pale Yéesu naayaanoo, naasokoo: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Ñoho ti enuufi inkaakaman eeha púlooŋ Pútuun pa mpíhinuu ha.” Ayíin a naakaay ti saatee ya púlooŋ, naayeno kakaman eeha Yéesu náahinoo ha.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amáacul eekete niŋ aal éekuuñe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Pakan paka púlooŋ nkayeno hítuulu Yéesu ti kikee kaapii ka kiti han ha, ta náañohoonii ta, kayoŋ ka nkuwananoo. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ehe, intaako áyiin aŋa nkasok Yayil áhampaatiin ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya. Náakey naanow ti woot Yéesu, naaŋiiniyoo apikaay pati enuuf ya eteyoo <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kamma añiinoo ámaacul oonool a lamma eetaake máamun sitiil ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak naayeniye ti putum eket.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Ta Yéesu naayeniye ta pikaayu pateyoo kayoŋ ka nkikincooloo. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Intaako toko aal eeyeniye hicuku etaam eefiitantoo fo sitiil ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak, náapucalool mañoo púlooŋ ti púkuuñana pale an ayinaatoo káakuuñan. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Náakey puson Yéesu, náalik hileelu hísool ha henfakat ha hiteyoo, tokotoko etaam ya eteyoo neesiiŋo. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yéesu naacakan: “Ayme álikaam?” Pakan paka púlooŋ nkalaaco, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, kayoŋ ka kúconcooliyoo-concool nkikincooli.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Pale Yéesu naasok: “An álikaamlik kaatuko méyimeyi nii sempe sífulaaful ti inci.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Aal a náameyi nii eeha náahine ha hiyoliit, náakey niŋ kakikilan, náakilipo ti woot Yéesu. Naakaman hátikin pakan paka púlooŋ heewune ha náalik Yéesu niŋ fa náakuuñanee fa tokotoko. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Añiinam káyinan ka kitii kúkuuñanuu. Kaay niŋ kásuumaay.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yéesu ti káakup, an náafulii pati ekumpaan ya eti Yayil áhampaatiin a ati éluumuma ya, naasokoo: “Añiini ámaacul aketaaket, timpi yokan fiye Ahámpaatiin a.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yéesu niŋ pásiyaloo eteeho naasok Yayil: “Timpi fe, yínan lamma, añiini afaayeno kásuumaayoo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Fiye Yéesu naakaay, naanako lati ekumpaan ya eti Yayil. Acoonut an apinako neyoo fo Piyeer, <char style="w">Saŋ</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saak</char>, niŋ añii ya faafoo niŋ íññaayoo. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Pakan paka púlooŋ nkayeno pukooŋ niŋ esampoolo, Yéesu naasok: “Níyekuno pukooŋ pa kaatuko aŋe aketut, hiŋotu naayaake.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Nkayeniyoo caalenken kamma nkameya nii añii ya aketaaket. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Pale Yéesu náasik epees añii ya naayonkaloo, naasokoo: “Añiinam, íiyo!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Yaanoo néeñohoonii naahaaŋ ti piyito. Yéesu naasokii kawufanoo apili. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Pupukayoo ínnimii pale Yéesu naakitii hisoku heetaakiye ha an.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Kúmpoña ka kiti pupoñapoñ pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yéesu naayonkal nantoonool <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa pakateyoo ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka, naawufanii sempe niŋ kayine kiti hiyaanu <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> ka púlooŋ niŋ káakuuñan úkuuñu. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Púful toko, naapoñii kapikaay káatuunan <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> niŋ káakuuñan púkuuña. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Naasokii: “Ti pítin pa piti kaakaawool ka timpi niyekan waah: Hikasap tom, epootak tom, hímpuul tom, mañ tom, háati hísool hísupiyenu. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Niŋ ninakiyaa ti ekumpaan, inniyeno toko fo ta éfiniful ti oom saatee. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Niŋ pakan kawananut aluu, nihank haafol ha ti woot aluu nípiyisanii nii Pútuun pa efipisapii, ínniful ti oom saatee.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Pupoñapoñ pa pakateyoo nkakaay, nkanako ti misaatee ma kapiyeno káatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya niŋ káakuuñan pakan paka pan óo pan.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paliima pa piti Helot Antipas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Heetaakiye ha púlooŋ nihicol ti kaanuu <char style="w">Helot</char> Antipas, ati hikaw ha ati <char style="w">Galilee</char>. Naaliim meemak kamma pakakee paka nkayem ti hisoku nii <char style="w">Saŋ</char>-Patis álitaniyee ti keekete ka, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />pakakee paka nkasok <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w" lemma="Elí ayaamakoola ya">Elí</char> himuumoo áñohoonii<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Malaki 4:5</ref></char></note>, pakakee paka nkasok akee ti piyaamakoola pa keefiyye ka álitoonii ti keekete ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Pale Helot naasok: “Saŋ, inci himuumam mukoo ta inci impoñii ta kapifiit hikawoo. Aŋe akina ayem ayme, aŋa inci iyyem ya ti hísiyu kiteyoo?” Naaŋes hicuku Yéesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kákuumanee ka kiti pákayiin síwuli isak (5,000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Yéesu, <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa pakateyoo kápuñohoonii nkakamanoo eeha nkáhine ha. Naacoopii kapiñako lamayii ti saatee ya eyya nkasok ya Petesayit. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Pale kayoŋ ka kípipannumoo, nkinapanoo. Yéesu naawananii, naayeniyii káakup kiti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>, náakuuñan keesoolahe ka ékuuñano.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Cípiniimo, pupoñapoñ pa pakateyoo ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka nkaloh Yéesu, nkasokoo: “Unaa úlaaŋaalaaŋ, katan kayoŋ ka kipikaay ti pisaatee pa niŋ misaatee ma meelohe ma le, kati kíyini hitaaku paliyal niŋ káahintuma.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Yéesu naasokii: “Aluu faŋ aluu niwufanii kapili.” Pupoñapoñ pa nkañahanoo: “Kúmpuul isak niŋ soon súsupak lamma nuutaakaa, fo niŋ unii ukaayaa hinoom paliyal piti pakan paka púlooŋ.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Kasokaasok eehuu kaatuko máamun pákayiin síwuli isak (5,000) kayeniye toko. <figure style="fig" alt="5 loaves and 2 fish" file="HK00155B.TIF" size="col" loc="9:13-17" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="9:14">Kúmpuul ka isak ya niŋ soon sa súsupak sa</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yéesu naasok pupoñapoñ pa pakateyoo: “Níhinii kapiyeno ti uyoŋ uti máamun pakan áwii ésupak niŋ ŋaasuwan (50).” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Pupoñapoñ pa pakateyoo nkáhin fo, an óo an naayeno. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yéesu naacoop kúmpuul ka isak ya niŋ soon sa súsupak sa náahaafin patiila, naanimpan Pútuun pa, naafiitalool ko, naawufan pinapana pa pakateyoo kápipaacinool ko kayoŋ ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Pakan paka púlooŋ nkali fo kasiit tuk. Fiye, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkayesal mífiitiin paliyal pa peetowiye pa fo kameeŋan síyya ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káyisan ka kiti Piyeer ayme ayem Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Hikee hinoom, Yéesu naayeno kaluum lamayoo, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkayeno toko neyoo. Naacakanii: “Ti pakan paka, inci yem ayme?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Nkañahanoo: “Pakakee kasok awe yem <char style="w">Saŋ</char>-Patis, pakakee paka nkasok awe yem <char style="w">Elí ayaamakoola ya</char>, pakakee paka nkasok akee ti piyaamakoola pa keefiyye ka álitoonii ti keekete ka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Naacakanii: “Ti aluu, ayme innisoke inci iyyem?” <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naacoop hilim ha naasokoo: “Awe yem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yéesu náakupananii, naakitii hisoku eteeho an.<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakup Yéesu kiti eketoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yéesu nene asok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fo yeno ti kúnuul kenfakat ti sipees ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka, <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char>. Efikapookam, immukee, ti hinoom ha íhaaciyenu ha inci fálitaniyee ti eket ya.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Páciite pa piti kanapan ka kiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Naasokii poko púlooŋ: “Niŋ an álafiyaam kanapan afaapook himuumoo, naanapanam fo álafi eket ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: naakanto hinak óo hinak kuluwaa ya eteyoo</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kaatuko aŋa éelafiye kafakan eloŋ ya eteyoo, áfaapuul yo. Pale aŋa éepuule eloŋ ya eteyoo kamma inci, afaafakan yo. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Empeyme panap piyem toko an kati ataak hisaanumate ha hiti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ náapuul eloŋ ya eteyoo niŋ fotom naatahoolo? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Niŋ an asuuwaam niŋ kilim ka kutoom, inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fasuuwoo niŋ inci ñóhooniyoo ti hamake ha hitoom niŋ ti hamake ha hiti Paapaa atoom niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa peesampanee pa. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, pakakee ti keesiiŋiye ka le etikaket peecukut <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamake ha hiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Ta Yéesu naapaye ta káakup enkuu máamun kunoom isak niŋ káhaaciil, naacoopool <char style="w">Piyeer</char>, <char style="w">Saŋ</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saak</char> nkasilo patiila tíntiŋ ya kaluum. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Akina ti kaluum ka pacuk puhooŋuyoo mpiyesan, wañ wa uteyoo núuhiiniyii fo nuucaaŋ cataŋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Tokotoko, pákayiin pákasupak ti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa keefiyye ka nkayeno neyoo kákupat, poko kayem <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ <char style="w">Elí ayaamakoola ya</char>. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Poko káfulii ti ecaaŋ enfakat. Nkayeno káakup niŋ Yéesu kiti eket ya eteyoo eyya naakaakaay ya kaahankan <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Piyeer niŋ pákawiyoo nkaket niŋ hiŋotu, ta nkáyiyoonii ta nkacuk hamake ha hiti Yéesu niŋ pákayiin paka pákasupak paka keesiiŋiye ka neyoo. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Pákayiin paka payenkuu ta nkayeniye ta píkatinool niŋ Yéesu, Piyeer naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, napaanap unii úpuyemi le. Upusiiŋan múkuut míhaaciil, coonool citii, coonool citi Móyiis, coonool citi Elí.” Amíit eeha naayeniye káakup.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Ta naayeniye ta káakup káatiŋu nkúfulii nkíkimpitoolii, ewatate neeyeno niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo ta nkanakiye ta ti káatiŋu ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Hilim níhifulii ti káatiŋu ka nihisok: “Aŋe ayem Añiinam, inci mamaloo. Nísiitanoo!” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ta hilim ha nihipaye ta káakup nkacuk Yéesu lamayoo. Piyeer niŋ pákawiyoo nkafatanool neeho, kakamanut an ti oom caanak eeha nkacuke ha.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan akampaani ati hísaalumant</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Eti kacom eteyyo, Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo pákahaaciil paka nkáwanoonii ti etaam tíntiŋ ya, kayoŋ kenfakat nkíkey kaapaakoolanoo. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ayíin náaceekii ti kayoŋ ka: “Ahámpaatiin, inci luumuu, sincan añiinam akampaani ye, añiinam oonool a kóŋ aŋa inci intaake ya! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" /><char style="w">Hísaalumant</char> nihinakiyoonako, tokotoko níhihinoo apiceek, níhiyiyiŋanoo niŋ sempe fo putumoo mpiyohat, nihikallanoo, hífiisantoo kakatan. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Inci luumaaluum pinapana pa pakatii kati kayaan ho, pale kayinaat.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yéesu naasok: “Oo! Aluu <char style="w">ekaay</char> ya eenaput ya apan nitaakut káyinan, fo teyme inci fayeno niŋ aluu immukut niŋ aluu? Cóopii añiini le.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Añii ya ti ékey ya, hísaalumant ha nihitahoo híp t’etaam, níhiyiyiŋanoo niŋ sempe. Pale Yéesu naafet ti hísaalumant ha, náakuuñan añii ya, naañahanoo faafoo. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Pakan paka púlooŋ ínnimii ti sempe sa senfakat sa siti Pútuun pa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Púsupiyenu káakup Yéesu kiti eketoo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Pakan paka oopa nímii ti eeha Yéesu náahine ha púlooŋ, naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Niwas kilim enke ti unuu aluu: Inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fawufanee ti sipees pakan.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Pale kámiit eeha naayeniyii hisoku. Putum hilim ha nihiyolee ti poko timpi kámeyi fa nihisoke, nkafe kacakanoo puume nihisoke.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eemaka ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Fiye, Yéesu <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa pakateyoo ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka nkáyaañ pílaacinool aŋa eehaŋe pamake teyii. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yéesu náameyi pámiiloolal pa piteyii, naacoop ciñii naasiiŋan co pukoloo. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Naasokii: “An óo an eewanane ciñii ence ti caacawam, inci naawanane, an óo an eewananaam, aŋa éepoñiyaam ya lompo naawanane. Kaatuko aŋa éetinee ya ti aluu púlooŋ, akina ayem eemaka ya.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />
    <char style="w">Saŋ</char> naacoop hilim ha, naasok: “Ahámpaatiin, unii ucukaacuk áyiin ti hiyaanu <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> ti caacawi, nuuyoopoo hikitu, kamma naaneetaat ati kayoŋ ka kiti unaa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Timpi nikitoo, kaatuko an óo an eepookut aluu oopa ti aluu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hipooku ha hiti cisaatee citi Samali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Yéesu, hicoopu ha hiteyoo alacana, ta níhilohanii ta, naacok piliit pikaayu pa piti <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Naapoñ pakan niŋ kilim kapunowoo hátikin, oom pakan nkakaay, nkanako ti cisaatee citi <char style="w">Samali</char> kapimemanool ékey ya eteyoo. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Pale pakan paka pakati cisaatee ca kawananutoo, kamma naayem ti himuusu Jerusalem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pakati Samali kásiyoolut niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, kacoonut nii Jerusalem yem pa Pútuun pa mpiñaŋee pa hímulu.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Pinapana pa pakateyoo, <char style="w">Saak</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char> ta nkacuke ta eehe nkasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, áalafilafi úpuwananii seemak sípifulii patiila sípipucaloolii?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Pale Yéesu náayesoonii lipe ti poko, naafet teyii. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Fiye, nkakaay ti cikee cisaatee.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kéelafiye ka kanapan Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Ta nkayeniye ta pikaayu ti pítin pa, akee áyiin naasok Yéesu: “Inci fanapani pan óo pan pa ankaakaay.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Piyen elampa ya pitaakaataak uyeen, pusuwa pa mpitaak ñáawuunu, pale inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, taakut la fanaŋ hikawam.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Naasok akee áyiin: “Napanam,” pale áyiin a naañahanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, túulam pícaahokii fala paapaa atoom.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Kat keekete ka kapuhok pakateyii keekete ka, pale awe kaay cáatuunan <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Akee áyiin nene, naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, inci fanapani, pale túulam fala pikaay upuca úkatinoolii niŋ pakanam.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yéesu naasokoo: “An óo an eecoke kacantu naawelep puson, átuuniit páhin ti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Kúmpoña ka kiti pinapana pa áwii éhaaciil niŋ ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka (72)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Púful toko, <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> nene amamal pakakee pinapana áwii éhaaciil niŋ ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (72), naapoñii pákasupak pákasupak kapunowoo hátikin ti pisaatee pa púlooŋ niŋ pan óo pan pa naañaŋe pikaayu. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Naasokii: “Kaamaañ ka kufomaafom pale pumaaña pa kameeŋut. Ooto niluum Ateeteyo ati kaamaañ ka apupoñ pumaaña kapikaay kaamaañ ka kiteyoo. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Nikaay! Inci pupoñ aluu samat nii mísaacii ti pututa piyen elampa. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Timpi niyekan mañ, epootak tom, pisamata tom, ti pítin pa timpi nikican an.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />“Niŋ ninakiyaa ti ekumpaan, níyaañ nisok: 'Kásuumaay kiyeno ti ekumpaan eyye.' <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Niŋ an ati kásuumaay oopa toko, kásuumaay ka kiti aluu efikiyeno teyoo, niŋ ekina tom, éfikuñohoonii ti aluu. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Niyeno ti ekumpaan eyyuu, innili, innilaan waah ewwa efikawufan wa aluu. Kaatuko áhina añaŋaa hitaaku cooy ya eteyoo. Timpi nitootoosool ti pukumpaan.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />“Niŋ ninakiyaa ti saatee, pakati saatee ya nkawanan aluu, nili waah óo waah ewwa nkawufane aluu. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Inníkuuñan púkuuña pa keeyem ka ti oom saatee, innisokii: '<char style="w">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cíkeyyoo pukol aluu.' <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Pale niŋ ninakiyaa ti saatee, pakati saatee ya kawananut aluu, nikaay pati ñítin ña innisok: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />'Háati haafol ha hiti saatee ya hiti aluu heecoke ha ti woot unii, unii uhankaa ho úpuyisan aluu nii Pútuun pa efipisap aluu. Háati ekina, nímeyi nii cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa cílohiyooloh.' <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Inci pusok aluu: Hinak eeha Pútuun pa mpikaakaay íhinu kíiti ya, kúnuul ka kiti saatee eyyuu efikihaŋ kiti pakati saatee ya eti Sotom.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pakan paka pakati Sotom kakancaakanc hínum meemak, ekina ewune Pútuun pa mpúpucalool saatee ya eteyii (Púcook 18:17–19:27).</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu pakati saatee ya eti Kolasin, kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu pakati saatee ya eti Petesayit. Kaatuko waah weecukantee Pútuun pa mpíhine ti pisaatee pa piti aluu. Niŋ eehuu hitaakiye ti pisaatee pa piti Til niŋ Siton,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pisaatee pa piti Kolasin niŋ Petesayit <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char>, pale Til niŋ Siton kaneetaat Pusuwif. Nisincan kahooŋu mah.</char></note> anti kafiyo nkáwunkiye umuuyen wa uteyii, nkayeno niŋ kúsool kiti pupootak niŋ emaamoolo píiha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ti káyisan ewatanoolo enfakat eti umuuyen wa uteyii, pakan paka nkawaso wañ weesañate uti pahan pifil, niŋ emaamoolo píiha. (Jonas 3:5-9)</char></note> kápiyisan ewatanoolo ya eteyii. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Pale hinak eeha Pútuun pa mpikaakaay íhinu kíiti ya, kúnuul ka kiti aluu efikihaŋ kiti pakati Til niŋ Siton. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Aluu pakati saatee ya eti <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char>, fo éfiniseepinee alacana? Haani, efiniwananee pati keekete ka.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yéesu naapenan hisoku pinapana pa pakateyoo: “An óo an éesiitane aluu, inci náasiitane; pale an óo an eepooke aluu inci naapooke; an óo an eepookaam, éepoñiyaam ya lompo naapooke.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eñóhoonii ya eti pinapana pa áwii éhaaciil ya niŋ ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka (72)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Ta pinapana pa áwii éhaaciil ya niŋ ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka (72) nkáñohoonii ta niŋ pásuuma nkasok Yéesu: “Ahámpaatiin, ta núukupe ta ti caacawi háati <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> ka kísiitanaa-síitan unii.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yéesu naasokii: “Inci cukaa <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya néefulii patiila néenowii nii pamaliñoolal etiil. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Nísiitan! Inci ufanaawufan aluu kayine kiti kakakal ti ufepa niŋ ti púpuntaloo, niŋ iheeku sempe sa púlooŋ siti Seetaani ya, háati waah etuukuum aluu. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Pale timpi nitaak pásuuma kamma kísaalumant ka nkísiitane aluu, nitaak pásuuma kamma ucaw aluu nuukiicee alacana.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma, <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkimeeŋan Yéesu niŋ pásuuma, naasok: “Inci múluu Paapaa, <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ati patiila niŋ t’etaam, kamma ayyole eehe keecohatiye ka niŋ kéesuume ka kunuu, pale íyyisan ho keewananooliye ka nii epuuk kenkilis. Ee, Paapaa, kaatuko fiye állafiye hipitaako ti pásuum pa pitii.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Paapaa atoom awufanaamufan waah wa púlooŋ. An ámiit ayme ayem Añii ya, fo Paapaa ya, an lompo ámiit ayme ayem Paapaa ya fo Añii ya niŋ payenka Añii ya náalafiye ka káyisanoo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Púful toko, naayeso pati pinapana pa pakateyoo naasokii poko lamayii: “Niyihaayih kaatuko ñíkin aluu iññicukcuk eeha innicuke ha. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Inci pusok aluu: Hícump <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> niŋ pumansa kálafilafi hínum hicuku eeha innicuke ha pale kacukut ho, nkálafi hísiyu eeha ínnisiye ha pale kásiyut ho.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu ha hiti áyiin eenape ati Samali ati payenka Pusuwif pa nkálafiit ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Fiye, <char style="w">áhampaatiin ati hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>, ápilafi puwinko Yéesu, naasiiŋo naacakanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, puume inci iññaŋe íhinu pitaak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Weyme ukiicee ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char>? Weyme ánsiye toko?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Naañahanoo: “Láfi <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa pitii ti himuumi púlooŋ, ti kunuuwi púlooŋ, ti yaani púlooŋ, ti sempeyi púlooŋ niŋ ti ecohatoyi púlooŋ<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Kakaman 6:5</ref></char></note>. Lompo láfi akinooli samat nii fa állafiye fa faŋi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewitik 19:18</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Aañahanaa pinap. Náahinaa fo aafataak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya.” <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Pale akalaŋana ya náalafi káyisan nii fa naasoke fa fo, naañoho apicakan Yéesu: “Ayme ayem akinoolam?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yéesu naasokoo hícantiitu heehe: “Taakaataak akee áyiin éefulii <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> apiyeno éwanoonii Jeriko. Ti pítin pa, naapaakool niŋ pikanca. Payenkuu nkawaatoo, nkasapoo fo alamo, nkatahoo toko. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Intaak <char style="w">awaaseena ati Pútuun pa</char> eeyeniye énapii oom pítin apiŋantanoo la naahintiye la, naacinciliyoo naamuus. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Intaak <char style="w" lemma="Asísikana puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa">ásisikana puwaaseena pa</char> lompo ápucolii toko naaŋantanoo, naacinciliyoo naamuus. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Pale intaako áyiin ati <char style="w">Samali</char> eeyeniye pikaayu kaakaawool ápucolii lompo teyoo. Naacuk áyiin a aŋuu naahintiye inketoo teyoo ti hikaw. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Naalohoo naatoot musontuwaay ma miteyoo niŋ munucu niŋ elaan, naacenk mo niŋ mufaal. Naalapanoo ti fáli ya eteyoo, naacoopoo ti ekumpaan éwananuma <char style="w" lemma="Akaawoola">ekaawoola</char>, naamankooloo. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Eti kacom eteyyo náafulanii sikoofali súsupak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: <char style="w" lemma="tenali">sitenali</char> súsupak. </char></note> naawufan so ati éwananuma ekaawoola ya, naasokoo: 'Mankoolam aŋe, niŋ inci ñóhooniyoo mañ óo mañ emma ampenane toko efiñahani mo.'”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yéesu naacakanoo: “Ti pacukali, ayme ti payenke t’éhaaciilii ayem akinool a ati aŋa eenowe ya ti sipees pikanca pa?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ahámpaatiin ya ati hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha naañahanoo: “Akina ayem aŋa eecukoo ya inketoo teyoo ti hikaw.” Yéesu naasokoo: “Kaay, awe lompo, hín fo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu pati Maarta niŋ Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo, ta nkayeniye ta ti pítinii, naanako ti cisaatee, aal aŋa nkasok Maarta naawananoo ti ekumpaan ya eteyoo. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Naataak atu, aŋa nkasok <char style="w">Mari</char>, naayeno ti woot <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>, apiyeno káasiitan eeha naayeniye ha kakalaŋan. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Pale Maarta naayeno eyesoolo niŋ paliima kaamemanool paliyalii. Náakey ti Yéesu naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, cokuti ti inci fa atuwam naakatoolaam fa niŋ páhin pa? Ooto sokoo ayankananam.” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ateeteyo naañahanoo: “Maarta, Maarta, aapa ti ewasoolo kúnuul, immeeŋanoolo kúnuul ti waah weemeeŋe. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Pale waah woonool lamma usoolahee. Mari amamale weenape wa, apan étuufulanee teyoo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti kaluum ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Hikee hinoom, Yéesu naayeno kaluum lakeenaay. Ta naapaye ta, akee ti pinapana pa pakateyoo naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, yísanool unii fa nkaluum samat nii fa <char style="w">Saŋ</char> náayisanoole fa pinapana pa pakateyoo.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yéesu naasokii: “Niŋ niyeniyaa kaluum innisok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">'Paapaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">álimaati caacawi cisampanee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">álimaati <char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> ca citii cíkey.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Alímaati aawufan unii hinoom óo hinoom paliyal pa putoonii.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Alímaati aaponket unii umuuyen wa utoonii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">samat nii fa nuuponket fa lompo umuuyen wa uti keemuuyene ka toonii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Timpi katan unii upunow ti híluuŋu ha.'”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5-6" />Yéesu nene asokii: “Usokaa akee ti aluu ataake áwi éekaawoolii mpisit, aataakut aŋa aafawufanoo apili. Fiye, ankaay pati akee áwiyi insokoo: 'Awíyam, máakiyam kúmpuul káhaaciil, kaatuko, akee áwiyam ákaawoolii féefiye, taakut waah ewwa inci fawufanoo apili.' <verse eid="LUK 11:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Eeyem ya páhantuwa náañahaniyi apusok: 'Timpi yokanam! Hunkut ha hikuleekul, inci niŋ epuukam uhintaahinto, étiyini piyito puwufani kúmpuul.' <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Inci pusok aluu: Háati aŋa ayitiit apuwufani kúmpuul ka kamma naayem áwiyi, pale afaalito apuwufani aŋa ansoolahe ya púlooŋ kamma antaakut ñusuu iŋŋiiniyoo.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Inci pusok aluu, niluum efipuwun aluu, niŋes efinilaŋan, niwenken éfipipankin aluu. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kaatuko an óo an eeluume afaawunee, an óo an eeŋese afaalaŋan, an óo an eewenkene áfaapankinee. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ayme faaf ti aluu, afaawufan añiinoo epululoola niŋ aluumoo yoon? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Niŋ fotom naawufanoo púntaloo niŋ aluumoo heeh? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Niŋ aluu keenaput ka nimeya kawun waah weenape epuuk aluu, puume Paapaa ati aluu eeyem ya alacana atahaŋ naawufane <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> payenka keeluumoo ko ka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ Pelesepul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Hikee hinoom nene, Yéesu naayeno hiyaanu <char style="w">hísaalumant</char> heeyinaat káakup. Ta hísaalumant ha níhifulii ta, áyiin a náayaañ káakup, kayoŋ ka kenfakat ka ínnim ko. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Pale pakakee paka nkasok: “Ti caacaw Pelesepul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pelesepul, ekina eyem Seetaani.</char></note>, áhampaatiin a ati kísaalumant ka, innayaan kísaalumant ka.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Pakakee paka nkálafiyoo puwinko, nkasokoo áyisanii píyisan péeyisane nii Pútuun pa púpoñiyoo. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Pale, Yéesu náameyi pámiiloolalii, naasokii: “Cáwii óo cáwii céetaakoolanooliye, eficinow; pukumpaan etenco púlooŋ efipuhumaloolo mpinaŋanoolo ti enow<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pakakee paka, fiye nkásiye hilim eehe: “Cáwii óo cáwii céetaakoolanooliye, eficinow; miin óo miin méetaakoolanooliye, efimihancaloolo.”</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Nisok nii ti caacaw Pelesepul inci niyyaan kísaalumant ka. Pale niŋ cáwii ca citi <char style="w">Seetaani</char> cíkatinooliyaa, puume éficiyini pisiiŋo? <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Fiye, niŋ ti caacaw Pelesepul inci niyyaan kísaalumant ka, pinapana pa pakati aluu ti caacaw pakayme nkayaan ko? Ooto, efikayeno píhina aluu kíiti. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Pale niŋ ti caacaw ca citi Pútuun pa inci niyyaan kísaalumant ka, ooto, <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cícoliyoocol ti aluu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Niŋ áyiin eetaake sempe naataak lompo pucoolaŋ ayeniyaa efaas ekumpaan ya eteyoo, waah óo waah uteyoo weeyem toko, uwwa ti pamankal peenape. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Pale niŋ taakaa áyiin eehaŋoo sempe, éekeyii kátaakoolanoo, naaheekoo, naacoop pucoolaŋ pa piteyoo empa náayinane pa tempo, náapaacinool waah óo waah uteyoo.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“An eeneetaat niŋ inci, apookaampook, an eeyankananutam kaaconcenool, nahancalool-hancalool.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Niŋ hísaalumant hífulaa ti an, nihimuusool-muusool ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char> ti hiŋes éyekunooluma. Niŋ hílaŋaniyoot, nihisokoolo: 'Túulam, inci puñoho pati aŋa inci ínfulii ya.' <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Ti éñohoonii eteeho, nihitook ékinuma ya neeneeŋee neememanoolee pitempo tak. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Fiye, nihikaay, níhicoopii kikee kísaalumant isak niŋ kúsupak keehaŋe ho pakanc, nkinako nkikin toko. Kúnuul ka kikelan ka kiti an a aŋuu nkihaŋ páciite kíyaañ ka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yéesu ti hisoku ha eehuu, aal náaceekii ti kayoŋ ka: “Iññáa ya eepukuu ya náacuuwani ánapiyanee-nápiyan.” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Pale Yéesu naañahanoo: “Payenka nkásiitan ka <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nkáhin ho kánapiyanee-nápiyan.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kacakan ka kiti píyisan pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Uyoŋ wa ta núuconcoolii ta, Yéesu naasok: “Aluu <char style="w">ekaay</char> eenaput, fo hiŋes píyisan péeyisane nii Pútuun pa púpoñiyaam inniyaake? Háati poonool étiniyisanee, fo píyisan pa piti Jonas.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta infiyye yoon enfakat neemelan Jonas <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya ati Pútuun pa. Pumuus kunoom káhaaciil yoon ya néenuusiyoo ti kantant ka kaloŋayoo (Jonas 1:17).</char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:40">Máciya 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Máciya 16:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Samat nii Jonas fa naayeniye fa píyisan ti pakati Ninew, fo lompo inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fayeno píyisan ti ekaay eyye.<verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />“Ta infiyye, amansa ya aal a ati Sepa, náafulii ti mah méelaaŋee láaŋ ápikey peti amansa ya <char style="w">Solomon</char> káasiitan ecohato ya eteyoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amansa ya aal a ati Sepa, akina ayem amansa aal éefulii ti mah meeyem pa caanak ca íncifulii pa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-13">1 Pumansa 10:1-13</ref></char>).</char></note>. Fiye, heeyem ha le hihaŋaahaŋ amansa ya Solomon. Ekina ewune, ti hinoom ha hiti kíiti ya, amansa ya aal a ati Sepa afaasiiŋo hátikin ekaay eyye náahin yo kíiti. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Fo lompo incuke, Jonas náatuunan <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> pakati Ninew, nkáwunko umuuyen wa uteyii.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:1-10">Jonas 3:1-10</ref></char></note> Fiye, heeyem ha le hihaŋaahaŋ Jonas. Ekina ewune, ti hinoom ha hiti kíiti ya, pakati Ninew efikasiiŋo hátikin ekaay eyye nkáhin yo kíiti.”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeno ti ecaaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Yéesu naapenanii hisoku: “An acaaŋanantoo lampi naayol yo niŋ fotom náawuf teyyo eheem. Pale nawaŋwaŋ yo ti esafu, ancuk an óo an éenakoonii naacuk ecaaŋ ya. <figure style="fig" alt="Lamp on stand" file="HK00152B.TIF" size="col" loc="11:33-36" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="11:33">Lampi</figure> <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Ñíkini ñikina ñiyem lampi ya eti eniini. Niŋ ñíkini ñinapaa eniini púlooŋ lompo efeemeeŋ niŋ ecaaŋ. Niŋ ñinaput, eniini lompo neemeeŋ niŋ énimaan. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ooto, tah kunuu ti ecaaŋ ya eeyem ya ti awe timpi eyeno énimaan. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Niŋ eniini púlooŋ eemeeŋaa niŋ ecaaŋ, peetaakut la níme, efeeyeno púlooŋ ti ecaaŋ samat nii ecaaŋ lampi eecaaŋe cataŋ éeyayii ti awe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hinooku ha hiti Pufalisaay pa niŋ pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yéesu ta naapaye ta káakup, <char style="w">Afalisaay</char> naayonkaloo hili pateyoo. Apikaay, naanako naayeno hili. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Afalisaay a ta naacuke ta nii Yéesu akuulanut sipeesoo apite ali, ínnimoo teyoo. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" /><char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> naasokoo: “Aluu Pufalisaay pa, innikuulan tíkitaaŋ elontoŋ ya niŋ epulaatu ya, pale páhantuwa aluu innimeeŋ niŋ pálafi piti káalipu niŋ pakanc. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Aluu pusoŋ pa! Fo Pútuun pa peememanoole pa tíkitaaŋ pikina tom lompo pimemanoole páhantuwa? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Niwufan salaka weeyem wa lupo keeleke ka, ancuk aluu niŋ waah óo waah efinikuul.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu Pufalisaay pa, kaatuko inniwufanufan Pútuun pa himpaac ha heewase ha ŋaasuwan ti pamaañal pa pitaaluu, samat nii kanca, micempanu niŋ típaapikeen. Pale innifiil nii niñaŋaa piyeno <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> ti pututa aluu niŋ pakan paka, ínnilafi Pútuun pa, ántuŋ hikina inniñaŋe íhinu peefiilut ukee wa.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu Pufalisaay pa, kamma ínnilafi piyeno ti kúkon ka keenape ka ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa, ínnilafi kapinkakicanee pinapnap ti kíliŋ ka.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu, kaatuko innicukcuk nii kiyaak keetaakut lánkamaasi enka pakan nkakak tenko péemiit nii kakakaakak ti waah weekuulut.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Fiye, akee ti <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, naasokaa fiyaaw, unii lompo anteñale.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Aluu lompo pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha, kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu, kamma innitiyan pakan paka pitiyo peenapa líŋ, háati niŋ cisiik aluu coonool nílikantoo pitiyo pempuu.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu, kaatuko innilutlut kiyaak ka kiti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa, payenka símaama aluu nkamuke ka. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Inníyisanyisan ti páhinal empuu nii nicoonaacoon eeha símaama aluu nkáhine ha, poko kamukale piyaamakoola pa, aluu ínniwalliyanool kiyaak ka kiteyii. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ekina ewune Pútuun pa ti ecohato etempo mpusok: 'Inci fápoñiyii piyaamakoola niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char>. Efikamuk pakakee paka, nkakallan pakakee paka.'<verse eid="LUK 11:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />“Fiyuu hísim ha hiti piyaamakoola pa púlooŋ heeniisiye ha kápiliŋ ti púcook <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>, efihinaŋee ti hikaw <char style="w">ekaay</char> eyye. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Písikii ti hísim ha hiti <char style="w">Abel</char> fo ti hísim ha hiti Sakaliya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aŋa ayem ayaamakoola ya (2 Heetaakiye 24:20-22) pale neetaat paapaa ti Saŋ-Patis. </char></note>, eemukee ya ti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya</char> eti Pútuun pa, ti pututa <char style="w">kaaciin</char> ka niŋ la haŋee la kaasampan. Ee, inci pusok aluu, eehe fiye púlooŋ efihinaŋee ti hikaw ekaay eyye.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha, kaatuko innicoopcoop ékuluma ya eti káapankin hunkut ha hiti kameye ka. Aluu faŋ aluu ninakiit lupo, innikit kéelafiye ka pinako.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yéesu apiyeno hífulu ti ekumpaan ya, pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha niŋ Pufalisaay pa kiiñii nkili meemak, nkayeniyoo kaakilincanool ti hícump pacakanoolal. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Kápilafiyoo hikuucu ti eeha afaasok kati káyiniyoo hinooku teeho.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Káwasum écufato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Ti oom caanak, pakan púwuli peemeeŋe nkaconcoolo fo nkakakalool. Yéesu náayaañ ápukup niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo, naasok: “Níwasum leweñoo ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa, kamma neeyem écufato eyya nétif. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Waah óo waah wéewufaloolee éfuuwufinee, waah óo waah weeyolee éfuumeyyee. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ekina ewune eeha innisoke ha ti énimaan éfihisiyee ti hanakan palaw, eeha innipuusanoole ti kaanuu páhantuwa ékaap éfihituunanee ti kíliŋ ka.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eeñaŋee ya hifeyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Yéesu nene asok: “Aluu pákawiyam, inci pusok aluu: Timpi nife payenka nkamuk ka enii ya ínfulaa toko étinekayini waah ti aluu. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Pale inci fáyisan aluu aŋa inniñaŋe ya hifeyu: Nife Pútuun pa, peeyem pa niŋ pipayaa himuku enii ya, pitaakaataak kayine kiti hiwantu aluu ti seemak. Ee, inci pusok ho aluu, pikina inniñaŋe hifeyu. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Fo kanoomanantoo múculuculu isak, uhit úsupak? <figure style="fig" alt="2 small coins" file="HK00167B.TIF" size="col" loc="12:6-7" copy="knowles &amp; Bass" ref="12:6">Uhit úsupak</figure>Pale háati coonool temmo Pútuun pa pifiilut. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Háati wan wa weeyem wa ti hikaw aluu púlooŋ ufineefin. Timpi nife, nihaŋaahaŋ nafaa meemak múculuculu meemeeŋe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kasayan niŋ fotom hipooku Yéesu hátikin pakan paka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Yéesu nene asok: “Inci pusok aluu: An óo an eesayanaam hátikin pakan paka, inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, lompo fasayanoo hátikin <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa piti Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Pale an óo an eepookaam hátikin pakan paka, inci, Añii An, lompo fapookoo hátikin pumaleekoo pa piti Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />An óo an eesoke heenaput ti inci, Añii An, áfaayiniyee kaaponket, pale an óo an eeteñale <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> ataponketee.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Niŋ kacoopaa aluu ti sempe ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa íhinu aluu kíiti, niŋ fotom nkacoop aluu hátikin ñíhampaatiin ña niŋ ti pakati kayine ka, timpi niwasoolo kúnuul fa innikaakaay káakup kati nifak niŋ fotom eeha innikaakaay hisoku, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />kaatuko Kunuu ka keenape ka efikikalaŋan aluu ti oom caanak eeha inniñaŋe hisoku.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu ha hiti usaanum a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Yéesu ti káakup ka, akee ti kayoŋ ka naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, sok atoom a úpaacinool hitaaku ha eeha paapaa atoonii naakate ha unii.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Awíyam, ayme asiiŋanaam áhina kíiti niŋ fotom aŋa akaakaay aluu káapaacinool hitaaku ha hitaaluu?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Púful toko, naasokii: “Nisiiŋo púsooni! Nitah kunuu, timpi niŋes kaaconcenool hitaaku, kaatuko eloŋ an eneetaat ti hitaaku ha hiteyoo, háati nihifom.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Naasokii hícantiitu eehe: “Taakaataak usaanum áyiin eetaake etaam eepuke meemak. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Naacakanoolo: 'Puume inci iññaŋe íhinu? Kaatuko taakut la famank aŋa inci inkaakaay ya émaañii.' <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Naasok: 'Fiye inci inkaakaay íhinu. Fahancalool mileefaan ma mutoom, illut ñenfakat, la faconcenool púlooŋ aŋa inci inkaakaay ya émaañii niŋ hitaaku ha hitoom. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Inci fasokoolo: "Awíyam, yékunoolo, hitaaku ha hitii hiti sitiil seemeeŋe, li, illaan, iyyeno ti eloŋ éesuume meemak."' <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Pale Pútuun pa mpusokoo: 'Awe esoŋ eyyuu! Hánant eehe aafaket. Fiye, ayme afaacoop aŋa anconcenoole ya púlooŋ?'” <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yéesu naapenan apusokii: “Eehe efihitaako an aŋa naconcenool hitaaku hiti faŋoo apan ataakut waah hátikin Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kat káamiilool yínan Pútuun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Púful toko, Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Eehe hiwune inci insok aluu, timpi niwasoolo kúnuul ti eloŋ ya etaaluu, ti waah ewwa efinili, niŋ fotom ti sinii aluu, waah ewwa éfinisoolo. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kaatuko eloŋ ya ehaŋaahaŋ paliyal, enii ya neehaŋ pásooliyal. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Nisincan pusuwa pa: pusukantoo, pumaañantoo, pitaakut káamankuma niŋ ekina tom pileefaan, pale Pútuun pa mpúkuuman-kúuman po. Ñiyema puume innihaŋe nafaa pusuwa pa? <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ayme ti aluu, ti ewasoolo kúnuul, ayina kapenan esuuŋut ti eloŋ ya eteyoo? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Páawoo niyinaat fala íhinu waah wa wenkilis wa ewwe, weyme efiniwasoolo kúnuul ti ukee wa?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />“Nisincan fa híliilii ha nihiŋant fa. Ihínantoo piseeñ niŋ ekina tom hiliilantoo. Pale inci pusok aluu, háati amansa ya <char style="w">Solomon</char> niŋ hisaanumate ha hiteyoo fiye púlooŋ ásankinantoo samat nii hikina. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Niŋ Pútuun pa púsoolaa fiyuu káaheeni enkuu, keeyem ka le fíyooy, kacom nkuwantee ti seemak, faala aluu, puume conko étipusool aluu? Aluu pakati káyinan keefomut! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Timpi niŋes waah ewwa efinili, innilaan; timpi niwasoolo kúnuul. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Kaatuko <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>, poko nkaŋes waah ewwuu. Pale Pútuun pa Paapaa ti aluu, pímeyimeyi nii nisoolahaa-soolah wo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Haŋa panap nipiŋes <char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> etempo, ínnihinaa fo, waah ewwe púlooŋ efuuwufanee aluu.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Aluu cikoolee ca citoom, timpi nife, kaatuko Paapaa ti aluu súumoosuum kati awufan aluu cáwii etempo. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Ninooman hitaaku ha hitaaluu, ínnifulan ho salaka ti keeleke ka. Nimemanoolo émankuma mañ éepuciyantoo. Inniconcenool hisaanumate ha hitaaluu alacana la étihicim, la innimeya la nii pílipa étikayini hikolu, cemmek lompo etecok. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kaatuko la hisaanumate ha hitaaluu nihiyem, toko lompo saan aluu insiyem.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pimiikan keeyem kaasincan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Yéesu nene asok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Niyeno niŋ wañ uti páhin, innikat pilampi pa pitaaluu pipicaaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Níhin samat nii pakan keeyem ti hítuulu éñohoonii ya eti áhampaatiin a ateyii, loho akaayaa pahaaño piti pinimo. Niŋ pácolaliyoo naawenken, nkápankinoo putum pa. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Pimiikan pa payenka áhampaatiin a naakaakaay ka étookii kaasincan niŋ ácoliyoo éfikanapiyanee. Pánipani, inci pusok aluu: Afáawasoonii wañ uti páhin naayenanii nantoonool naawufanii kapili. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Iyyema ákeyyoo mpisit niŋ fotom nuulap, náatookiyii kaasincan, éfikanapiyanee.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />“Pale nímeyi eehe, niŋ ati ekumpaan ya ameya teyme álipa ya naakaakaay ékey, atakat ekumpaan ya eteyoo epihaatee. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Aluu lompo nisiiŋo púsooni kaatuko inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, éfikey ti waati eyya étinininkoolam.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Fiye, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naacakan Yéesu: “Ahámpaatiin, unii uwune ansok hícantiitu eehe fo hiti pakan paka púlooŋ?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" /><char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> naañahanoo: “Ayme ayem amiikan a eehintiyee ya, naacohato, aŋa áhampaatiin a naañomane páhin pa piti ekumpaan ya kati ápaacinool paliyal pa pakakee pimiikan pa niŋ caanak ca cítuuniyaa? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Amiikan a aŋuu, niŋ áhampaatiin a áñohooniyoo náatookiyoo ti oom páhin, áfaanapiyanee. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, afaañomanoo hitaaku ha hiteyoo púlooŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Pale niŋ amiikan a aŋuu asokooliyaa: 'Ahámpaatiin a atoom áfiisut éñohoonii,' fiye náayaañ hisapu pimiikan pa pákayiin paka niŋ pakaal paka, naayeno hili, pálaani fo ákuman. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Ahámpaatiin a ati amiikan a aŋuu áfaañohoonii ti hinoom eeha náaninkoolutee ha niŋ ti waati eyya náamiit. Afaakallan meemak amiikan a aŋuu, naayenanoo pati keehintiitee ka.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Amiikan a aŋa eemeya ya eeha áhampaatiin a ateyoo náalafiye ha amemanooliit, áhinut ho afaasapee meemak. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Pale amiikan a aŋa éemiit ya eeha áhampaatiin a ateyoo náalafiye ha, náahin heewune kati asapee, afaasapee caahinkiŋ. An óo an aŋa nkawufane meemak afaañaakee meemak, an óo an aŋa nkañomane meemak afaahaŋee hiñaaku.”<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kásuumaay tom pale píkatinool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Yéesu nene asok: “Inci kéyyookey écoopii seemak ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>, íllafi sipince sicok. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Pale taakaataak <char style="w">pátise</char> eyya inci iññaŋe hisayu, kúnuul unka ti inci taamanta epayut. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Cukaacuk aluu nii kásuumaay inci íncoopii t’etaam? Haani, inci pusok aluu, pale píkatinool. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Písik fíyooy, miin miti pakan isak éfimikatinool, pákahaaciil efikapook pákasupak, pákasupak efikapook pákahaaciil. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Efíkakatinool, paapaa afaapook añiinoo akampaani, akampaani afaapook paapaa ateyoo; íññaa afaapook añiinoo ámaacul, ámaacul afaapook íññaa ateyoo; íññaa afaapook añiinoo aaloo, añiinoo aaloo afaapook aasonoo aal.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mika 7:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kameye heeñaŋe pitaako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yéesu naasok lompo kayoŋ ka: “Niŋ nicukaa káatiŋu nkúfulii pa caanak ca incinow pa, innihaaŋ ti hisoku 'éfeenupii', apan nihitaako. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Fo lompo incuke, niŋ eyam ésapiyoo ti kikee kaapii, innisok 'éfisowi', nihitaako. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Aluu ñícuf! Níyiniyini kameye heekaakaay pitaako niŋ nisincanaa patiila niŋ t’etaam. Weyme uwune niyinaat hicuku heeyem ha aluu ti kaaposool ti caanak ence, kati nímeyi heekaakaay ha pitaako?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Fiye, weyme uwune aluu faŋ aluu nikiiwantoo heenape ha? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Niŋ akamooli ayeniyuu hicoopu ti áhina kíiti, ti pítin pa hín kata nipiteŋenool kati nísiyool, niŋ ekina tom afaacoopi ti sempe ti áhina kíiti ya, áhina kíiti ya naawufani ati éwuulu ya, ati éwuulu ya naakuli. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Inci pusoki, áatifulii ti núkuluma ennuu awe peecooyut kaahit ka kikelan ka.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Púwunko umuuyen niŋ ekina tom eket</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ti oom caanak, pakan nkákey kakaman Yéesu fa <char style="w">Pilaat</char> náahine kapumuk pakakee pakan pakati <char style="w">Galilee</char>, ta nkayeniye ta kaawaaseen kiti Pútuun. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Pakati Galilee payenkuu, fo cukaacuk aluu nii poko kahaŋa kaamuuyen pakakee pakati Galilee kamma nkamukee fiyuu? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Haani, inci pusok aluu, pale niŋ níwunkiit umuuyen wa utaaluu, aluu lompo púlooŋ efiniket. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Niŋ fotom pakan paka kaat ya niŋ pákahaaciil paka payenka ekumpaan ya eehaane ya eti Silowam neenowe ya teyii neemukalii, cukaacuk aluu nii kahaŋa kaamuuyen pakati <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Haani, inci pusok aluu, pale niŋ níwunkiit umuuyen wa utaaluu, aluu lompo púlooŋ efiniket.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Fiye, Yéesu naasokii hícantiitu eehe: “Akee áyiin ataake kaakit naasuk tenko sootoo. Naakaay hiŋes papukal eteyyo ataakut. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Naasok áhina ya ateyoo: 'Sincan, sitiil síhaaciil unse nii inci kéyyoo hiŋes papukal ti enuun eyye taakantoo. Fiit yo! Etaakut nafaa weyme efeesiiŋo ti etaam eyye kenseŋ?' <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Pale áhina ya naañahanoo: 'Ahámpaatiin, túul yo etiil eyye, inci pícikisool ti sipat eteyyo uwwas yo campanti, <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />manti epuk niŋ ekina tom pulay impoñ kapifiit yo.'”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aal éehute éekuuñanee ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Ti <char style="w" lemma="Hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka">hinoom hiti kayeno</char> hiti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, Yéesu naayeno kakalaŋan ti ekee <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char>. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Intaako toko aal aŋa <char style="w">hísaalumant</char> níhihutane fo sitiil kaat niŋ síhaaciil (18). Náaŋuho ayinantoo ésaalino fo acoonool ciit. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yéesu ta naacukoo ta náayonkaliyoo hátikinoo naasokoo: “Aal, aayihaa ti káakuuñu ka kitii.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Naalemp sipeesoo teyoo, tokotoko aal a náasaalino apucoonool ciit, naayeno hímulu Pútuun pa.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Pale, áhampaatiin a ati éluumuma ya, apucuk eehuu inseeñoo ti Yéesu kamma náakuuñane ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka. Naacoop hilim ha, naasok kayoŋ ka: “Kunoom isak niŋ hoonool kiñaŋee páhin tenko. Ooto níkey ti oom kunoom nípikuuñanee, pale ti hinoom ha tom hiti kayeno ka.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />
    <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> naañahanoo: “Aluu ñícuf! Fo an óo an ti aluu, ákopinantoo híciinoo niŋ ekina tom fáliyoo ti káahoonanuma apucoop yo kaalaanan ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Fiye, aal aŋe ati miin ma miti <char style="w">Abraham</char>, aŋa <char style="w">Seetaani</char> neenakiye fo sitiil kaat niŋ síhaaciil (18) púmpuluŋ, fo añaŋutee kafakan ti káakuuñu enke ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Ta naasoke ta enke, keepookoo ka nkameeŋ niŋ ñusuu, pale kayoŋ ka nkiyeno ti pásuuma kamma heenape ha henfakat ha púlooŋ eeha Yéesu náahine ha.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu ha hiti ekoon sootoo ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Púful toko, Yéesu naasok: “<char style="w">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> niŋ weyme incinakoole? Niŋ weyme inci fakufumool co? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Cinakoolaa-nakool nii ekoon sootoo eyya an naacoope naasuk yo ti kaakit ka kiteyoo. Néeŋantii fo éyenoonii enuun, pusuwa pa mpúwuun ti unaay eteyyo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yéesu nene asok: “Niŋ weyme inci fakufumool cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Cinakoolaa-nakool nii leweñoo eyya aal naacoope naanakanool yo niŋ efol eemeeŋe, fo hímaaf ha púlooŋ híkuntii.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Putum pa peekoke pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yéesu ti pikaayu pa <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> naasiiŋo ti pisaatee pa niŋ misaatee ma apiyeno kakalaŋan. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Akee naacakanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, fo pakan caahinkilis lamma efikafakanee?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yéesu naañahanii: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Níhin kata nipinako ti putum pa peekoke pa, kaatuko inci pusok aluu, pakan keemeeŋe efikaŋes pinako étikayini. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Niŋ ati ekumpaan ya ayitiyaa naapank putum pa, aluu tíkitaaŋ, éfinicook kaawenken hunkut ha innisok: 'Ahámpaatiin, pánkin unii,' pale náañahanii: 'Inci míit peyme ínnifulii!'<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />“Fiye, efinisokoo: 'Unaa uyeniyaa hili niŋ pálaani nantoonool, ayyeno kakalaŋan ti kíliŋ ka kutoonii.' <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Pale afaasok aluu: 'Inci míit peyme ínnifulii! Nílaaŋam aluu payenka ínnihin ka heenaput ha!'<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />“Niŋ nicukaa <char style="w">Abraham</char>, <char style="w">Isaak</char>, <char style="w">Jakob</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa púlooŋ ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>, efinikooŋ innifincal úŋiiŋ aluu kamma inniwantee tíkitaaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Pakan éfikafulii ti púlunta pa púlooŋ, kápikey hili ha henfakat ha hiti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Nísiitan, pakakee paka kéekelanii ka efikayeno hátikin, pakakee paka keeyem ka hátikin éfikakelanii.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pálafi empa Yéesu náalafiye pa Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Ti oom caanak, pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> nkákey ti Yéesu nkasokoo: “Fúl le aapikaay lakeenaay kaatuko <char style="w">Helot</char> Antipas álafiyuulafi himuku.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Nikaay canisok cipampaŋo ceekance encuu nii: 'Inci oopa ti hiyaanu <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char>, ínkuuñan pakan paka kéekuuñe ka fíyooy niŋ kacom, hinoom ha híhaaciyenu ha inci fapa páhin pa putoom.' <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Fan óo fan incuke fo inci muus pítinam fíyooy, kacom niŋ tanta, kaatuko <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ayinaatee himuku pikee niŋ neetaat <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Oo Jerusalem, Jerusalem aluu payenka innimukal ka piyaamakoola pa <char style="w" lemma="Kaanunkal">inninunkal</char> payenka Pútuun pa mpúpoñii ka ti aluu, ñiyema puume íllafiye kati concenool epuuk aluu nantoonool samat nii fa ekutoon neconcenool fa mufuun eteyyo ti úpitu eteyyo. Pale nicoonut! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Nísiitan, ekumpaan ya etaaluu efeekatanee. Ee, inci pusok aluu, etinene nicukam fo hinak ta efinisok ta: 'Alímaati <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa pisampan éekeyii ya ti caacaw etempo.'”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ayíin ati káakuuñu kiti hanaay éekuuñanee ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Ti <char style="w" lemma="Hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka">hinoom hiti kayeno</char>, Yéesu naanako ti ekumpaan eti akee ti ñíhampaatiin <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa hili. Keeyeniye ka toko nkasincan teyoo. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Fiye, áyiin eetaake káakuuñu kiti hanaay sipees niŋ woot naayeno hátikinoo. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yéesu naacakan Pufalisaay pa niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis: “Cooneecoon fo kiteekit káakuuñan ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Pale kañahanutoo. Náalik áyiin a aŋa éekuuñe ya náakuuñanoo, apipa, naasokoo ayet.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Fiye, naasokii: “Niŋ akee ti aluu añiinoo niŋ fotom híciinoo kanowaa ti ésaapun, fo átafulaniyii mpacas ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Kayinaatoo kañahan teeho.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esilanoolo niŋ ewananoolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Púful toko, Yéesu naacuk kéeyonkaliyee ka hili ti kamamal kúkon ka kiti hátikin, naasokii hilim eehe: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Niŋ kayonkaluu pahaaño piti pinimo timpi yeno ti híkon ha hiti hátikin ti kafeyatan an eehaŋuu nafaa náayonkaliyee, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />niŋ eehuu hitaakiyaa, aŋa éeyonkalii ya aluu púlooŋ, áfaakey ti awe, naasoki: 'Ufan híkon ha hitii áyiin a aŋe.' Fiye, niŋ ñusuuwi aafakaay iyyeno ti híkon ha hiti puson. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Pale niŋ kayonkaluu, yeno ti híkon ha hiti puson, ancuk niŋ aŋa éeyonkaliyuu ya hili acukuu, naasoki: 'Awíyam, kéy yeno hátikin.' Fiye, áafanapiyanee hátikin kéeyonkaliyee ka púlooŋ. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kaatuko an óo an eesilanooliye áfaawananiyee, an óo an eewananooliye afaasilanee.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yéesu naasok eeyonkaloo ya: “Naayikaa kawaay niŋ fotom káciim, timpi yónkalii pákawiyi, pakatuwi tom, miin ma mitii tom niŋ ekina tom pikinooli tom keetaake ka. Náahinaa fo efi lompo kayonkali hili nkánukani. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Pale naayeniyaa kawufan hili henfakat yónkalii keeleke ka, kéehute ka, payenka nkanow ka niŋ efank, kéefuume ka. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Etíkayiniyi ho kañahan, pale Pútuun pa éfipinapiyani, mpiñahani ho ta <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> ka nkakaakaay ta élitoonii ti eket ya.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti hili henfakat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Ti hili eehuu, akee ti keeyeniye ka toko, ápisi eeha Yéesu naayeniye ha hisoku, naasokoo: “Pásuuma efipiyeno ti aŋa eekaakaay ya hili pati <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yéesu naañahanoo niŋ hícantiitu eehe: “Taakaataak akee áyiin eememanoole hili henfakat naayonkal hícump pakan. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Ta hili ha níhituuniye ta naapoñ amiikan a ateyoo, ápikaakupii niŋ keeyonkalee ka hili nii: 'Níkey, hiik ha hipayaa.' <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Pale poko púlooŋ nkáyaañ kaluum kaaponket. Ayáañ a naasokoo: 'Féefiye inci innoome kaakit, fo inci kaay hicuku etenko, sokoo aponketam.' <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Akee ya naasokoo: 'Féefiye inci innoome kíciin ŋaasuwan kiti piya, kikina inci iyyem fiye ti pikaayu hiyoopu, sokoo aponketam.' <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Akee lompo naasokoo: 'Féefiye inci insaye aal, ekina ewune étiyini ékey.'<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Amiikan a apuñoho, naakaman áhampaatiin a ateyoo eeha pakan paka nkásokiyoo ha. Fiye, ati ekumpaan ya, ta náasiye ho ta, náañiken, naasokoo: 'Kaay mpacas ti kíliŋ ka niŋ ñítin ña ñiti saatee ya cóopii keeleke ka, kéehute ka, kéefuume ka niŋ payenka nkanow ka niŋ efank.' <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Amiikan a apipa ho íhinu, naasokoo: 'Ahámpaatiin, eeha ansoke ha íhineehin pale fo fiye ekumpaan ya emeeŋut.' <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Ahámpaatiin a naasok amiikan a ateyoo: 'Kaay ti mítin ma niŋ kanaac kíkinku ka cóopiyii kápinakoonii, eeha efihiwun ha ekumpaan ya etoom neemeeŋ. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Inci pusok aluu: Háati akee ti kéeyonkaliyee ka hínum, atasiikan ti hili ha henfakat ha hitoom.'”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Páciite piyeno anapana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Fiye, kayoŋ kenfakat nkiyeno pinapool niŋ Yéesu. Náayesoonii lipe teyii, naasokii: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Niŋ an ákeyyoo ti inci, ayinaat piyeno anapanayam taamanta álafiitam pihaŋ faafoo niŋ íññaa ateyoo, pihaŋ aaloo niŋ epuukoo, pihaŋ ñúnuwoo niŋ pakatuwoo niŋ pakahoopoo, niŋ lompo eloŋ ya eteyoo. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Aŋa eecoonutam kanapan fo álafi eket ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Aŋa eecooput kuluwaa ya eteyoo naanapanam</char></note> oom an ayinaat piyeno anapanayam.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Fo niŋ akee ti aluu álafiyaa kulut ekumpaan eehaane, átayaañ ayeno apifin mañ emma naakaakaay káfulan manti míyini hipayu oom páhin? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Niŋ ekina tom afaatah yo átayini yo hipayu, pakan paka keekaakaay ka hicuku eteyyo nkalenkenoo, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />nkasok: 'Sincan, aŋe áyaañe kulut ekumpaan, ayinaat yo hipayu.'<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Fo lompo incuke, niŋ amansa ayeniyaa pikaayu hikam niŋ akee amansa, fo átayaañ ayeno apisincan man niŋ síwuli ŋaasuwan (10,000) áfaayini kátaakoolan eeyem ya ti ékey niŋ síwuli áwii (20,000)? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Niŋ ameya nii átayini, aŋa naaloŋ náalaaŋe afaapoñ pakan kaluum púsuumool. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ti páhinal pa poonool puu, an óo an ti aluu ayinaat piyeno anapanayam taamanta akatanut waahoo púlooŋ.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Micempanu minapaanap, pale niŋ míyitanaa, puume pasampe etemmo efipiñahanee? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Minaput ti etaam ya, minaput lompo campanti, efimuwantee. An óo an eetaake kaanuu kiti káasiitan, ásiitan.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti sáacii éecime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Hikee hinoom, hícump <char style="w" lemma="Asayoola kúncoo">pisayoola kúncoo</char> niŋ pumuuyena nkálohii Yéesu káasiitanoo. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis nkayeno káakumutool kapusok: “Ayíin aŋe nawananwanan pumuuyena pa naali neyii.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Fiye, Yéesu naasokii hícantiitu eehe: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Niŋ akee ti aluu ataakaa sísaacii keme (100), yoonool néecim, fo atakat áwii epaakiil niŋ kaat niŋ sipaakiil sa (99) ti káahoonanuma, apikaay hiŋes yoonool ya éecime ya fo álaŋanii yo? <figure style="fig" alt="Lost sheep" file="BK00005B.TIF" size="col" loc="15:4-7" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="15:4">Sáacii éecime</figure> <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Niŋ álaŋaniyoo yo, niŋ pásuuma áfaakantoonii yo <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />naayet t’enuuf. Púful toko naayonkal pákawiyoo niŋ pikinooloo nantoonool naasokii: 'Níkey, ninanf ti pásuuma pa putoom, kamma inci íllaŋanii sáacii ya etoom yoonool ya éecime ya.' <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Inci pusok aluu: Fo lompo incuke, pásuuma efipiyeno ti keeyem ka alacana niŋ amuuyena oonool áwunkiyaa umuuyen wa uteyoo, pihaŋ áwii epaakiil niŋ kaat niŋ sipaakiil sa (99) <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> ka kasoolahut púwunko umuuyen wa uteyii.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti koofali éecime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yéesu naapenan hisoku: “Moonool muu, niŋ aal ataakaa sikoofali ŋaasuwan, yoonool néecim, fo atacaaŋan lampi, naaneeŋ ekumpaan ya naaŋes yo niŋ kunuu fo alaŋan yo? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Niŋ alaŋanaa yo áfaayonkalii pákawiyoo niŋ pikinooloo nantoonool naasokii: 'Ninanf ti pásuuma pa putoom, kamma inci íllaŋanii koofali ya etoom éecime ya.' <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Inci pusok aluu: Fo lompo incuke, niŋ amuuyena oonool áwunkiyaa umuuyen wa uteyoo, pásuuma efipiyeno ti <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa piti Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti añii éecime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yéesu nene asok: “Taakaataak áyiin eetaake epuuk pákasupak. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Kahiineen ka nkusok faafoo: 'Paapaa, ufanam putumam ti hisaanumate ha eeha inci iññaŋe ha hitaaku nampi ketaa.' Fiye, paapaa ya náapaacinool hitaaku ha hiteyoo epuukoo. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Fiyiit kahiineen ka naanooman putum pa piteyoo púlooŋ naakaay ti mah méelaaŋe. Náapucalool po mañ ma miteyoo ti eloŋ eenaput. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Apipa káapucalool aŋa naataake ya púlooŋ, épankul enfakat néenakoonii ti mah ma púlooŋ, náayaañ palek. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Naakaay hiŋes páhin, akee áyiin ati oom mah naacoopoo, naapoñoo káakuuman pícalukun ti etaam ya eteyoo. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Náalafi kaasiitan faŋoo niŋ paliyal empa pícalukun pa mpiyeniye pa hili pale an awunutoo waah.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />“Fiye, ápuñohoonii ti kunuuwoo, naasokoolo: 'Píhina kayema puume pakati paapaa atoom payenka nkali fo nkatowan, inci íyyemi le ti eket niŋ peep. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ooto, inci fañoho pati paapaa atoom inkaasokoo: "Paapaa, inci muuyenaamuuyen ti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ati alacana niŋ ti awe. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Fiye, inci túuniit piyonkalee añiini, cokam samat nii akee ti píhina pa pakatii."'<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />“Púful toko, añii ya naalito, naañoho pati faafoo. Mpálempaliyoo, faafoo naaŋantanoo inketoo teyoo ti hikaw meemak. Naatey apipaakoolanoo naaŋoonoo, naasumpooloo. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Añii ya naasokoo: 'Paapaa, inci muuyenaamuuyen ti Ateeteyo ati alacana niŋ ti awe. Fiye, inci túuniit piyonkalee añiini.' <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Pale faafoo naasok pimiikan pa pakateyoo: 'Nihiliikan! Nícoopii hísool ha heehaŋe ha pawalle ínnisooloo ho, inniŋaamoo ekop ti hisiik, inniwasoo pisamata. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Innícoopii cíciin ca ceehaŋe ca pafom nipimuk upuliyaa nuuhaañiyaa. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kamma añiinam aŋe naakete, náañohoonii ti eloŋ; náacim, naalaŋanee.' Nkáyaañ pahaaño.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Ta eehe nihitaakiye ta añiinoo áhampaatiin a náaloŋii ti kaakit. Ti éñohooniyoo ápulohanii ekumpaan ya náasi páyifal niŋ pakiiyal. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Naayonkal akee ti pimiikan pa, naacakanoo: 'Weyme utaakiye le?' <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Amiikan a naañahanoo: 'Atuwi áñohoonii, paapaa atii naamuk cíciin ca ceehaŋe ca pafom kamma náañohoonii kásuumaayoo.'<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Fiye, añii ya áhampaatiin a hiiñoo nihili, naapook pinako ti ekumpaan ya. Paapaa ateyoo náafulii, naamaaneenakoo apinako ti ekumpaan ya. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Pale naasok paapaa ateyoo: 'Síitan! Sitiil ense púlooŋ inci yemuu ti páhin péelaacinut hilimi. Pale háati cifil aataapala wunam pahaaño niŋ pákawiyam. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Pale añiini aŋe, ápuñohoonii, akina aŋa éepucaloole ya hitaaku ha hitii ti púmaacul keenaput, ammukoo cíciin ca ceehaŋe ca pafom!'<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />“Paapaa ateyoo naasokoo: 'Añiinam, hinak óo hinak awe oopa le niŋ inci, waah óo waah utoom, utii. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Pale atuwi aŋe aketaaket, náañohoonii ti eloŋ; náacim, naalaŋanee. Ekina ewune uñaŋaa pahaaño niŋ hitaaku pásuuma.'”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu ha hiti áhina ya eesuusa ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Fiye, Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Ayíin usaanum ataake áhina eeyeniye ati hikaw ha hiti páhin pa piteyoo. Pakan nkákey kapusok usaanum a nii áhina ya ateyoo, pahaaño niŋ hisaanumate ha hiteyoo naayaake. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Naayonkaloo naasokoo: 'Eeheyme inci ínsi nkákup kitii? Finam waah wa wéenakoonii wa niŋ wéefule wa, kaatuko áatineeyini piyeno ati hikaw ha hiti páhin pa putoom.'<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />“Ahína ya naasokoolo: 'Páawoo áhampaatiin a atoom áfaafulanam ti páhin pa putoom, puume inci iññaŋe íhinu? Taakut sempe siti piya, suuwaasuu lompo kaaluumatool. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Méyimeyi fa inci inkaakaay íhinu, ancuk niŋ inci púulaa páhin pa putoom pakan paka nkawananam lateyii.'<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Naayonkal oonool oonool ti keetaake ka nikopu ti áhampaatiin a ateyoo. Naacakan áyaañ a: 'Puume ayyekane áhampaatiin a atoom?' <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Naañahanoo: 'Kilampasaan keme kiti lúuliin.' Ahína ya naasokoo: 'Sa kaahit ka kéeyisane ho ka, yeno mpacas inkiic áwii ésupak niŋ ŋaasuwan (50).'<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />“Apipa, naacakan akee: 'Puume ayyekane áhampaatiin a atoom?' Naañahanoo: 'Sipootak keme siti uli.' Naasokoo: 'Sa kaahit ka kéeyisane ho ka, yeno inkiic áwii epaakiil (80).' Fiye, náahin fo ti an óo an eeyekane áhampaatiin a ateyoo nikopu.<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Púful toko, áhampaatiin a náamul áhina ya eecoonoolut a kamma náahine ho niŋ pasuuse. Kaatuko payenka nkanapan ka énimaan ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Púlunta pa">púlunta</char> empe kahaŋa pasuuse pakati ecaaŋ ya eti Pútuun pa ti waah ewwa nkáhin wa ti pututayii.” <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yéesu nene asokii: “Inci pusok aluu: Hisaanumate ha hitaaluu hiti púlunta empe, nicoop ho kati nitaak pákawi, ancuk niŋ hipayaa, innisayanee ti úyenuma wa uti eket maamaa.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />“An eehintiyee niŋ waah wenkilis afaahintiyee lompo niŋ waah wenfakat, an eecoonoolut niŋ waah wenkilis, atacoonool niŋ waah wenfakat. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Niŋ nicoonoolut niŋ hisaanumate ha hiti púlunta empe, ayme afaañoman aluu hisaanumate ha hiti pánipani ya? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Niŋ nicoonoolut niŋ hisaanumate hiti an, ayme afaawufan aluu hisaanumate ha hitaaluu? <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Amiikan ayinaat páhin ti ñíhampaatiin pákasupak. Afáalafi oonool a naanat akee ya, niŋ ekina tom naacok piliit oonool a naapook akee ya. Niyinaat ti coonool kaalehanool káyinan Pútuun pa niŋ pálafi mañ.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Ta <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkásiye ta enke púlooŋ nkalenken Yéesu kamma nkálafiye mañ. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yéesu naasokii: “Aluu ínniyisanyisan <char style="w">pucoonool</char> pa pitaaluu ti ñíkin pakan paka, pale Pútuun pa pímeyimeyi heeyem ha ti saan aluu. Kaatuko eeha pakan paka nkacoke ha nii ihaŋa hitaaku nafaa, Pútuun pa pinataanat ho.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha niŋ cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Yéesu nene asok: “Kilim ka kiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ kiti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa kisiiŋanee-siiŋan fo ti caanak ca citi <char style="w">Saŋ</char>-Patis. Písik ti oom caanak ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> neeyeniyee ti káatuunan. Fiye, an óo an oopa ti íhinu kata kati anako. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Patiila niŋ t’etaam efikahaŋ pacas hícimu cilim ca ceehaŋe ca káafomaati ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Ayíin óo áyiin éefulane aaloo naasa akee aal, ti pahaaño naayem, aŋa lompo eesaye aal aŋa áyiinoo náafulane, ti eloŋ eti pahaaño naayem.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu ha hiti usaanum a niŋ Lasaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Fiye, Yéesu naasok <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa hícantiitu eehe: “Taakaataak usaanum áyiin, nawaso wañ weewalla núuciiti hinoom. Hinak óo hinak la teyoo pahaaño, naayeno ti eloŋ eenape. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Intaak lompo áyiin eeleke, caacawoo Lasaar, aŋa nahinto hátikin putum ekumpaan ya eteyoo, eniinoo púlooŋ kaameeŋ musontuwaay. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Náalafi kahesal aŋa nánowalii ya ti púus pa piti usaanum a apili, piyen pa conko mpíkey mpiyeno kaaneewan musontuwaay ma miteyoo.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Eeleke ya naaket, <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa mpucoopoo mpiyenanoo pukol <char style="w">Abraham</char>. Usaanum a lompo, naaket naahokee. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Pati keekete ka naayeno ti kúnuul kenfakat, ápihaafin naaŋantan pállaaŋe Abraham, Lasaar naayeno pukoloo. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Naaceek apusok: 'Paapaa Abraham, inci ti ñíseeña ñenfakat iyyem le ti uleew ewwe. Keti ti inci ti hikaw, impoñ Lasaar ápikaapuucii pikelan hisiikoo ti man, apumonanam híleeluufam.' <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Pale Abraham naañahanoo: 'Añiinam, náwuno nii aayenaayeno ti eloŋ éesuume, tempo Lasaar naayeno ti kúnuul. Fiye, Lasaar oopa le, ti kaapuuñanoolee, awe oopa ti ñíseeña. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Apan niŋ fúlaa toko, kaayeen kenfakat unka ti pututa unaa, eeha efihiwun ha kéelafiye éfulii petoonii kápifiitanii lupuu ti aluu étikayini, fo lompo incuke ti kéelafiye éfulii lupuu ti aluu nkáfiitanii petoonii.'<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />“Usaanum a naasokoo: 'Paapaa Abraham, ooto inci luumuu, poñ Lasaar pati ekumpaan ya eti paapaa atoom, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />kaatuko inci taakaataak po pakatu isak. Akaay, apicaakamanii heeyem ha pe, poko lompo timpi kákey peti kúnuul enke.' <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abraham naañahanoo: 'Pakatuwi kataakaataak pakiical pa piti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ piti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa, kásiitan po.' <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Usaanum a naasokoo: 'Paapaa Abraham, eehuu hifomut, pale niŋ an áfuliyoo ti keekete ka naakaay teyii, éfikawunko umuuyen wa uteyii.' <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Abraham naasokoo: 'Niŋ kásiitanut Móyiis niŋ piyaamakoola pa, háati an náañohoonii pati keekete ka, étikayinanoo.'”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Kaamuuyen niŋ kaaponket</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Fan óo fan incuke, efitaak waah weekaakaay kanakan an ti kaamuuyen, pale kúnuul efikiyeno ti aŋa éfuunapii ya teyoo. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Fisaka apicenkee ti ekun énankiin enfakat naawantee ti kaatii ka le niŋ afaanakan akee ti kéetinee ka payenke apunow ti kaamuuyen. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Nisiiŋo púsooni!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Niŋ atii ya amuuyenaa, watanoo, niŋ awatanooliyaa imponketoo. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Niŋ amuuyenaa ti awe ñiyema isak niŋ ñésupak ti hinoom ha hoonool ha, náañohoonii ti awe ñiyema isak niŋ ñésupak kaaluum kaaponket, aañaŋoo kaaponket.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">Pupoñapoñ</char> pa nkasok <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>: “Penan unii káyinan.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Ateeteyo naañahanii: “Niŋ nitaakaa káyinan keefomut nii ekoon sootoo, níyiniyini hisoku enuun eyyuu: 'Lúpinoolo inkaasiiŋanoolo ti han,' éfeehin eeha innisoke ha.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Usokaa akee ti aluu ataake amiikan ayaya niŋ fotom afaasa púlukuleen pa piteyoo. Mpáyetaliyoo ti kaakit, fo aafasokoo: 'Hiliikan kéy yeno aapili'? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Haani, aafasokoo: 'Kéy yikam waah ewwa inci fali káciim, naapayaa hiik, immemanoolo uwwufanam pili illaan, niŋ inci payaa, awe conko, illi illaan.' <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Fo aafasok amiikan a apalaka kamma náahine eeha ansokoo ha áhin? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Fo lompo incuke ti aluu, niŋ níhinaa waah ewwa nkasoke wa aluu níhin, nisok: 'Unii pimiikan kenseŋ, páhin pa putoonii lamma núuhine.'”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan pakan ŋaasuwan pakati kanuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yéesu ti pikaayu <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, naanap ti pututa mah ma miti <char style="w">Samali</char> niŋ <char style="w">Galilee</char>. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Akina ti pinako ti cikee cisaatee, pakan ŋaasuwan keekuulut kamma <char style="w">kanuk</char> nkákey kapipaakoolanoo. Nkasiiŋo kápilaaŋoo <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />nkaceekoo niŋ uwiiluyii: “Yéesu, Ahámpaatiin, keti hikaw ti unii!” <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yéesu apucukii, naasokii: “Nikaay cániyisanoolo pati <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char>.” Poko ti pítin pa nkakuulanee.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Akee ti poko, ápipannum nii ákuuñaneekuuñan, náañohoonii ti wootoo, naayeno hímulu Pútuun pa niŋ kaawiiluyoo. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Naanow ti woot Yéesu, puhooŋuyoo t’etaam, naasokoo apalaka. Antúŋ ati Samali. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yéesu naacakan: “Fo ŋaasuwan ya púlooŋ tom ekuulanee? Isak ya niŋ pakapaakiil paka peyme nkayem? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Háati akee ti poko ayinaat éñohoonii ápumul Pútuun pa fo niŋ neetaat ati Samali ya aŋe, eeneetaat a ati <char style="w">Israyel</char>?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Naasokoo: “Lito, kaay, káyinan ka kitii kúkuuñanuu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekéy ya eti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Hikee hinoom, pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> nkacakan Yéesu: “Teyme <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> éficikey?” Yéesu naañahanii: “Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa éticikey samat nii waah ewwa nuucukee. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />An atasok: 'Nisincan! Ehee co!' niŋ fotom 'Ahaa co!' kaatuko cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa unca ti aluu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Púful toko Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Caanak unca ti ékey, éfinilafi fanfaŋ hicuku hinoom hoonool ti kunoom ka kiti inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, pale etinicuk ho. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Pakan efikasok aluu: 'Nisincan! Eheeyoo le!' niŋ ekina tom: 'Ahaayoo pa!' Pale timpi nikaay, timpi ninapanii. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kaatuko inci, Añii An, éfikey samat nii fa pamaliñoolal etiil mpicaaŋan fa patiila púlooŋ písik ti púcook fo ti pikelan. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Pale fo inci yáañ yeno ti kúnuul kenfakat, impookee ti <char style="w">ekaay</char> eyye.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />“Samat nii fa intaakiye fa ti caanak ca citi Nowe,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6-9">Púcook 6–9</ref></char></note> fo lompo inkaakaay pitaako ti kunoom ka kiti inci, Añii An. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Pakan paka nkayeno hili, pálaani, esa niŋ pinimo fo ti hinoom eeha Nowe náayuukiye ha ti piteen pa penfakat pa. Fiye, etiil ya néenupii man menfakat fo mumukalii púlooŋ cew. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Fo lompo incuke ti kunoom ka kiti Lot:<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:16-19:29">Púcook 18:16–19:29</ref></char></note> Pakan paka nkayeno hili niŋ pálaani, hinoom niŋ kaanooman, pusuk niŋ kulut. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Pale hinoom eeha Lot náafule ha Sotom, seemak niŋ kíceek ínsifulii patiila, insimukalii púlooŋ cew.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />“Fo lompo facuk ti hinoom eeha inci, Añii An, inkaakaay ha éyisanoolo. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Ti oom hinoom aŋa eeyem patiila piteefu ekumpaan naataak waahoo páhantuwa, timpi áwanoonii apucoop wo. Fo lompo incuke, aŋa eekaaye piya, añaŋut puñoho t’enuuf. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Nínawuno heetaakiye ha Lot aaloo!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Púcook 19:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Aŋa éelafiye kafakan eloŋ ya eteyoo, áfaapuul teyyo, pale aŋa éepuule eloŋ ya eteyoo afaafakan yo. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Inci pusok aluu: Oom hánant pakan pákasupak efikahinto nantoonool, oonool áfaaseepinee akee ya naakatee toko. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Pakaal pákasupak efikayeno pútuum ti ésiken yoonool; oonool áfaaseepinee, akee ya naakatee toko.” [<verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">An ámiit man Luk lompo akiice fiye: pákayiin pákasupak efikayeno ti kaakit; oonool áfaaseepinee, akee ya naakatee toko </char></note>]<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Pinapana pa pakateyoo nkacakanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, peyme eehuu nihikaakaay pitaako?” Naañahanii: “La ehunuŋ neeyem, toko píketul pa mpuconcool.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu piŋiino ti kaluum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Fiye, Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo hícantiitu eehe ápiyisanii nii kañaŋaa kaluum tan óo tan timpi káwusen. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Naasokii: “Taakaataak ti ekee saatee áyiin áhina kíiti eefeyut Pútuun pa apaaliit an. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Ti saatee eyyuu lompo, intaako eyaaŋat aŋa áyiinoo eekete, apinakaay pateyoo kati áhin kíiti ti pututayoo niŋ akamooloo.<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />“Fo ta infiyye innapook, pale ti pikelan naasokoolo: 'Háati inci feyut Pútuun pa niŋ ekina tom paaliit an <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />pale, páawoo aal aŋe oopa ti ihampuyam meemak, inci fasiiŋiyoo. Niŋ inci hínut fo átayekuno ékey hinak óo hinak kayokanam.'”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Fiye, <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> nene asok: “Nísiitan áhina kíiti ya eenaput a aŋuu eeha naasoke ha. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Fo Pútuun pa efipukuut ti pisiiŋo pakan paka payenka mpimamale ka, keeyem ka ti kaayonkal etempo hánant hanakan kati piyankananii? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Inci pusok ho aluu, efipisiiŋiyii mpacas. Pale inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, niŋ inci ñóhooniyoo fo éfitookii t’etaam keetaake káyinan?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu ha hiti Afalisaay niŋ asayoola kúncoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Fiye, intaako toko keecokooliye nii <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char>, nkátinan ti pakakee paka. Tempo, Yéesu naasokii hícantiitu eehe: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Taakaataak pakan pákasupak keekaaye ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> kaluum: akee ya <char style="w">Afalisaay</char>, akee ya <char style="w">asayoola kúncoo</char>. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Afalisaay a naasiiŋo citeeteyoo naaluum: 'Inci sokuu apalaka Pútuun kamma inci incukut nii pakakee paka, keeyem ka pílipa, keecoonoolut, pihaañiya niŋ pakaal niŋ fotom samat nii asayoola kúncoo ya aŋe. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Insunsuŋ kunoom kúsupak ti lóokuŋ ya, uwwufani himpaac ha heewase ha ŋaasuwan ti waah óo waah púlooŋ ewwa inci intaake tewwo cooy.'<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Pale asayoola kúncoo ya naasiiŋo pílaaŋ, álafiit fala káahaafin, pale náasitan, naasok: 'Pútuun, taak paket hikaw ti inci, amuuyena ya.'”<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yéesu naasokii: “Inci pusok aluu, áyiin a aŋuu, ta naayeniye ta piyetu, akina Pútuun pa mpucoke nii eecoonoole pale Afalisaay a tom. Kaatuko an óo an eesilanooliye áfaawananiyee, an óo an eewananooliye afaasilanee.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ epuuk ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Púful toko, pakan nkácoopii miñii ti Yéesu kati álikii. Pinapana pa pakateyoo kapucuk eehuu nkafet ti kéecoopii ka miñii ma. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Pale Yéesu naayonkal epuuk ya naasok: “Nikatan epuuk ya kápikey ti inci, timpi nikitii. Kaatuko <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> citi keecuke ka nii poko. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, an atanako ti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa taamanta asayanut co samat nii ciñii.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usaanum niŋ cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Ati hikaw ati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> naacakan Yéesu: “Ahámpaatiin eenape yuu, puume inci iññaŋe íhinu pitaak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Weyme uwune ayyonkalam eenape? Taakut an eenape fo Pútuun pa lamma. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Fo áamiit <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char>? 'Timpi hinto niŋ aal eenimiye, timpi muk an ti pásuumayi, timpi líp, timpi caam aapunook akinooli, nápiyan paapaa atii niŋ íññaa atii.'”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Naañahan Yéesu: “Eehuu púlooŋ inci íntuule kápiliŋ maañiiyaayam.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Ta Yéesu náasiye ta eehe, naasokoo: “Waah woonool uwwa toko ewwa ánhinut: Nooman hitaaku ha hitii púlooŋ uwwufan mañ ma keeleke ka, aafataak hisaanumate alacana, náafulaa toko ínkey, innapanam.”<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Pale ta áyiin a náasiye ta eehe ínciitiyoo meemak, kamma naataake fo muus. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yéesu apisincanoo, naasok: “Cíiticiiti kusaanum ka kapinako ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Fo ñonkomoo éfeeyini pinako ti káfuun saakilaŋ? Haani! Pale pinako pa piti usaanum ti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa efipihaŋ páciite.” <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Keeyeniyoo ka káasiitan, nkacakan: “Fiye, ayme conko áfaayiniyee kafakan?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Waah wa weeheeke wa an, uheekut Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Fiye, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naacoop hilim ha, naasok Yéesu: “Sincan, unii ukatanaakatan waah wa utoonii púlooŋ nuunapani.” <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, an óo an eekatane enuuf, aal, ñúnu niŋ pakatu, pupuka, epuuk kamma cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />afaahaŋ hitaaku meemak ti caanak ca citi fíyooy, niŋ ti caanak ca ceeyem ca ti ékey, eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Píhaaciyenu káakup Yéesu kiti eketoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Púful toko, Yéesu naacoop ti kaapii <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa pakateyoo ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka, naasokii: “Nísiitan, unaa unka ti pisilo <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, waah wa púlooŋ ewwa <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa nkakiice wa kiti inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, efuutaako. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Efikawufanam <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>. Efíkapalahoolam nkalenkenam, nkakallanam, nkafaacal ti inci. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Efikasapam niŋ kisawut, nkamukam. Ti hinoom ha híhaaciyenu ha fálitoonii ti eket ya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Pupoñapoñ pa kásiit eeha naayemii ti hisoku. Putum hilim ha nihiyolee teyii, kámiit eeha Yéesu náalafiyii hisoku.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan káafuumafuum pukol Jeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yéesu ta naalohane ta Jeriko, áyiin éefuume naayeno ti kanaac pítin pa, apiyeno kaaluumatool. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Kípisi kayoŋ ka ti himuusu, nkicakanii heetaakiye. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Nkasokoo: “Yéesu ati Naasalet ayem ti himuusu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Ta káafuumafuum ka nkísiye ta eehe nkíceekii apusok: “Yéesu añii ya ati <char style="w">Dawid</char>, taak paket hikaw ti inci!” <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Keeyeniye ka hátikin nkafet teyoo nkasokoo afatan, pale naahaŋ toko náaceekii: “Añii ya ati Dawid taak paket hikaw ti inci!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yéesu naasiiŋo naasokii: “Nícoopiyamoo.” Ta náalohaniyoo ta, Yéesu naacakanoo: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Weyme állafiye inci píhini?” Naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, káluma hínam pinee cuk.” <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Ñoho ti hicuku, káyinan ka kitii kúkuuñanuu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Tokotoko ñíkinoo íññipankino, naanapan Yéesu, naayeno hímulu Pútuun pa. Kayoŋ ka púlooŋ kupucuk eehuu lompo, nkiyeno hímulu Pútuun pa.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ Sakaay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Púful toko, Yéesu naanako ti saatee ya eti Jeriko. Apiyeno himuusu saatee ya, <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />intaako toko áyiin aŋa nkasok Sakaay, akee ti ñíhampaatiin <char style="w" lemma="Asayoola kúncoo">pisayoola kúncoo</char> ya, naayeno usaanum. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Náalafi hicuku ayme ayem Yéesu, pale patameyoo mpuwun ayinaat kamma kayoŋ ka. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Fiye, naatey hátikin pa Yéesu naañaŋe pa himuusu, naasilo ti enuun kati acukoo. <figure style="fig" alt="Zacchaeus in tree" file="LB00313B.TIF" size="col" loc="19:3-6" copy="Knowles" ref="19:4">Sakaay patiila ti enuun</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yéesu ápucolii toko náahaafin naasokoo: “Sakaay, wánoonii mpacas, kaatuko fíyooy, fo inci wanan pati awe.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Sakaay náawanoonii mpacas, naawanan Yéesu niŋ pásuuma.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Pakan paka púlooŋ kapucuk eehuu nkáyaañ káakumutool kapusok: “Pati amuuyena naakaaye apuwanan.” <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Pale Sakaay naasiiŋo, naasok <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>: “Sincan, Ahámpaatiin! Inci fawufan kancaŋ hisaanumate ha hitoom keeleke ka, an óo an aŋa ammeya nii inci lípoolip, fañahanoo fo ñapaakiil aŋa inci incoope ya teyoo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Fíyooy kafakan ka kúcoliyoo ti ekumpaan eyye, kamma aŋe lompo naayem ati miin ma miti <char style="w">Abraham</char>. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kaatuko inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, kéyyookey hiŋes niŋ kafakan keelinciye ka.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti sisanoo ŋaasuwan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Yéesu fa naalohane fa <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, pakan paka incukii nii etikamp Pútuun pa efipisiiŋan <char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> etempo. Ekina ewune, poko ti káasiitanoo ka, Yéesu naapenanii hícantiitu eehe. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Naasokii: “Taakaataak áyiin eemaka eeyeniye pikaayu ti mah méelaaŋe, pa naakaakaayee hicoku amansa ya ati mah ma miteyoo, niŋ apayaa náañohoonii. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Akáayum, náayonkalii ŋaasuwan ti pimiikan pa pakateyoo naawufan an óo an sanoo yoonool naasokii: 'Niyesanool nempo fo ta inci fáñohoonii.' <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Pale, pakan paka pakati saatee ya kanatoonat, nkapoñ pusonoo pakan kapica kasok nii: 'Unii úlafiit áyiin a aŋe apiyeno amansa ya atoonii.'<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Pale toko fiyaaw, náayenoonii amansa ya, náañohoonii ti mah ma miteyoo. Naayonkal pimiikan pa payenkuu naawufane ka pisanoo kati ámeyi puume nkataakale. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ayáañ a náakey naasokoo: 'Ahámpaatiin, sanoo ya etii epukaa sikee sisanoo ŋaasuwan.' <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Amansa ya naasokoo: 'Aáhinaa kata, awe amiikan eenape! Páawoo aacoonoolaa-coonool niŋ waah wenkilis, inci fáhini ati hikaw ati sisaatee ŋaasuwan.' <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Asúpiyenu ya náakey, naasokoo: 'Ahámpaatiin, sanoo ya etii epukaa sikee sisanoo isak.' <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Amansa ya naasokoo: 'Awe lompo inci fáhini ati hikaw ati sisaatee isak.'<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Akee amiikan náakey, naasokoo: 'Ahámpaatiin, ehe sanoo ya eyya awwufanaam ya, inci túkaatuk yo ti cifaal immank yo. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Inci feyuufe, kamma ayyem áyiin eefete. Ansasa waah ewwa ayyenanut, immaañ waah ewwa ansukut.' <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Amansa ya naañahanoo: 'Ti pákupali inci inkaakaay íhinuyi kíiti, awe amiikan eenaput! Iyyoo! Aámeyimeyi nii inci áyiin eefete, insasa waah ewwa inci iyyenanut, immaañ waah ewwa inci insukut. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Weyme uwune aanakanut sanoo ya etoom ti émankuma mañ, ancuk niŋ inci ñóhooniyoo, insa yo niŋ waah weenanfe teyyo?'<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Fiye, naasok keeyeniye ka toko: 'Nicoop sanoo ya eteyoo inniwufan yo aŋa eetaake ya sisanoo ŋaasuwan.' <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Nkasokoo: 'Ahámpaatiin, aŋuu apayaapa hitaaku sisanoo ŋaasuwan!' <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Naañahanii: 'Inci pusok aluu: An óo an eetaake, afaapenanee, pale an óo an eetaakut, háati caahinkilis ya eyya naataake ya efeesayee teyoo. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Pale pikamoolam keesoke ka kálafiit inci kati yeno amansa ya ateyii, nikaay nípicoopiyii le hátikinam innimukii.'”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pinako pa piti Yéesu Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yéesu ta naapaye ta hisoku eehuu, naanow kayoŋ ka hátikin, apiyeno pisilo <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Ta nkalohane ta Petifake niŋ Betani, la nkasok la cítintiŋ ca enca nkasok ca Olif, naapoñ pákasupak ti pinapana pa pakateyoo, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />naasokii: “Nikaay ti cisaatee ca ceeyem ca hátikin aluu, niŋ ninakiyaa tenco efinitook cífali ceecenkee toko enca an ataapala alapo tenco, níkopinii co, ínnicoopiyam co. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Niŋ an acakanaa aluu: 'Weyme uwune ínniyemi co ti kákopin?' niñahanoo: 'Ahámpaatiin a asoolahe co.'”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Keepoñee ka nkakaay incakatook samat nii fa Yéesu naasokii fa. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Kapiyeno kákopin cífali ca, pakateete co nkacakanii: “Weyme uwune ínniyemi co ti kákopin?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Nkañahanii: “Ateeteyo asoolahe co.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Nkácoopii co Yéesu, nkalemp kúsool ka kiteyii kenfakat ka ti cífali ca, nkalapanoo tenco. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Akina ti pikaayu pa, pakan paka nkatanaloo kúsool ka kiteyii kenfakat ka ti pítin pa.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Apulohan Jerusalem, ti pítin pa piti eliiŋoon ya eti cítintiŋ ca enca nkasok ca Olif, kayoŋ ka púlooŋ kiti pinapana pa pakateyoo nkimeeŋ niŋ pásuuma, nkíyaañ kaanimpan Pútuun pa niŋ kilim keeceeke kamma nkacuke waah weecukantee. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Nkasok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">
    <char style="qt">“Alímaati <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa pisampan amansa ya éekeyii ya ti caacaw etempo!</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:26">Kícimu 118:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Kásuumaay kiyeno alacana, núumulaa Pútuun pa piti patiila.”<figure style="fig" alt="Triumphal entry" file="CNT5531a.png" size="span" loc="19:35-40" copy="Cook" ref="19:38">Ta Yéesu naayeniye ta kalohan saatee ya eti Jerusalem</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa keeyeniye ka ti kayoŋ ka nkasok Yéesu: “Ahámpaatiin, fet ti pinapana pa pakatii kapifatan!” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Inci pusok aluu, niŋ kafatanaa, pínankiin pa éfipiceekii!”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yéesu apihaŋ naalohane Jerusalem, naacuk saatee ya, naakooŋ kiteeteyyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Naasok: “Niŋ awe lompo Jerusalem aameya ti hinoom eehe waah ewwa éfuucoopiyi kásuumaay ka! Pale fiye eehuu hiyoleeyol ti ñíkini. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Hileeŋi kamma ámmiit, kaatuko caanak unca ti ékey ta pikamooli éfikakiiti púlooŋ, nkákinkooli, nkakincooli ti upii wa púlooŋ. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Efikatuncalooli niŋ epuuki; etikakat énankiin eenaŋiye ti ekee, kamma ankiiwut ta Pútuun pa mpíkeyii ta kafakani.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu la ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Ta Yéesu naacole ta <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, naanako ti <char style="w">hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, náayaañ hiyaanu punoomana pa. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Naasokii: “Kiiceekiic ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nii: <char style="qt">'Ekumpaan ya etoom ekumpaan éluumuma,'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Esayi 56:7</ref></char></note> pale aluu inniyesan yo <char style="qt">'éyolowuma pikanca'</char>!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Jeremiya 7:11</ref></char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Naayeno kakalaŋan hinak óo hinak ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya. <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis niŋ pakakee ñíhampaatiin ti pakan paka, nkálafiyoo himuku. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Pale, kámiit fa nkakaakaay íhinu, kamma pakan paka púlooŋ nkayemoo ti káasiitan meemak.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Kacakan ka kiti kayine ka kiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Hikee hinoom, Yéesu naayeno kakalaŋan pakan paka ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> niŋ káatuunanii ekooŋan ya éesuume ya. <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis niŋ pakakee ñíhampaatiin nkácolii. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Nkasokoo: “Sok unii, awe yem ayme heewune áayemi ti íhinu eehuu? Ayme asokuu hín ho?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Inci lompo taakaataak ti aluu kacakan. Nisokam: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" /><char style="w">pátise</char> ya eti <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, ti ayme néefulii, ti Pútuun pa fo ti pakan paka?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Fiye nkayeno piteŋenool ti pututayii, nkasokoolo: “Niŋ unaa usokaa, ti Pútuun pa néefulii, afaasok unaa, ooto weyme uwune níyinanutoo? <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Pale niŋ usokaa ti pakan paka néefulii, kayoŋ ka púlooŋ efikumuk unaa niŋ pukumpa, kamma nkíyinane nii Saŋ <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char>.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Fiye, nkañahanoo: “Umíit ti ayme néefulii.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Inci lompo etisok aluu eesokaam ya hín eehe.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti púluwaasa keekance</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Fiye, Yéesu naasok hícantiitu eehe pakan paka: “Taakaataak akee áyiin eesuke kaakitoo kiti wiiñ, náaluwaas ko pakakee píhina, naakaay kaakaawool ti mikee mah keefiyye. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Ta hisaatu ha níhituuniye ta, naapoñ akee ti pimiikan pa pakateyoo ti púluwaasa pa kati kawufanoo putum pa piteyoo ti pasaatal pa. Pale púluwaasa pa nkasap amiikan a, nkayaanoo sipeesoo ñaanii. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Fiye, ati kaakit ka nene apoñ akee amiikan, pale aŋuu lompo púluwaasa pa nkasapoo, nkateñaloo, nkayaanoo sipeesoo ñaanii. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Nene apoñ amiikan áhaaciyenu, púluwaasa pa nkasapoo, nkakuumoo, nkayaanoo. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Fiye, ati kaakit ka naasok: 'Puume inci inkaakaay íhinu? Inci fapoñ añiinam aŋa inci íllafiye ya, manti kátuuloo.' <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Pale ta púluwaasa pa nkaŋantanoo ta nkateŋenool nkasok: 'Aha aŋa akaakaay ya hitoonu kaakit ka, umukoo ancuk kaakit ka kiyeniyaa kutuunaa.' <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Nkawantoo tíkitaaŋ kaakit ka, nkamukoo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Fiye, Yéesu naasok: “Puume ati kaakit ka naakaakaayii íhinu? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Afáakey naamuk púluwaasa pa, náaluwaas kaakit ka pakakee.” Ta pakan paka nkásiye ta eehe nkasok: “Alímaati eehuu timpi hitaako!” <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yéesu naasincanii naasok: “Ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>, eeheyme pakiical empe mpusoke:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="qt">'Enánkiin ya eyya puluta pa nkawante ya </char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="qt">éyenoonii énankiin ya eehaŋe ya hitaaku nafaa'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Kícimu 118:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>?<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />“An óo an eenowe ti oom énankiin afaahumaloolee, an óo an aŋa neenowe teyoo afaatuncaloolee.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">Pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char>, nkámeyi nii poko kawune Yéesu naasok hícantiitu eehe. Nkálafiyoo hicoku tokotoko pale nkafe kayoŋ ka.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kacakan ka kiti cooy kúncoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">Pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña nkatah kunuuwii meemak ti Yéesu, nkapoñ mikelecoola teyoo kéehine faŋii nii pakan <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char>. Nkálafi hikuucuyoo ti pákupaloo, kati kacokoo nkawufanoo ati hikaw ha ati mah ma. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Nkacakanoo eehe: “Ahámpaatiin, unii úmeyimeyi nii ánkupkup inkalaŋan <char style="w">pucoonool</char> ciit, niŋ fúlaa toko aasincanantoo ti sicaw, pale ti pánipani ya ankalaŋan pítin pa piti Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Sok unii: Fo cooneecoon fo coonutee upucooy kúncoo ya amansa ya enfakat a ati <char style="w">Room</char>?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amansa ya enfakat a nasokee <char style="w">Sesaal</char>. Ti oom caanak, amansa óo amansa enfakat ati Room nasokee Sesaal.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Pale Yéesu náameyi nii hikuucuyoo nkayaake, naasokii: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Níyisanam kaahit kiti mañ, puhooŋu niŋ caacaw ayme kayem toko?” Nkañahanoo: “Piti amansa ya enfakat a.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Fiye naasokii: “Ooto, niwufan amansa ya waah wa uteyoo, inniwufan Pútuun pa waah etempo.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Fiye, hátikin pakan paka kayinaatoo hicoku ti pákupaloo, nkaŋaŋo ti pañahanaloo nkakemanool kem.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pusatusaay pa niŋ pilito pa ti eket ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Púful toko, pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Asatusaay">Pusatusaay</char> nkákey ti Yéesu. Pusatusaay pa káyinanut ti élitoonii ya eti keekete ka. Nkacakanoo: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Ahámpaatiin, <char style="w">Móyiis</char> akiicaakiic ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> nii: niŋ áyiin asayaa aal naaket peetaakut añii, atuwoo añaŋaa hitoonu aal a, naataak neyoo epuuk pakati púnuwoo eekete ya kati ataak cánkut.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Kakaman 25:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Fiye, intaako hínum ti miin moonool pákayiin isak niŋ pákasupak. Ayáañ a naasa naaket peetaakut añii. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Asúpiyenu ya naatoon aal a, ataakut añii, naaket. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Aháaciyenu ya lompo naatoonoo. Fo lompo incuke, ti isak ya niŋ pákasupak paka nkatoonoo, nkaket peetaakut neyoo añii. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Ti pikelan aal a lompo naaket. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Fiye, hinak ti pilito pa ti eket ya, aal a aŋuu ati ayme, páawoo isak ya niŋ pákasupak paka púlooŋ kasayoo?”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> piti fíyooy, pakan paka nkasasa nkanimo. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Payenka Pútuun pa mpusoke ka nii poko kanape kati kalitanee ti eket ya nkakin ti púlunta pa peeyem pa ti ékey etikasa, etikanimo. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Etínekayini eket, kaatuko kacukaacuk nii <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa, ekina ewune etikasa etikanimo. Poko epuuk Pútuun kamma nkalitanee ti eket ya. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Móyiis náayisan picaaŋ cataŋ nii keekete ka éfikalitoonii. La sokee la ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> kiti cífita ca ceecoke ca apan cisowiit, naayonkal <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> 'Pútuun pa piti <char style="w">Abraham</char>, Pútuun pa piti <char style="w">Isaak</char>, Pútuun pa piti <char style="w">Jakob</char>.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Efúlii 3:6</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:15-16">15-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Pútuun pa pineetaat piti keekete ka pale piti keeloŋe ka, kaatuko ti Pútuun pa an óo an oopa kaloŋa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Pakakee ti <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis nkasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, áakupaa pitempo tak!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Kaatuko nene káhaañiitoo kacakan hikee hilim.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eenucee ya ati Pútuun pa, añii ati ayme?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yéesu naasokii: “Weyme uwune pakan paka nkasok <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa, añii ya ati <char style="w">Dawid</char>? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dawid himuumoo asokaasok ti pakiical pa piti kícimu ka:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="qt">'<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa púkupaakup niŋ Ateeteyo atoom ti hisoku:</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="qt">Kéy yeniyam epees yáali,</char>
    <verse eid="LUK 20:42" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />
    <char style="qt">fo ta inci fatah ta pikamooli ti wooti ayyeno amansa ya ateyii.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Kícimu 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="LUK 20:43" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />“Dawid himuumoo nayonkal Eenucee ya 'Ateeteyo', puume akina áfaayini piyeno añii ati Dawid?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káwasum pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ta pakan paka púlooŋ nkayeniyoo ta káasiitan, Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Níwasum <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis. Poko, nkálafilafi kaamuusool niŋ kúsool kenfakat, nkálafi lompo kapinkakicanee pinapnap ti kíliŋ ka. Poko nkálafi piyeno ti kúkon ka keenape ka ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa niŋ ti hili ha henfakat ha. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Poko lompo nkacaakool piyaaŋat pa payenka pákayiinii keekete ka, kapucoop waah wa uteyii púlooŋ. Apan niŋ kayeniyaa kaluum nkafiyo kati kacokee nii pakan keenape. Pútuun pa efipisapii pihaŋ pakakee paka.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Kawun kiti eyaaŋat eeleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma, Yéesu naayeno kaasincanool pakan paka ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, naacuk kusaanum ka ti hiwasu mañ ti éwasuma mañ ma, emma nkácoopii ma kati kawufan mo Pútuun pa. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Naacuk lompo eyaaŋat eeleke, aŋa áyiinoo eekete, naawase toko uhit úsupak weetaakut nafaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, aal a aŋuu eeleke ya ahaŋa kawufan pakan paka púlooŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kaatuko pakan paka, mañ ma emma nkasoolahut ma nkawase lupo, pale akina ti palekoo naawufan púlooŋ aŋa naataake ya kati aloŋ.” <figure style="fig" alt="Widow putting money in offering box" file="CNT5573a.png" size="col" loc="21:2-4" copy="Cook" ref="21:4">Aal eeyem ti hiwasu mañ ti éwasuma mañ ma</figure><verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu kakaman ka kiteyoo kiti heekaakaay ékey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Fiye, pakakee ti pinapana pa nkayeno hímulu <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, niŋ pawalle pínankiin pa péewalliyanoole yo pa, niŋ pawalle pa lompo piti waah wa weewufanee wa Pútuun pa. Yéesu naasokii: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Nicukaacuk kiniŋ enkuu púlooŋ? Caanak unca ti ékey an atacuk énankiin eenaŋiye ti ekee, efipitahalee púlooŋ.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Pinapana pa nkacakan Yéesu: “Ahámpaatiin, eehuu, teyme nihikaakaay pitaako? Weyme éfuuyisan unii nii eehuu uuha ti ékey pitaako tokofiye?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yéesu naasokii: “Nisiiŋo púsooni, an timpi acaakool aluu. Kaatuko hícump pakan éfikakey ti caacawam kapusok: 'Inci yem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa!' niŋ ekina tom 'Caanak ca cícoliyoo!' Timpi ninapanii. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Innísiyaa kiti kikam niŋ ñítaakool, timpi nife kaatuko eehuu hiñaŋaa pitaako, pale pikelan empuu étipikey tokofiye.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Púful toko, nene asokii: “Mah éfimitaakoolan mah, cáwii íncitaakoolan cáwii. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Efitaako pan óo pan páyiyiŋanal etaam penfakat, púpankul niŋ úkuuñu wenfakat uti eket. Píyisan peefeyanana lompo mpucukee patiila.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />“Pale eehuu púlooŋ hítaakumo, efikacok aluu, nkakallan aluu. Efikacoop aluu ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa kati káhin aluu kíiti, nkakul aluu. Nkawufan aluu pumansa pa niŋ pakati kikaw ka kamma inci. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Toko efinitaak efaah eti kakamanii inci yem ayme. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Timpi niwasoolo kúnuul ti eeha innikaakaay hisoku kati nifak, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />kaatuko inci fawufan aluu kilim ka niŋ ecohato ya. Háati oonool ti keepooke ka aluu átayini pisiiŋo hátikin aluu niŋ ekina tom naanook aluu. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Pupuka aluu, pakatu aluu, ñúnu aluu, pakan aluu niŋ pákawi aluu kakaakaay kawufan aluu pakati kikaw ka, pakakee ti aluu efikamukee. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Pakan paka púlooŋ efikanat aluu kamma inci, <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />pale háati kaahan koonool etikiñakee ti kikaw aluu. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Niŋ nimukutaa efinitaak eloŋ ya etaaluu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Yéesu nene asokii: “Niŋ nicukaa <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> néekinkoolee niŋ pusoocaali, ínnimeyi nii enow eteyyo écoliyoo. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Fiye, keeyem ka ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> kañaŋaa katey pati pítintiŋ pa, keeyem ka Jerusalem káful, keeyem ka tíkitaaŋ saatee ya timpi kánakoonii. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kaatuko ti kunoom enkuu Pútuun pa mpikaakaay hisapu pakan etempo. Hikina hikiicee ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>, fo hitaako. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Kunoom enkuu efikiyeno keeseeñe ti pakaal paka keeyem ka niŋ munow niŋ keeyem ka ti káacuuwan! Kaatuko efitaako ñíyoka ñenfakat ti mah emme, Pútuun pa mpíñiken teyii. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Pakakee paka efikamukee niŋ káakuntu, pakakee paka nkacokee nkacoopee ti hícump mah méelaaŋe. Keeneetaat ka ti káyinan ka kutuunaa efikakakalool Jerusalem fo ta kunoom enka nkawufanii ka efikipa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Yéesu nene asokii: “Píyisan efipiyeno ti caanak ca, ti hiim ha, niŋ ti picaaŋaŋ pa. Ti etaam ya, kaatii ka efikiliiñool, kúsuu ka lompo nkisap meemak, pakan paka púlooŋ efikafe meemak, étikameyi fa éfikahin. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Pakan paka efikaket niŋ ewatate ti káamiilool heekaakaay ha pitaako ti etaam ya, kaatuko sempe óo sempe siti patiila éfisiyiyiŋan. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Tempo, efikacuk inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, ti éfulii ti útiŋu wa uti patiila niŋ sempe niŋ hamake henfakat. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Fiye, niŋ eehe híyaañaa pitaako, nisiiŋo ínnisaalino, kaatuko kafakan ka kitaaluu kúlohaniyoo-lohan.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yéesu apipa, nene asokii hilim eehe: “Nisincan enuun sootoo ya niŋ pikee punuun pa, <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />emma mpíyayanii ma pahatal péeyeeni innicuk niŋ ñíkin aluu, ínnimeyi nii etiil ya élohaniyoo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: pasowe pa púlohaniyoo</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Fo lompo incuke, innicukaa eehe fiye ti pitaako, ínnimeyi nii <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cílohaniyoo-lohan. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, <char style="w">ekaay</char> eyye etepa eket ekina peecukut enke fiye púlooŋ nkitaakiye. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Patiila niŋ t’etaam éfikacim pale kilim ka kutoom étikicim.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Nitah kunuu! Timpi níluuŋoolo ti pahaaño, ékuman niŋ ekina tom káamiilool eloŋ ya, níwasum hinoom eehuu timpi himint aluu <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />samat nii fa cala nemint soon. Kaatuko éfihinowii ti pakan paka púlooŋ keeyem ka ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Timpi niŋooyal, inniluum tan óo tan kati nitaak sempe siti hifaku ti waah wa weekaakaay wa écolii, niŋ sempe siti pisiiŋo hátikin inci, Añii An.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Nihanakan ha, Yéesu nayeno kakalaŋan pakan paka ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa, kániim ka nakaay hiŋotu ti cítintiŋ ca enca nkasok ca Olif. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Nuulap pakan paka nkáfiis piyito nkakaay pati hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya káasiitanoo.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Piteŋenool himuku Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Pahaaño pa piti kúmpuul ka keetaakut ka leweñoo, empa nkasok pa <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char>, mpúlohanii. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis nkayeno hiŋes fa éfikahin kapumuk Yéesu, pale nkafe pakan paka.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Fiye, <char style="w">Seetaani</char> neenako Judas aŋa nkasok a Iskaliyot, akee ti <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Judas naakaay hicuku ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin pakati púwuulu pa keeyeniye ka efaas <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> kapiteŋenool puume naañaŋii kawufan Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Insúumii meemak, nkásiyool kati kawufanoo mañ. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Judas naacoon, naayeno hiŋes káasiiŋuma keenape kati awufanii Yéesu, kayoŋ ka peeneetaat toko. <figure style="fig" alt="Judas with chief priests" file="LB00319B.TIF" size="col" loc="22:4-6" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="22:6">Ta Yutas naayeniye ta hífulu ti Yéesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káciim ka kiti Himuusu ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Hinoom ha hiti pahaaño pa piti Kúmpuul ka keetaakut ka leweñoo níhicolii, ta nkañaŋe ta kaawaaseen císaacii ca citi <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char>. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yéesu naapoñ <char style="w">Piyeer</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char> naasokii: “Nikaay canimemanool káciim ka kutuunaa kiti Himuusu ha kati uliyaa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Nkacakanoo: “Peyme állafiye upumemanool ko?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Naañahanii: “Nísiitan, niŋ ninakiyaa ti saatee ya, efinipaakool niŋ áyiin eetiyye élumpa eti man. Inninow pusonoo fo ti ekumpaan eyya afaanako ya, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />innisok ati ekumpaan ya: 'Ahámpaatiin a asok, leyme ékaap ya neeyem la naakaakaay hili káciim ka kiti Himuusu ha niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo?' <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Afáayisan aluu patiila ti ekumpaan ya ékaap enfakat eepayee kaamemanool. Toko efinimemanool káciim ka kutuunaa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Nkakaay nkatook waah óo waah samat nii fa Yéesu naasokii fa. Fiye, nkamemanool káciim ka kiti Himuusu ha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:13">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Last Supper" file="CNT5601a.png" size="col" loc="22:14-19" copy="Cook" ref="22:13">Káciim ka kiti Ateeteyo </figure> <verse eid="LUK 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Caanak ca cípituuno, Yéesu naayeno niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa pakateyoo kati kali. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Naasokii: “Fa inci inhiliikane hínum hili císaacii ca citi <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char> niŋ aluu le niŋ inci facuk kúnuul. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kaatuko inci pusok aluu: etinene li císaacii ca citi Himuusu ha, fo ta eeha pahaaño pa mpútuule ha efihitaako pati <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Naacoop elontoŋ eti elaan naasok Pútuun pa apalaka kiteyyo, naasok: “Nicoop elaan eyye nipisayool aluu púlooŋ. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Kaatuko inci pusok aluu, etinene laan elaan wiiñ fo ta cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa éficikey.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Fiye, naacoop hímpuul naasok Pútuun pa apalaka, naafiit ho, naawufanii ho, naasok: “Aŋe eyem eniinam eewufanee ya aluu, níhin eehe kati nínawuniyam.”<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Kapipa hili, naacoop lompo elontoŋ ya eti elaan wiiñ ya naasok: “Elontoŋ eyye eti <char style="w">písiyool</char> pa péeyeeni pa piti Pútuun pa niŋ pakan etempo; elaan wiiñ eteyyo ekina eyem hísimam heeniisee ha kamma aluu. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Pale nisincan: Epees aŋa eekaakaay ya hífulu ti inci, yoopiya le niŋ etoom ya ti púus pa. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Kaatuko inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, faket samat nii fa Pútuun pa mpusoke fa, pale kúnuul efikiyeno ti aŋa éefule ya ti inci.” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Pupoñapoñ pa pakateyoo nkáyaañ picakanool ayme akaakaay íhinu eehuu.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pílaacinool pa piti aŋa eehaŋe ya pamake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Pinapana pa pakati Yéesu nkayeno pílaacinool peesowa cút ti eecukee nii akina ayem aŋa eehaŋe ya pamake. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yéesu naasokii: “Ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>, pumansa pa kataakaataak sempe ti pakan paka, pakati kayine ka nkálafi kapusokee píhina heenape. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Hikina tom hiñaŋe ti aluu. Eemaka ya ti aluu añaŋaa piyeno nii akelan, ati hikaw ha samat nii áhina. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ayme ayem eemaka ya, aŋa nkawufane ya apili fo amiikan a? Fo aŋa nkawufane ya tom hili ha? Pale inci oopa le ti pututa aluu samat nii amiikan.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Nisiiŋaasiiŋo niŋ inci ti páciite pa putoom. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Samat nii fa Paapaa atoom naawufanaam fa <char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> fo lompo inci fáhin aluu nipiyeno pakati kikaw. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Ancuk innili innilaan niŋ inci pati cáwii ca citoom, inniyeno ti pilemeyu pa kati ínnihin kíiti miin ma ŋaasuwan niŋ músupak ma miti <char style="w">Israyel</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaman ka kiti Yéesu pilaaco pa piti Piyeer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Fiye, Yéesu naasok Simon: “Simon, Simon, síitan. <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ewufaneewufan kayine kiti káahaafeen aluu samat nii uli, kápikatinool cácuuf ca niŋ kilehut ka. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Pale inci luumaaluum kitii ancuk káyinan ka kitii timpi kuñoho puson, niŋ áañohooniyoo peti inci impampaŋan pakani ti káyinan.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" /><char style="w">Piyeer</char> naasokoo: “<char style="w">Ahámpaatiin</char>, inci siiŋaasiiŋo pikaayu niŋ awe ti ékuluma háati eket niŋ awe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Piyeer, inci pusoki, fíyooy káayiin ekutoon kúlookum áafalaacin fo ñáhaaciil nii áameyiyam-méyi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mañ, epootak niŋ káakuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Púful toko Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Ta inci impoñe ta aluu peeyekanut mañ, peeyekanut epootak, peeyekanut pisamata púsupiyenu, weyme innitaakut po?” Nkasokoo: “Waah óo waah nuutaake po.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Naasokii: “Fiye, an eetaake mañ naacoopool mo, aŋa lompo eetaake epootak naacoopool yo, aŋa eetaakut káakuntu anooman hísool ha hiteyoo henfakat ha naanoom koonool. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kaatuko inci pusok aluu: Heekiicee ha kutoom ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> fo hitaako. Hisok: <char style="qt">'Nkacokoo samat nii áhina heenaput.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Esayi 53:12</ref> </char></note> Pánipani, heekiicee ha ti inci efihitaako.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Pinapana pa pakateyoo nkasokoo: “<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ehe úkuntu úsupak.” Naasokii: “Fomaa.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 22:38">Kaluum ka kiti Yéesu ti cítintiŋ ca enca nkasok ca Olif</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Mount of Olives" file="LB00352B.TIF" size="col" loc="22:39-40" ref="22:38">Cítintiŋ ca enca nkasok ca Olif</figure> <verse eid="LUK 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yéesu náaful ti saatee ya apikaay pati cítintiŋ ca enca nkasok ca Olif samat nii fa naasale fa íhinu. Pinapana pa pakateyoo nkanapool neyoo. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Kapucol po, naasokii: “Niluum timpi ninow ti híluuŋu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Naateeŋo caahinkiŋ ápilaaŋii, náakilipo, naaluum: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Paapaa, niŋ súumuu, fúlan elontoŋ ya eti kúnuul enke ti inci, apan timpi yeno ti pálafi pa putoom, pale ti pitii pa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" /><char style="w">Maleekoo</char> néefulii alacana epipenanoo sempe. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ti oom kúnuul kenfakat Yéesu naapenan kaluum meemak fo hásuwat ha hiteyoo níhifulii nihisotal t’etaam pucuk nii hísim.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Apílitoonii ti kaluum enkuu, náañohoonii peti pinapana pa pakateyoo náatookiyii ti hiŋotu kamma kúnuul. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Naacakanii: “Weyme uwune ínniyemi ti hiŋotu? Nilito inniluum ancuk timpi ninow ti híluuŋu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hicokuyee ha hiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yéesu ti káakup, kayoŋ nkúcolii teyoo. Ti kayoŋ ka, intaako toko <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pakati Pútuun</char>, niŋ ñíhampaatiin pakati púwuulu pa keeyeniye ka efaas <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, niŋ pakakee ñíhampaatiin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk akiicaakiic kikee kilim enke ti 5:52.</char></note>. Judas, akee ti pupoñapoñ pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka, anowii hátikin. Naaloh Yéesu kati asumpoo. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Pale Yéesu naasokoo: “Judas niŋ hisumpu ánfule ti inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>!”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Ta pinapana pa pakateyoo nkacuke ta heekaakaay ha pitaako nkacakanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, fo unii úfulanii úkuntu wa utoonii?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Akee teyii náañakii káakuntu ka kiteyoo naafiit cat kaanuu káali ka kiti amiikan a ati <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya enfakat a</char>. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Pale Yéesu naasok: “Nikat po, eehe hifomaa!” Náalik kaanuu áyiin a náakuuñan ko.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Fiye, Yéesu naasok ñíhampaatiin ña kéekeyii ka hicokuyoo: “Fo inci akanca? Weyme ínnikeyii ti inci niŋ úkuntu niŋ kifiin? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Hinak óo hinak inci iyyeniye niŋ aluu ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, nicokutam. Pale, caanak ence citaaluu niŋ citi sempe sa siti énimaan ya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káalaacin ka kiti Piyeer kameye Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Fiye, nkacok Yéesu, nkacoopoo la ti ekumpaan ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa</char>. <char style="w">Piyeer</char> ti pílaaŋ naayeniyii kanapan. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Nkacokan seemak senfakat ti pututa hank ha nkayeno kápikiipool so, Piyeer naayeno neyii. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Amiikan aal naacukoo naayeniye toko pukol seemak sa. Naasincanoo púsooni naasok: “Ayíin aŋe lompo ayenaayeno niŋ Yéesu!” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Pale Piyeer náalaacin ho naasok: “Iññáayuu, inci míitoo!” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Pifiyo caahinkiŋ, akee naacukoo naasok: “Awe lompo akee ti pinapana pa pakateyoo!” Piyeer naasok: “Haani, inci neetaat.” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Máamun etalaŋ yoonool eemuuse, akee naaŋiino ti hisoku: “Pánipani áyiin aŋe ayenaayeno niŋ Yéesu kaatuko akina lompo ati <char style="w">Galilee</char>!” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Piyeer naasok: “Haani, inci míit eeha ayyem ti hisoku!” Akina ti káakup, tokotoko káayiin ekutoon nkúlookii.<verse eid="LUK 22:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />
    <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> náayesoonii naasincan Piyeer caw. Piyeer náanawuno hilim eeha Ateeteyo naasokoo ha: “Fíyooy, káayiin ekutoon kúlookum áafalaacin fo ñáhaaciil nii áameyiyaam-méyi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Náaful tíkitaaŋ naakooŋ meemak niŋ kúnuul.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Pákayiin paka keeyeniye ka efaas Yéesu nkápalahooloo nkalenkenoo, nkasapoo. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Nkacenk ñíkinoo nkasokoo: “Yaamakool! Sok unii ayme ayemuu ti hisapu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Nkateñaloo niŋ hícump kikee kilim.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu hátikin píhina kíiti ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Cipilap, ñíhampaatiin ña pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char>, niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis nkaconcool. Yéesu náacoopiyee hátikinii. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Nkacakanoo: “Sok unii fo awe yem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa?” Yéesu naañahanii: “Niŋ inci ñahanaa aluu, étiniyinanam. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Niŋ inci cakanaa aluu, etiniñahanam. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Pale písik fíyooy, inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fayeno ti epees yáali eti Pútuun pa piti sempe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Poko púlooŋ nkacakanoo: “Awe aŋuu yem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa?” Yéesu naañahanii: “Aluu himuum aluu nisoke nii inci yem akina.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Fiye, nkasok: “Usoolahutaa hísiyu hiti akee eetantake! Usíyaasi ho ti putumoo!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yéesu hátikin Pilaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Ta nkapaye ta hísiyu Yéesu pákupaloo, ñíhampaatiin ña nkalito ti coonool, nkacoop Yéesu hátikin <char style="w">Pilaat</char>, ati hikaw ha ati <char style="w">Judaay</char>. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Kapucol nkáyaañoo hinooku nkasok: “Ayíin aŋe nuutooke ti kanoŋan pakan unaa, naakitii cooy kúncoo ya eti amansa ya enfakat a ati <char style="w">Room</char>,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amansa ya enfakat a nasokee <char style="w">Sesaal</char>. Ti oom caanak, amansa óo amansa enfakat ati Room nasokee Sesaal.</char></note> apan naasokoolo nii akina ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa, amansa ya.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilaat naacakan Yéesu: “Fo awe yem amansa ya ati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa?” Yéesu naañahanoo: “Awe soke ho.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilaat naasok <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ kayoŋ ka: “Inci cukut heewune áyiin aŋe kati áhinee kíiti.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Pale, nkaŋiino kapusok: “Ti pakalaŋanaloo naayem ti kanoŋan pakan paka. <char style="w">Galilee</char> náacookii, náanapii ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> púlooŋ, fiye ácoliyoo le.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu hátikin Helot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />
    <char style="w">Pilaat</char> ápisi eehe naacakan: “Fo áyiin aŋe ati <char style="w">Galilee</char>?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Ta náasiye ta nii Yéesu ti mah emma <char style="w">Helot</char> naayekane ma náafulii, naasokii kacoopoo pateyoo, ti oom caanak Helot naayeno <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helot ásiyaasi hiti Yéesu, náalafiyoo hicuku ta infiyye. Náayinan nii afaacukoo ti íhinu heecukantee. Fiye naacukoo, ínsuumoo meemak. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Naacakanooloo meemak, pale Yéesu añahanutoo máati poonool. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" /><char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis nkayeno toko nkanookoo niŋ sempe. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Helot niŋ pusoocaali pa pakateyoo, nkápalahool Yéesu nkalenkenoo nkáwiiniyanoo. Nkásooloo hísool heewalla nkañahanoo pati Pilaat. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Púcook puu, Pilaat niŋ Helot an niŋ akamooloo, pale hinoom eehuu nkáwiyool.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Fiye, <char style="w">Pilaat</char> naayonkal nantoonool <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char>, ñíhampaatiin ña niŋ pakan paka, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />naasokii: “Nícoopiyaam-coop áyiin aŋe innisok: 'Akina ayem ti kanoŋan pakan paka.' Nisincan, hátikin aluu inci incakanooloo ti eeha inninookoo ha, pale cukut heewune fanfaŋ kati áhinee kíiti. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Háati <char style="w">Helot</char> lompo acukut la naamuuyene, kamma náañahaniyoo unaa. Pánipani, áyiin aŋe áhinut waah ewwa efuuwun kati amukee. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ekina ewune, inci fáhin apisapee, nkatanoo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:16">[<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">An ámiit man Luk lompo akiice fiye: Fiye, awufaneewufan sempe siti kakatan oonool ti keecokee ka ti pahaaño pa piti Himuusu ha. Nisincan ti heekiice ha ti Mark 15:6.</char></note>] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ti coonool kayoŋ ka púlooŋ nkíceekii: “Mukoo! Inkatan unii Palapas!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Palapas akuleekul kamma naanoŋane pakan paka fo nkátaakoolane ñíhampaatiin saatee ya, naamuk an.) <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Fiye, Pilaat náalafi kakatan Yéesu, nene ákup niŋ kayoŋ ka. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Pale kayoŋ ka nkutowo ti hiceeku meemak: “Pempeŋoo ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>! Pempeŋoo ti kuluwaa!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Fiye, Pilaat naacakanii píhaaciyenu: “Weyme uwune? Eeheyme heenaput náahine? Inci cukut waah ewwa efuuwun kati amukee. Inci fáhin apisapee, nkatanoo.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Pale nkutowo ti kaaceeceekool kupusok: “Pempeŋoo ti kuluwaa!” Ti pikelan, kilimii nkihaŋ sempe. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Fiye, Pilaat naacoon íhinu eeha nkasokoo ha. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Naakatan Palapas, aŋa nkasokoo ya akatan, eekulee ya kamma naanoŋane pakan paka fo nkátaakoolane ñíhampaatiin saatee ya, naamuk an. Pale naawufan Yéesu pusoocaali pa kápihinoo samat nii fa <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkálafiye fa.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaapempeŋee ka kiti Yéesu ti kuluwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Ta nkayeniye ta hicoopu Yéesu, nkapaakool niŋ áyiin ati Silen aŋa nkasok Simon, eeyeniye énakoonii ti saatee ya. Pusoocaali pa nkacokoo, nkatiyanoo <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya apunow puson Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Kayoŋ kenfakat nkiyeniyoo kanapan, pakaal pakati <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> nkayeno pukooŋ niŋ esampoolo kiteyoo. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yéesu náayesoonii lipa teyii naasokii: “Pakaal <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, timpi nikooŋ kutoom, nikooŋ kitaaluu niŋ kiti epuuk aluu! <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Nisincan, caanak unca ti ékey ta efikasok ta: 'Kayihaa picaakonta pa, keetaapala kataak añii niŋ payenka taapala kácuuwan ka.' <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Ti oom caanak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="qt">'pakan paka efikasok pítintiŋ pa: "Nínowii toonii!" </char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="qt">niŋ mítintiŋ ma: "Níwufalool unii!"'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hoseya 10:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="LUK 23:30" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />“Kaatuko niŋ káhinaa pínapaati fiye ti enuun ya eemaaña ya, puume eficuk ti enuun ya eesuuce ya?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Nkacoopool lompo pikanca pákasupak kati kamukee ti coonool niŋ Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Kapucol la nkasok la “Esent”, pusoocaali pa nkapempeŋ Yéesu ti kuluwaa ya. Nkapempeŋ toko lompo pikanca pákasupak, akee ti epeesoo yáali, akee ya epeesoo yaamay. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yéesu naasok: “Paapaa, ponketii kamma nkámiit eeha nkayem ti íhinu.” Pusoocaali pa nkañak kaakaaw kápipaacinool wañ wa uteyoo.<figure style="fig" alt="Crucifixion" file="LB00328B.TIF" size="col" loc="22:33-34" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="23:34">Kaapempeŋee ka</figure><verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Kayoŋ ka nkiyeno toko kaasincan. Ñíhampaatiin <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkayeniyoo káapalahool nkalenkenoo, nkasok: “Pakakee pakan naafakane, afakanoolo, iyyema akina ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa, eemamalee ya”. <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Pusoocaali pa lompo nkayeniyoo caalenken, nkalohoo nkawufanoo elaan eesipe. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Nkasok: “Niŋ awe yem amansa ya ati Pusuwif pa, fakanoolo!” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Patiila ti hikawoo intaak pakiical peesoke: <char style="sc">Aŋe ayem amansa ya ati Pusuwif pa.</char><verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Akee ti pikanca pa eepempeŋee ya naateñaloo: “Fo aaneetaat Eenucee ya? Fakanoolo infakan lompo unii!” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Pale akee ya naafet teyoo naasok: “Aafeyut fala Pútuun, awe páyemali ti ñíseeña ña ñoonool ña ñiti eket ya neyoo? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Anii, páhinal kíiti ya etaanii ecoonoolaa-coonool kamma immaayemaa ti cooy páhinal anii peenaput pa, pale áyiin aŋe áhinut waah weenaput.”<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Naasok: “Yéesu, náwuniyam naayeniyaa ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya etii.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Inci pusoki pánipani ya: Hinoom ha hiti fíyooy aafayeno niŋ inci alacana.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eket ya eti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Máamun caanak ca ti hikaw, énimaan néewanoonii ti mah ma púlooŋ fo sitalaŋ síhaaciil, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />caanak ca inciyolo. Kahuuy ka kenfakat ka keeyem ka páhantuwa <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> nkihaaco ti pututa. <figure style="fig" alt="Curtain in temple torn in 2" file="LB00265B.TIF" size="col" loc="23:44-46" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="23:45">Kahuuy ka kiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa nkihaaco ti pututa</figure> <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yéesu náaceekii niŋ kaawiiluyoo, naasok: “Paapaa! Ti sipeesi inci iyyenane yaanam!” Apipa hisoku hilim eehuu, naasuuŋut pikelan. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ahámpaatiin asoocaali ya, apucuk eehuu náamul Pútuun pa, naasok: “Pánipani, áyiin aŋe <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">eecoonoole</char>!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Kayoŋ ka púlooŋ kéekeyii ka kaasincan kapucuk heetaakiye ha nkatiyo sipeesii, nkañoho niŋ esampoolo. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Yéesu pákawiyoo fiye púlooŋ niŋ pakaal paka kéenapoolii ka neyoo kápiliŋ <char style="w">Galilee</char> nkasiiŋo pílaaŋ, nkayeno kaasincan heetaakiye ha.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehok ya eti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Intaako áyiin caacawoo <char style="w">Josef</char>, ati saatee ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa eyya nkasok ya Alimataay. Ayíin eenape, <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">naacoonool</char>, naayeno hítuulu ékey ya eti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>. Naayeno akee ti ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya pale asayanut eeha pákawiyoo nkacoke ha, nkáhin. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Naakaay pati <char style="w">Pilaat</char> naacakanoo ehunuŋ ya eti Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Púful toko náawananii ehunuŋ ya ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya, naakuup yo niŋ kahuuy kiti ehok, naahok yo ti hiyaak heewakee ti énankiin la ammeya nii an ataapala ahokee. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Iyyeno hinoom hiti kaamemanool, le niŋ <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> kiti Pusuwif pa éfihiyaañ.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Pakaal paka kéenapoolii ka niŋ Yéesu kápiliŋ <char style="w">Galilee</char> nkanow ti Josef nkacuk hiyaak ha niŋ fa ehunuŋ ya neehintanee fa lupo. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Púful toko nkañoho pati saatee ya, nkamemanool munucu niŋ man méesuume haaw miti kaamaamool ehunuŋ ya. Ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka, nkáyekunoolo samat nii <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> fa nihisoke fa.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Pilito pa piti Yéesu ti eket ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Timaas ya nuulap, pakaal paka nkakaay pati hiyaak ha. Nkacoopool munucu ma niŋ man ma méesuume ma haaw emma nkamemanoole ma. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Incakatook énankiin ya eepantane ya hiyaak ha néepalinkanee. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Nkanako, pale kacukut ehunuŋ ya eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Kámiit fa éfikamiilool. Tokotoko, pákayiin pákasupak nkáfulii teyii niŋ wañ weemiñale tas. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Ewatate enfakat neeyeno neyii, nkásitan. Pákayiin paka payenkuu nkasokii: “Weyme uwune ínniyemi ti hiŋes ti keekete ka aŋa eeyem ya kaloŋa? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Aneetaat le, alitaneelitan ti keekete ka! Nínawuno eeha naasoke ha aluu ta naayeniye ta <char style="w">Galilee</char>: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />'Inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fo inci ufanee ti sipees pumuuyena pa. Fapempeŋee ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya, ti hinoom ha híhaaciyenu ha fálitoonii ti eket ya.'” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Fiye, nkánawuno kilim ka kiteyoo.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Pakaal paka páfulaliyii pati hiyaak ha, nkañoho, nkakaman eehuu <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa ŋaasuwan niŋ oonool a niŋ pakakee pinapana pa púlooŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Keekamane ka eehe pupoñapoñ pa kayem <char style="w">Mari</char> ati Makatala, Yowanna, Mari íññaa ya ati <char style="w">Saak</char> niŋ pakakee pakaal keeyeniye neyii. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Pale pupoñapoñ pa kacokut ho nii hilim heetaake hikaw, káyinanutii. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Toko fiyaaw, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naalito niŋ katey fo pati hiyaak ha, náacuuhan acukut ehunuŋ fo kahuuy ka kiti kahok ka lamma. Naañoho pateyoo, ínnimoo ti heetaakiye ha. <figure style="fig" alt="Peter at tomb" file="LB00329B.TIF" size="col" loc="23:12" copy="Knowles &amp; Bass" ref="24:12">Piyeer pati hiyaak ha</figure><verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pítin pa piti Emmawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Ti hinoom ha hoonool huu, pinapana pákasupak pakati Yéesu nkayeno pikaayu ti cisaatee enca nkasok Emmawus, ti pututa etenco niŋ <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> sikilomeetal ŋaasuwan niŋ yoonool. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Nkayeno kákupat heetaakiye ha púlooŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Ta nkayeniye ta kákupat niŋ pílaacinool, Yéesu himuumoo náakoliyii, naanapool neyii. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Nkacukoo pale waah nuukitii hikiiwuyoo.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yéesu naacakanii: “Weyme ínnikupat ti pítin aluu?” Nkasiiŋo niŋ páciiteyii. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Oonool teyii, caacawoo Kileyopas naasokoo: “Fo awe lamayi yem Jerusalem <char style="w">akaawoola</char> éemiit heetaakiye ha ti kunoom enke?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yéesu naacakanii: “Hikina hiyem eeheyme?” Nkañahanoo: “Heetaakiye ha Yéesu ati Naasalet. Ayenaayeno <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> enfakat hátikin Pútuun pa niŋ pakan paka púlooŋ, náhin páhinal penfakat, náakup niŋ sempe. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" /><char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakatuunaa nkawufanoo pakati <char style="w">Room</char> kati káhinoo kíiti nkamukoo, nkapempeŋoo ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Pale unii, núuyinan hínum nii akina akaakaay kafakan <char style="w">Israyel</char>. Apan ti eehe fiye púlooŋ, fíyooy yem hinoom ha híhaaciyenu ha ta eehe nihitaakiye ta. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Pakakee pakaal ti kayoŋ ka kutoonii nkaliimanool unii. Káfiisaafiis nuulap kapikaay pati hiyaak ha, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />kacukut ehunuŋ ya eteyoo. Nkáñohoonii, nkasok unii nii <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> nkacuke mpusokii nii oopa kaloŋa. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Pakakee ti kayoŋ ka kutoonii nkakaay pati hiyaak ha, nkatook samat nii pakaal paka fa nkasoke fa pale kacukut Yéesu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Fiye, Yéesu naasokii: “Aluu niyem pusoŋ, nicasut ti káyinan eeha púlooŋ piyaamakoola pa nkasoke ha! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Fo <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa añaŋut hicuku kúnuul enke apite anako ti hamake ha hiteyoo?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Púful toko, naayeniyii kakaman heesokee ha teyoo ti <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa">pakiical pa</char> púlooŋ piti Pútuun pa, ápucook ti pakiical pa piti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> fo ti pakiical pa piti piyaamakoola pa púlooŋ.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ta nkalohane ta cisaatee ca enca nkayeniye ca tenco pikaayu, Yéesu náahin fiye nii himuusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Pale nkaŋiiniyoo ti hisoku: “Yeno le niŋ unii, kamma ínciniimiye, apan caanak ca unca ti ékey hicoku.” Naanako, naayeno neyii. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Ta nkayeniye ta kati kali, naacoop hímpuul ha naasok Pútuun pa apalaka, naafiit ho naawufanii. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Ñíkinii íññipankino nkakiiwoo pale naayemaŋ teyii feles. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Nkasokoolo: “Fo saan anii sisaput ti pítin pa, ta náahine ta kunuu anii kípipankino ti heesokee ha ti pakiical pa piti Pútuun pa?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Tokotoko, nkalito mpacas, nkañoho Jerusalem. Incakatook <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa ŋaasuwan niŋ oonool a la nkaconcoole la niŋ pakakee paka, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />ti hisoku: “Pánipani, <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ayitaayito ti eket ya! Afúliyooful ti Simon!” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Pinapana pa pákasupak paka payenkuu, nkakamanii heetaakiyii ha ti pítin pa niŋ puume nkakiiwe Yéesu ta naafiite ta hímpuul ha.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efúlii ya eti Yéesu ti pinapana pa pakateyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Poko ti hisoku ha eehuu, Yéesu himuumoo náafulii ti pututayii naasokii: “Aluu kásuumaay!”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Nkáyolino, nkafe, incukii nii áfulaful nkacuke. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Pale Yéesu naasokii: “Weyme uwune inniliim? Weyme uwune innitaak pámiiloolal empuu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Nisincan sipeesam niŋ wootam, aŋe inci himuumam! Nílikam innisincanam! Afúlaful ataakut enii niŋ picec, inci taakaataak samat nii fa innicuke fa.” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ta naasoke ta eehuu, náayisanii sipeesoo niŋ wootoo. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Innímii nkameeŋ niŋ pásuuma fo nkáyinanut. Yéesu naacakanii: “Nitaakut le waah uti hili?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Nkawufanoo pífiitiin yoon eesowee. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Naacoop po, naali po hátikinii.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Fiye, Yéesu naasokii: “Ta inci iyyeniye ta niŋ aluu, sokaasok aluu: 'Heekiicee ha púlooŋ kutoom ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>, ti pakiical pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa niŋ ti pakiical pa piti Kícimu ka, eehuu púlooŋ fo hitaako.'” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Fiye, Yéesu náapankin kunuuwii kati kási <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa">pakiical pa piti Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Naasokii: “Ehe heekiicee ha: Fo <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa aket, ti hinoom ha híhaaciyenu ha náalitoonii ti eket ya. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Ehe eeha nkakaakaay ha káatuunan pakan paka púlooŋ, nkácook <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>: 'Níwunko umuuyen wa utaaluu Pútuun pa kati puponket wo aluu ti caacawoo.' <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Aluu niyem keetantake ka eehe púlooŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Inci fápoñii aluu eeha Paapaa atoom náayinanane ha. Pale fo niyeno ti saatee eyye fo ta sempe sa siti patiila éfisiwanoonii ti aluu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pisilo pa piti Yéesu alacana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Púful toko, Yéesu naacoop pinapana pa pakateyoo fo kalohan cisaatee ca citi Betani. Náaseepin sipeesoo naasampanii. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ta naayeniyii ta kaasampan, naakatanii, náaseepinee alacana.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus' ascension" file="CNT5851a.png" size="col" loc="24:50-53" copy="Cook" ref="24:51">Yéesu, ta naayeniyee ta káaseepinee alacana</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Pinapana pa pakateyoo nkákilipo, nkayeniyoo hímulu, nkañoho <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> niŋ pásuuma penfakat. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Nkayeno tan óo tan hímulu Pútuun pa ti <char style="w" lemma="Ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya</char>.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>